(274074, 18530, 2146, '<td valign="top">my fav. color</td>', 'my fav. color', '2003-04-23 01:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(274075, 19205, 6008, '<td valign="top">The washed out part of the background almost looks like it is coming out of his opened beak. There is some noise in the background, and the red on his face seems a little strange, but that could just be the texture - I''ll admit I''ve never been this close to one to see.</td>', 'The washed out part of the background almost looks like it is coming out of his opened beak. There is some noise in the background, and the red on his face seems a little strange, but that could just be the texture - I''ll admit I''ve never been this close to one to see.', '2003-04-23 01:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
