(274098, 18526, 92, '<td valign="top">This is the MOST amazing photo I''ve seen in a LONG time. The eyes are just so alive. You captured life which isn''t at all easy ! It looks like he/she could just swim right off the screen. The color and clairity are just superb ! I''m just in awe. A well deserved perfect 10 Good luck this week. This is a winner !</td>', 'This is the MOST amazing photo I''ve seen in a LONG time. The eyes are just so alive. You captured life which isn''t at all easy ! It looks like he/she could just swim right off the screen. The color and clairity are just superb ! I''m just in awe. A well deserved perfect 10 Good luck this week. This is a winner !', '2003-04-23 01:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
