(274110, 18942, 92, '<td valign="top">Nice use at leading lines and thirds.  My only change would be to crop out that top dirt area and let the top flat stones be the top edge. Really nice photo :)</td>', 'Nice use at leading lines and thirds.  My only change would be to crop out that top dirt area and let the top flat stones be the top edge. Really nice photo :)', '2003-04-23 01:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
