(274123, 19212, 92, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if I''ve ever seen a squirrel on a beach. That''s too cool. I spend a lot of time on the beach and this is a first :) Nice use of thirds.</td>', 'I don''t know if I''ve ever seen a squirrel on a beach. That''s too cool. I spend a lot of time on the beach and this is a first :) Nice use of thirds.', '2003-04-23 01:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
