(274154, 18927, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and detail on the snail that we see.  I like the placement of him in the picture.  I only wish I could see more of his shell because I think that''s the most interesting part.  8   Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice DOF and detail on the snail that we see.  I like the placement of him in the picture.  I only wish I could see more of his shell because I think that''s the most interesting part.  8   Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-23 01:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
