(274160, 18981, 7067, '<td valign="top">[Comment only]  Oh boy, that date really ruins a promising picture.  Disable that feature the next time you want to shoot to submit to DPC.  Another thing to look out for would be making the horizon perfectly horizontal.  Your exposure is good here, as are focus and composition.  However, the bird is so small in the frame that this image really is more of a landscape than a fauna picture.</td>', '[Comment only]  Oh boy, that date really ruins a promising picture.  Disable that feature the next time you want to shoot to submit to DPC.  Another thing to look out for would be making the horizon perfectly horizontal.  Your exposure is good here, as are focus and composition.  However, the bird is so small in the frame that this image really is more of a landscape than a fauna picture.', '2003-04-23 01:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(274161, 18311, 2146, '<td valign="top">now thats sweet...very pretty</td>', 'now thats sweet...very pretty', '2003-04-23 01:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(274162, 18898, 714, '<td valign="top">I love the depth of field.  Great colors and expression.  Vote 10</td>', 'I love the depth of field.  Great colors and expression.  Vote 10', '2003-04-23 01:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(274163, 19054, 2146, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2003-04-23 01:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(274165, 18808, 2146, '<td valign="top">oh how cute, I want one..</td>', 'oh how cute, I want one..', '2003-04-23 01:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(274166, 18688, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color ! The light is great. No washout/overblown color. Really well done. The texture of the soft wings against the rock is nice :)</td>', 'Beautiful color ! The light is great. No washout/overblown color. Really well done. The texture of the soft wings against the rock is nice :)', '2003-04-23 01:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(274167, 19164, 7711, '<td valign="top">you should use more of your pixels, that way we''d see more detail on the buzzard.<br/></td>', 'you should use more of your pixels, that way we''d see more detail on the buzzard.', '2003-04-23 01:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(274168, 18368, 3669, '<td valign="top">Having done a lot of deer shots, I know how hard it is to make them clear.  It''s difficult to get close enough for a good photo since they spook so easily.  It''s too bad that they were in the shade of the trees because they are a little dark but you can see their faces nicely.   A very good attempt and definately meets the challenge.  Good Luck!</td>', 'Having done a lot of deer shots, I know how hard it is to make them clear.  It''s difficult to get close enough for a good photo since they spook so easily.  It''s too bad that they were in the shade of the trees because they are a little dark but you can see their faces nicely.   A very good attempt and definately meets the challenge.  Good Luck!', '2003-04-23 01:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(274169, 19043, 2146, '<td valign="top">Yep they still look like Ted Danson....love those emu''s</td>', 'Yep they still look like Ted Danson....love those emu''s', '2003-04-23 01:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
