(274188, 18923, 2586, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot. The expression adn pose of the left monkey reminds me of a Zen monk :) The beauty of the image is in the left side: good lighting, nice light/shadow play on the big rock, nice texture. The other monkey suffered from poorer light and that almost gives it an abstract quality; still i like that second monkey. The background behind the second monkey is even more abstract. Congrats on originality of choice. 8 Journey</td>', 'I like this image a lot. The expression adn pose of the left monkey reminds me of a Zen monk :) The beauty of the image is in the left side: good lighting, nice light/shadow play on the big rock, nice texture. The other monkey suffered from poorer light and that almost gives it an abstract quality; still i like that second monkey. The background behind the second monkey is even more abstract. Congrats on originality of choice. 8 Journey', '2003-04-23 01:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
