(274294, 18444, 2586, '<td valign="top">For survival reason''s the colors of the bird blend in well with his environment. That also makes him harder to photograph. It would have helped a great deal if you had been able to throw the background totally out of focus. This would also made the picture less busy.As it is, part of his head disappears into the background. 5 Journey</td>', 'For survival reason''s the colors of the bird blend in well with his environment. That also makes him harder to photograph. It would have helped a great deal if you had been able to throw the background totally out of focus. This would also made the picture less busy.As it is, part of his head disappears into the background. 5 Journey', '2003-04-23 02:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(274295, 18981, 3669, '<td valign="top">I know that you''ll get a lot of comments on this and sorry about that...but you must turn off the date stamp on your camera.  This is a BEAUTIFUL photo, but I know that it will not score as it should because everyone will pick on the time stamp.</td>', 'I know that you''ll get a lot of comments on this and sorry about that...but you must turn off the date stamp on your camera.  This is a BEAUTIFUL photo, but I know that it will not score as it should because everyone will pick on the time stamp.', '2003-04-23 02:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
