(274314, 19048, 3669, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, they are in the shadows and it''s hard to see the animals, especially the little guy.  Judging from the placement of the shadow of the mom, it looks like it''s high noon...perhaps waiting just a little later in the day would have helped.</td>', 'Unfortunately, they are in the shadows and it''s hard to see the animals, especially the little guy.  Judging from the placement of the shadow of the mom, it looks like it''s high noon...perhaps waiting just a little later in the day would have helped.', '2003-04-23 02:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
