(274353, 19133, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very cute photo here of the birds.  You wonder what they are actually up to.  Nicely focused.  Shows good detail and depth.  I kind of wish I could have seen a little more of the birds and a little less of the green at the top.  Their back ends and feet are cut off.  My only complaint.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very cute photo here of the birds.  You wonder what they are actually up to.  Nicely focused.  Shows good detail and depth.  I kind of wish I could have seen a little more of the birds and a little less of the green at the top.  Their back ends and feet are cut off.  My only complaint.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-23 02:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
