(274480, 18736, 51167, '<td valign="top">what the freak is that thing???  It kind of looks like a huge octopus, but I''m not sure.  Without knowing, I don''t think I''d want to be in the water.</td>', 'what the freak is that thing???  It kind of looks like a huge octopus, but I''m not sure.  Without knowing, I don''t think I''d want to be in the water.', '2003-04-23 03:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
