(274483, 18441, 5728, '<td valign="top">This shot would have done excellently in the flora challenge, it is very good! It somehow doesn''t fit to the fauna challenge though, what a pity.</td>', 'This shot would have done excellently in the flora challenge, it is very good! It somehow doesn''t fit to the fauna challenge though, what a pity.', '2003-04-23 03:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(274484, 19132, 51167, '<td valign="top">I love the DOF on this one,  just wish it was a tad brighter on the bug.  The leaf is amazing.</td>', 'I love the DOF on this one,  just wish it was a tad brighter on the bug.  The leaf is amazing.', '2003-04-23 03:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(274485, 19189, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... eggs are too high in the pic.  There''s too much of the blurry part of the nest, instead of showing more of the in focus part of the nest.  Still a 7 for a creative twist.</td>', 'Nice shot... eggs are too high in the pic.  There''s too much of the blurry part of the nest, instead of showing more of the in focus part of the nest.  Still a 7 for a creative twist.', '2003-04-23 03:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(274486, 18735, 5728, '<td valign="top">That''s close! And he looks angry at you for taking his pic. I hope you apologised. Good composition and I love that deep dark brown of his coat.</td>', 'That''s close! And he looks angry at you for taking his pic. I hope you apologised. Good composition and I love that deep dark brown of his coat.', '2003-04-23 03:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(274487, 18798, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lovely macro. Your subject is full in focus and the detail is very good. You can be proud of this pic.</td>', 'Lovely macro. Your subject is full in focus and the detail is very good. You can be proud of this pic.', '2003-04-23 03:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(274488, 18380, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice color combinations. The water and glass must be very clean I can''t see any sign of them, well done - 9.</td>', 'Nice color combinations. The water and glass must be very clean I can''t see any sign of them, well done - 9.', '2003-04-23 03:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(274489, 18911, 51167, '<td valign="top">I love the sky in this one.  Very beautiful.  The composition is great.  Did you zoom in one this one.  The hill behind the horse seems a little squished making the image feel slightly flat.  The colors and everything are beautiful and I like it a lot.</td>', 'I love the sky in this one.  Very beautiful.  The composition is great.  Did you zoom in one this one.  The hill behind the horse seems a little squished making the image feel slightly flat.  The colors and everything are beautiful and I like it a lot.', '2003-04-23 03:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(274490, 18962, 4494, '<td valign="top">I love the black &amp; white against the green grass... but, you should have shown a little more of the zebra (not much more) and more of the nose.  Great shot!  8.</td>', 'I love the black & white against the green grass... but, you should have shown a little more of the zebra (not much more) and more of the nose.  Great shot!  8.', '2003-04-23 03:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(274491, 18334, 5728, '<td valign="top">He looks angry! Cool capture and well composed. The detail in the hippo is very good, he''s full in focus - 9.</td>', 'He looks angry! Cool capture and well composed. The detail in the hippo is very good, he''s full in focus - 9.', '2003-04-23 03:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(274492, 19049, 3669, '<td valign="top">I love the expression on this guy''s face.  Too bad about the wire fencing going accross the picture.  Otherwise, a very nice photo.</td>', 'I love the expression on this guy''s face.  Too bad about the wire fencing going accross the picture.  Otherwise, a very nice photo.', '2003-04-23 03:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(274493, 19051, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great capture, I never knew geese had teeth. The reflection is awesome - 9.</td>', 'Great capture, I never knew geese had teeth. The reflection is awesome - 9.', '2003-04-23 03:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(274494, 18911, 4494, '<td valign="top">Great angle on the horse.  Really makes a difference in the impact of this shot.  7.</td>', 'Great angle on the horse.  Really makes a difference in the impact of this shot.  7.', '2003-04-23 03:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(274495, 18447, 51167, '<td valign="top">oh wow.  I love this shot.  The detail is amazing.  You composition is perfect.  Is this full framed or cropped?  I''d like to know, cause if it''s full frame and you used a macro lens, I''m going to need to invest in one.</td>', 'oh wow.  I love this shot.  The detail is amazing.  You composition is perfect.  Is this full framed or cropped?  I''d like to know, cause if it''s full frame and you used a macro lens, I''m going to need to invest in one.', '2003-04-23 03:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(274496, 18950, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great capture! I bet it took you a lot of shots to get such a good one as this right? You froze him so well it doesn''t even look like he is flying, everything is so sharp and focused. You can be proud of this image.</td>', 'Great capture! I bet it took you a lot of shots to get such a good one as this right? You froze him so well it doesn''t even look like he is flying, everything is so sharp and focused. You can be proud of this image.', '2003-04-23 03:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(274497, 19113, 4767, '<td valign="top">reminds me of a postcard by Robert Pisko.  Similar pose of these critters, but b&amp;w.</td>', 'reminds me of a postcard by Robert Pisko.  Similar pose of these critters, but b&w.', '2003-04-23 03:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(274498, 19049, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL, looks like my wife''s grand-mother. JK, :D   The wires are really destracting.  Too bad you couldn''t zoom in on the head to avoid them.</td>', 'LOL, looks like my wife''s grand-mother. JK, :D   The wires are really destracting.  Too bad you couldn''t zoom in on the head to avoid them.', '2003-04-23 03:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(274499, 18456, 5728, '<td valign="top">The lighting, the detail, the composition. Everything is excellent, well done!</td>', 'The lighting, the detail, the composition. Everything is excellent, well done!', '2003-04-23 03:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(274500, 19133, 51167, '<td valign="top">I totally love your title.  This is an awesome shot.</td>', 'I totally love your title.  This is an awesome shot.', '2003-04-23 03:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(274501, 18928, 2586, '<td valign="top">Oh, how i love to see this action of Can. geese flying away and oink, oink, oink along. You captured it so well! Pleasure to look at. Lighting is perfect. Motion of the wings is perfect.  Combination of water and background the perfect foil for the geese. The brownish blurred background makes me go ape. Great shot. 10 Journey</td>', 'Oh, how i love to see this action of Can. geese flying away and oink, oink, oink along. You captured it so well! Pleasure to look at. Lighting is perfect. Motion of the wings is perfect.  Combination of water and background the perfect foil for the geese. The brownish blurred background makes me go ape. Great shot. 10 Journey', '2003-04-23 03:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(274502, 19018, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good capture, the cropping you decided on is very effective. I love the texture of the water, well done.</td>', 'Good capture, the cropping you decided on is very effective. I love the texture of the water, well done.', '2003-04-23 03:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(274503, 18554, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! The DOF has isolated your subject perfectly. The color combination is awesome, an excellent image.</td>', 'Wonderful! The DOF has isolated your subject perfectly. The color combination is awesome, an excellent image.', '2003-04-23 03:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(274504, 18647, 3669, '<td valign="top">Probably could have cropped a little closer.  Birds are kind of far away with a bleak sky that makes for a lot of wasted space.</td>', 'Probably could have cropped a little closer.  Birds are kind of far away with a bleak sky that makes for a lot of wasted space.', '2003-04-23 03:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(274505, 19148, 51167, '<td valign="top">Love the pose.  Great shot on the eagle.  Bald Eagle''s are my favorite bird.</td>', 'Love the pose.  Great shot on the eagle.  Bald Eagle''s are my favorite bird.', '2003-04-23 03:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(274507, 18609, 5728, '<td valign="top">This guy is amazingly cute. You got a great capture here. The lighting is good, maybe a little more saturation would have brought out the colors a bit more, but it is still very good - 9.</td>', 'This guy is amazingly cute. You got a great capture here. The lighting is good, maybe a little more saturation would have brought out the colors a bit more, but it is still very good - 9.', '2003-04-23 03:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(274508, 18503, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, good lighting and DOF. The flow of the heron''s body and neck into the middle of the pic is very effective - 9.</td>', 'Excellent composition, good lighting and DOF. The flow of the heron''s body and neck into the middle of the pic is very effective - 9.', '2003-04-23 03:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(274509, 18800, 6388, '<td valign="top">very nice.</td>', 'very nice.', '2003-04-23 03:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(274510, 18884, 4494, '<td valign="top">Should have included all of the reflection, but still excellent.  Great title, describing the animal also.  Amazing, you can even see the feet because the water is so calm.  8!</td>', 'Should have included all of the reflection, but still excellent.  Great title, describing the animal also.  Amazing, you can even see the feet because the water is so calm.  8!', '2003-04-23 03:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(274511, 18693, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice position of the bird in the picture.  I''m just not crazy about the manipulation of the colors in post-pocessing.  I would really like to see this in its natural colors.  I think it would be a whole lot more appealing.</td>', 'Nice position of the bird in the picture.  I''m just not crazy about the manipulation of the colors in post-pocessing.  I would really like to see this in its natural colors.  I think it would be a whole lot more appealing.', '2003-04-23 03:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(274512, 19063, 5728, '<td valign="top">I''m not really a big fan of dog pics, but you have done an amazing job with this one. The composition is excellent, the softness and lighting together have turned this into a pic I would expect to find done by professionals. You can be very proud of this shot.</td>', 'I''m not really a big fan of dog pics, but you have done an amazing job with this one. The composition is excellent, the softness and lighting together have turned this into a pic I would expect to find done by professionals. You can be very proud of this shot.', '2003-04-23 03:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(274513, 18435, 5728, '<td valign="top">All I can say is "beautiful". You have captured this excellently, well done! There isn''t anything at all I can criticize about it - 10.</td>', 'All I can say is "beautiful". You have captured this excellently, well done! There isn''t anything at all I can criticize about it - 10.', '2003-04-23 03:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(274514, 18515, 4494, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Kind of a stretch... Would be like a pic of an Elephant in the "Flora" challenge titled "Flora eater". :)</td>', 'Hmmm.  Kind of a stretch... Would be like a pic of an Elephant in the "Flora" challenge titled "Flora eater". :)', '2003-04-23 03:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(274515, 18878, 51167, '<td valign="top">Nice snake,  they are awesome.</td>', 'Nice snake,  they are awesome.', '2003-04-23 03:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(274516, 19098, 6388, '<td valign="top">are those real sheep?  :)</td>', 'are those real sheep?  :)', '2003-04-23 03:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(274517, 18441, 6388, '<td valign="top">oops.</td>', 'oops.', '2003-04-23 03:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(274518, 18800, 3669, '<td valign="top">Excellent!!  The lighting on this bird could not have been more perfect.  He is well focused and shows great detail and clarity.  I''m very impressed!  You should do well in this challenge...Good luck!!  10</td>', 'Excellent!!  The lighting on this bird could not have been more perfect.  He is well focused and shows great detail and clarity.  I''m very impressed!  You should do well in this challenge...Good luck!!  10', '2003-04-23 03:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(274519, 19019, 6388, '<td valign="top">hard to make one of these guys look good...but you did. nice job.</td>', 'hard to make one of these guys look good...but you did. nice job.', '2003-04-23 03:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(274520, 18718, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty interesting... Nice shot of "it". :)</td>', 'Pretty interesting... Nice shot of "it". :)', '2003-04-23 04:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(274521, 18957, 3669, '<td valign="top">I like how the bird is well framed by the foilage.  I think maybe this photo could possibly be cropped just a little closer.  Otherwise, I very nice picture.</td>', 'I like how the bird is well framed by the foilage.  I think maybe this photo could possibly be cropped just a little closer.  Otherwise, I very nice picture.', '2003-04-23 04:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(274522, 19028, 6388, '<td valign="top">asiatic water dragon.  captive by the look of her poor snout.  nice capture.</td>', 'asiatic water dragon.  captive by the look of her poor snout.  nice capture.', '2003-04-23 04:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(274523, 18362, 6388, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful dog.  his owner should be proud.  as should he.</td>', 'what a beautiful dog.  his owner should be proud.  as should he.', '2003-04-23 04:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(274524, 18636, 4494, '<td valign="top">Don''t get the title.  Shot is OK.</td>', 'Don''t get the title.  Shot is OK.', '2003-04-23 04:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(274525, 18955, 4494, '<td valign="top">I like it.  I''ll watch how this one does.  7.</td>', 'I like it.  I''ll watch how this one does.  7.', '2003-04-23 04:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(274527, 18686, 3669, '<td valign="top">I like the muted colors in this photo.  The landscape is georgeous.  It is nicely framed.  Maybe just a tad over-sharpened, but not real bad once I back away from the screen a little.  Definately meets the challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like the muted colors in this photo.  The landscape is georgeous.  It is nicely framed.  Maybe just a tad over-sharpened, but not real bad once I back away from the screen a little.  Definately meets the challenge.  Good luck!', '2003-04-23 04:05:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(274529, 18442, 3669, '<td valign="top">I''ve been sitting here trying to figure out what caused all the white dots all over the picture.  They are really annoying.</td>', 'I''ve been sitting here trying to figure out what caused all the white dots all over the picture.  They are really annoying.', '2003-04-23 04:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(274530, 18930, 4494, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot... Too bad that tree wasn''t over to the right or not there.   Love the focus of the bird and stick that he''s on.  8.</td>', 'Sweet shot... Too bad that tree wasn''t over to the right or not there.   Love the focus of the bird and stick that he''s on.  8.', '2003-04-23 04:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(274531, 19211, 3669, '<td valign="top">This is a very BEAUTIFUL picture and would probably win in a different challenge or at least score high.  I don''t see any animals here and I know that this won''t get the score this picture deserves.</td>', 'This is a very BEAUTIFUL picture and would probably win in a different challenge or at least score high.  I don''t see any animals here and I know that this won''t get the score this picture deserves.', '2003-04-23 04:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(274532, 18444, 3669, '<td valign="top">This bird, unfortunately, gets lost in the foilage.  Narrowing your focus would blurr out some of the background.  The lighting seems a bit harsh.</td>', 'This bird, unfortunately, gets lost in the foilage.  Narrowing your focus would blurr out some of the background.  The lighting seems a bit harsh.', '2003-04-23 04:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(274533, 18736, 4494, '<td valign="top">Is that a great white shark!  You are brave!  Very nice colors in this shot.</td>', 'Is that a great white shark!  You are brave!  Very nice colors in this shot.', '2003-04-23 04:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(274534, 18402, 4494, '<td valign="top">Not enought emphasis on the bug. :(  I can barely see it.</td>', 'Not enought emphasis on the bug. :(  I can barely see it.', '2003-04-23 04:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(274535, 18565, 3669, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture and the lighting couldn''t have been more perfect.  Nicely focused.  Shows great depth...like one step to the right and he could fall off.  I almost get dizzy just looking at it.</td>', 'Excellent capture and the lighting couldn''t have been more perfect.  Nicely focused.  Shows great depth...like one step to the right and he could fall off.  I almost get dizzy just looking at it.', '2003-04-23 04:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(274536, 18969, 4494, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what that is.  The lighting is really cool, with the black in the upper right, but I can NOT tell what the subject is at all.</td>', 'I can''t tell what that is.  The lighting is really cool, with the black in the upper right, but I can NOT tell what the subject is at all.', '2003-04-23 04:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(274537, 19136, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice effect of motion.</td>', 'Nice effect of motion.', '2003-04-23 04:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(274538, 19202, 3669, '<td valign="top">Out of all the pictures of the canadian geese, this one is my favorite.  The bird is positioned nicely in the picture.  It is well focused, showing nice detail and clarity.  The reflection is perfect.  The colors are go together nicely.  Nothing seems to be out of place.  Well done...10  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Out of all the pictures of the canadian geese, this one is my favorite.  The bird is positioned nicely in the picture.  It is well focused, showing nice detail and clarity.  The reflection is perfect.  The colors are go together nicely.  Nothing seems to be out of place.  Well done...10  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-23 04:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(274539, 18310, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  The vivid reflection is great.  Not an animal but I still like it. :)</td>', 'Nice colors.  The vivid reflection is great.  Not an animal but I still like it. :)', '2003-04-23 04:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(274540, 18433, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow that is so cool... the DOF is amazing.  I love the blurry foreground and the color is great.</td>', 'Wow that is so cool... the DOF is amazing.  I love the blurry foreground and the color is great.', '2003-04-23 04:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(274541, 18380, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very cool colors in this.  Good job getting that right and making it interesting.  7.</td>', 'Very cool colors in this.  Good job getting that right and making it interesting.  7.', '2003-04-23 04:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(274543, 18545, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, I love these creatures! Your DOF works well here. The main subject is a little too centered but still good - 9.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, I love these creatures! Your DOF works well here. The main subject is a little too centered but still good - 9.', '2003-04-23 04:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(274544, 18676, 7067, '<td valign="top">[Comment only]  Is that a rat?  If so, I never knew rats could look so cute.  Maybe I think so only because it''s rat tail is not visible... that''s a plus in my books ;-)  Good idea and executed fairly well.  The only thing I would change is maybe shoot at a slightly higher angle.  Right now my eyes are drawn to the bulb of the pitcher first.</td>', '[Comment only]  Is that a rat?  If so, I never knew rats could look so cute.  Maybe I think so only because it''s rat tail is not visible... that''s a plus in my books ;-)  Good idea and executed fairly well.  The only thing I would change is maybe shoot at a slightly higher angle.  Right now my eyes are drawn to the bulb of the pitcher first.', '2003-04-23 04:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(274545, 19161, 4494, '<td valign="top">Doh, you cut off his foot!  Great shot but that''s a big mistake.  Great shot otherwise.  7.</td>', 'Doh, you cut off his foot!  Great shot but that''s a big mistake.  Great shot otherwise.  7.', '2003-04-23 04:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(274547, 18721, 7369, '<td valign="top">The title is so correct; pigeons are big source of diseases :). Now about your picture, I like the idea the photo suggests (maybe that''s because I''m not so fond of pigeons) and the way you''ve captured the motion. On the other hand there is a little too much motion in it; nothing is really in focus (I realize that this was a very difficult shot to make).</td>', 'The title is so correct; pigeons are big source of diseases :). Now about your picture, I like the idea the photo suggests (maybe that''s because I''m not so fond of pigeons) and the way you''ve captured the motion. On the other hand there is a little too much motion in it; nothing is really in focus (I realize that this was a very difficult shot to make).', '2003-04-23 04:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(274548, 18575, 7067, '<td valign="top">[Comment only]  Oh wow, the texture depicted in this photo makes it look so real.  I feel as if I can reach into the image and stroke the soft cuddly looking koala.  And gosh isn''t it just so darn cute?</td>', '[Comment only]  Oh wow, the texture depicted in this photo makes it look so real.  I feel as if I can reach into the image and stroke the soft cuddly looking koala.  And gosh isn''t it just so darn cute?', '2003-04-23 04:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(274549, 19057, 4494, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot, but the title isn''t too good (too long).  What is really interesting about this shot is the guy in the middle who is perfectly still with the others around him that are moving.  Like to know the apprature and shutter speed you used because the lighting is perfect.  8.<br/></td>', 'Really cool shot, but the title isn''t too good (too long).  What is really interesting about this shot is the guy in the middle who is perfectly still with the others around him that are moving.  Like to know the apprature and shutter speed you used because the lighting is perfect.  8.', '2003-04-23 04:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(274550, 18905, 7067, '<td valign="top">[Comment only]  Very soothing, tranquil capture.  Composition is excellent, though I might have extended the length a little bit more.  I see the photo is at 630x480.  I would have gone the full 640x480 without the use of a border or at least not one so heavy looking.  The two ducks in the background add a nice second point of focus.</td>', '[Comment only]  Very soothing, tranquil capture.  Composition is excellent, though I might have extended the length a little bit more.  I see the photo is at 630x480.  I would have gone the full 640x480 without the use of a border or at least not one so heavy looking.  The two ducks in the background add a nice second point of focus.', '2003-04-23 04:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(274551, 18349, 5728, '<td valign="top">The tight crop works here, wonderful! The eyes are awesome, that orange is amazing, combines well with the greays.</td>', 'The tight crop works here, wonderful! The eyes are awesome, that orange is amazing, combines well with the greays.', '2003-04-23 04:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(274552, 19148, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, the eagle''s expression is so cool. You captured this one very well!</td>', 'Excellent shot, the eagle''s expression is so cool. You captured this one very well!', '2003-04-23 04:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(274553, 18503, 4494, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the perfectly lit bird and background.  And thank you for using a title that descibes the bird!  9.</td>', 'I love the contrast between the perfectly lit bird and background.  And thank you for using a title that descibes the bird!  9.', '2003-04-23 04:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(274554, 19198, 5728, '<td valign="top">I just love this pic, the greens and yellows are so crisp and vivid. The DOF is shallow and blurs out the background in such a way that your main subject is lifted and highlighted. Good job.</td>', 'I just love this pic, the greens and yellows are so crisp and vivid. The DOF is shallow and blurs out the background in such a way that your main subject is lifted and highlighted. Good job.', '2003-04-23 04:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(274555, 18856, 7067, '<td valign="top">[Comment only]  Fantastic clarity in focus and colours here.  Shallow DOF works well.  My one suggestion is to compose the picture so that the subject is not right at the middle or recrop the final image.  But I know that''s not always so simple to do as it''s not easy to get close enough to snap a well photographed image of a butterfly (or other small insect or bird) before it flutters (crawls or flies) away.</td>', '[Comment only]  Fantastic clarity in focus and colours here.  Shallow DOF works well.  My one suggestion is to compose the picture so that the subject is not right at the middle or recrop the final image.  But I know that''s not always so simple to do as it''s not easy to get close enough to snap a well photographed image of a butterfly (or other small insect or bird) before it flutters (crawls or flies) away.', '2003-04-23 04:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(274556, 18606, 2586, '<td valign="top">It is a nice picture but it seems more a portrait of a fine tree and the cows happen to be incidental. Also lacks a little in contrast. 5 Journey</td>', 'It is a nice picture but it seems more a portrait of a fine tree and the cows happen to be incidental. Also lacks a little in contrast. 5 Journey', '2003-04-23 04:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
