(275033, 19211, 6999, '<td valign="top">Er, termites, I guess, yes? Good shot, but it seems really SMALL. Obviously it''s sized OK, but there''s perhaps too much around the mound, and not enough OF it? Somehow, it isn''t about the termite mounds, but about the sky, if you see what I mean.</td>', 'Er, termites, I guess, yes? Good shot, but it seems really SMALL. Obviously it''s sized OK, but there''s perhaps too much around the mound, and not enough OF it? Somehow, it isn''t about the termite mounds, but about the sky, if you see what I mean.', '2003-04-23 11:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
