(275203, 18402, 7510, '<td valign="top">It is very hart to find the subject in this photo.  If you could have placed him lower on the Flower so you can see the bug better (just kidding).  Also the wilted flower is not very pleasing to look at.  I don''t understand your title.  But maybe that just me.</td>', 'It is very hart to find the subject in this photo.  If you could have placed him lower on the Flower so you can see the bug better (just kidding).  Also the wilted flower is not very pleasing to look at.  I don''t understand your title.  But maybe that just me.', '2003-04-23 13:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(275204, 19072, 7800, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image. It bothers me a bit that you cut off his nose. I wonder about a vertical crop.</td>', 'Nice sharp image. It bothers me a bit that you cut off his nose. I wonder about a vertical crop.', '2003-04-23 13:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
