(275210, 19187, 7800, '<td valign="top">What a great catch! The duck is nice and sharp. I wish its colors didn''t blend so much into the water but what can you do?? Good job!</td>', 'What a great catch! The duck is nice and sharp. I wish its colors didn''t blend so much into the water but what can you do?? Good job!', '2003-04-23 13:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
