(275218, 19042, 7510, '<td valign="top">I know photographing into an aquarium can be difficult.  The Fish on the left is in focus, but since it is swimming away I would have prefered that the other lion fish had the focus.</td>', 'I know photographing into an aquarium can be difficult.  The Fish on the left is in focus, but since it is swimming away I would have prefered that the other lion fish had the focus.', '2003-04-23 13:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
