(275226, 19154, 7800, '<td valign="top">I like where you placed the bird in the frame giving his gaze plenty of room to travel.  I think it would have been perfect if you could have gotten his whole body in the frame, but sometimes this is easier said than done. Good job!</td>', 'I like where you placed the bird in the frame giving his gaze plenty of room to travel.  I think it would have been perfect if you could have gotten his whole body in the frame, but sometimes this is easier said than done. Good job!', '2003-04-23 13:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
