(275254, 18808, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful comp and colours.  I love how the reddish tail shows behind the leaves to the left.  (9)</td>', 'Beautiful comp and colours.  I love how the reddish tail shows behind the leaves to the left.  (9)', '2003-04-23 13:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
