(275260, 19198, 5112, '<td valign="top">Stuff like that REALLY come to your backyard?  I''m impressed.  I love the greens, very nice.</td>', 'Stuff like that REALLY come to your backyard?  I''m impressed.  I love the greens, very nice.', '2003-04-23 13:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(275261, 18765, 6230, '<td valign="top">Great macro. Is the bee real and alive???</td>', 'Great macro. Is the bee real and alive???', '2003-04-23 13:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(275264, 18803, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty focus, light. Great lens....clean, clear. Sweet.</td>', 'Pretty focus, light. Great lens....clean, clear. Sweet.', '2003-04-23 13:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(275266, 18747, 7628, '<td valign="top">The green show up so well against the pink, and I like the diagonal space in front of the hopper - as if we could see it make its next jump - but it''s not in focus, or the camera was shaken.</td>', 'The green show up so well against the pink, and I like the diagonal space in front of the hopper - as if we could see it make its next jump - but it''s not in focus, or the camera was shaken.', '2003-04-23 13:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(275273, 19057, 5391, '<td valign="top">Creative take on this subject.  I hope you do well, this is a beautiful shot.  One of those things on my list of pictures I''d like to take someday.  The thing that really makes it extraordinary is the figure stading still towards the center of the image.  I also like the title you chose - I hope people will accept people as "fauna" and rate this for the great shot that it is.  10</td>', 'Creative take on this subject.  I hope you do well, this is a beautiful shot.  One of those things on my list of pictures I''d like to take someday.  The thing that really makes it extraordinary is the figure stading still towards the center of the image.  I also like the title you chose - I hope people will accept people as "fauna" and rate this for the great shot that it is.  10', '2003-04-23 13:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(275274, 19135, 6230, '<td valign="top">Looks short. Should have gone down on your knees for a better perspective, provided the bird doesn''t fly away.</td>', 'Looks short. Should have gone down on your knees for a better perspective, provided the bird doesn''t fly away.', '2003-04-23 13:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(275276, 19064, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice frame, full of life</td>', 'Nice frame, full of life', '2003-04-23 13:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(275277, 19159, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice picture - I wish I could see it larger.</td>', 'Nice picture - I wish I could see it larger.', '2003-04-23 13:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(275278, 19114, 327, '<td valign="top">Oh I love these little guys. Great shot.</td>', 'Oh I love these little guys. Great shot.', '2003-04-23 13:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(275279, 18647, 7801, '<td valign="top">Too centered. Subject too small.</td>', 'Too centered. Subject too small.', '2003-04-23 13:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(275280, 18711, 7543, '<td valign="top">Ducks? I would thing geese.. Nice pic</td>', 'Ducks? I would thing geese.. Nice pic', '2003-04-23 13:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(275281, 18763, 327, '<td valign="top">Looks like a poster or mag cover for horses. Very nice.</td>', 'Looks like a poster or mag cover for horses. Very nice.', '2003-04-23 13:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(275282, 18455, 7628, '<td valign="top">A cat in the sun is indeed fauna in its habitat.  I like the detail of the claw caught in the carpet, the sunlit ear against the shadows.  Wish both eyes were turned to us (but how does one get a cat to do what we want?)  Also the streak of sunlight behind distracts.  I would crop to focus on the face and ears, and make it sharper - what resolution are you working with?</td>', 'A cat in the sun is indeed fauna in its habitat.  I like the detail of the claw caught in the carpet, the sunlit ear against the shadows.  Wish both eyes were turned to us (but how does one get a cat to do what we want?)  Also the streak of sunlight behind distracts.  I would crop to focus on the face and ears, and make it sharper - what resolution are you working with?', '2003-04-23 13:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(275284, 18577, 7801, '<td valign="top">Too much saturation, too small.</td>', 'Too much saturation, too small.', '2003-04-23 13:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(275286, 19136, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot.....really pretty. Good lens, clean, clear.</td>', 'Pretty shot.....really pretty. Good lens, clean, clear.', '2003-04-23 13:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(275287, 18898, 6230, '<td valign="top">Image (subject''s face) looks dark. Great shot.</td>', 'Image (subject''s face) looks dark. Great shot.', '2003-04-23 13:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(275288, 18699, 327, '<td valign="top">Ouch!!</td>', 'Ouch!!', '2003-04-23 13:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(275289, 18981, 7543, '<td valign="top">should of have croped the date out of there... Good pic, the lonely bird is strangely obvious inspite of it''s size within the frame.</td>', 'should of have croped the date out of there... Good pic, the lonely bird is strangely obvious inspite of it''s size within the frame.', '2003-04-23 13:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(275291, 18366, 7628, '<td valign="top">What a great moment - catching the fauna catching the fauna!  The light on the chameleon is fine, of course the cricket is totally washed out,  The rock (?) in the foreground takes up too much space in the composition.  If only you could have swung arounf to the right and shot the cricket more in from of the lizard, getting them closer in the frame.  But points for getting the shot!</td>', 'What a great moment - catching the fauna catching the fauna!  The light on the chameleon is fine, of course the cricket is totally washed out,  The rock (?) in the foreground takes up too much space in the composition.  If only you could have swung arounf to the right and shot the cricket more in from of the lizard, getting them closer in the frame.  But points for getting the shot!', '2003-04-23 13:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(275292, 18471, 327, '<td valign="top">Really nice light, focus...perfect. They look so tired...lol</td>', 'Really nice light, focus...perfect. They look so tired...lol', '2003-04-23 13:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(275293, 18721, 7801, '<td valign="top">Like this, good urban shot! Excellent motion, would have been better with the birds face more in focus.</td>', 'Like this, good urban shot! Excellent motion, would have been better with the birds face more in focus.', '2003-04-23 13:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(275294, 18962, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice Crop</td>', 'Nice Crop', '2003-04-23 13:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(275297, 19045, 6230, '<td valign="top">Life (Light) is missing from the eyes. Great portrait.</td>', 'Life (Light) is missing from the eyes. Great portrait.', '2003-04-23 13:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(275298, 18725, 7801, '<td valign="top">Subject too centered.</td>', 'Subject too centered.', '2003-04-23 13:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(275299, 18837, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors.</td>', 'Pretty colors.', '2003-04-23 13:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(275300, 18832, 7628, '<td valign="top">The title is so apt,  Great detail on this tiny view - even the translucent shadows of the fly;s wings on the leaf.  The composition with the fly perched ready to take the big leap is great.  I would have cropped a little moe off the left though - bring more attention to the fly.</td>', 'The title is so apt,  Great detail on this tiny view - even the translucent shadows of the fly;s wings on the leaf.  The composition with the fly perched ready to take the big leap is great.  I would have cropped a little moe off the left though - bring more attention to the fly.', '2003-04-23 13:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(275303, 18856, 327, '<td valign="top">Beauty.</td>', 'Beauty.', '2003-04-23 13:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(275304, 18530, 327, '<td valign="top">Better then a watch dog.</td>', 'Better then a watch dog.', '2003-04-23 13:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
