(275433, 19141, 7137, '<td valign="top">wow, really candid, almost graphic...good</td>', 'wow, really candid, almost graphic...good', '2003-04-23 14:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(275434, 19135, 5266, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a chickadee - at least that''s what we call them here - our robins are a lot different than this little bird.  Great capture - nice pose.  I love the detail you have achieved - even on the tiny little feet.</td>', 'I think it''s a chickadee - at least that''s what we call them here - our robins are a lot different than this little bird.  Great capture - nice pose.  I love the detail you have achieved - even on the tiny little feet.', '2003-04-23 14:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(275436, 18816, 7033, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and color in this shot... but it seems to be a bit oversharpened, in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the composition and color in this shot... but it seems to be a bit oversharpened, in my opinion.', '2003-04-23 14:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(275437, 18577, 3882, '<td valign="top">Good shot although the background is a little distracting.  However, it is not a mandarin, but a mallard duck.</td>', 'Good shot although the background is a little distracting.  However, it is not a mandarin, but a mallard duck.', '2003-04-23 14:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(275438, 19118, 7137, '<td valign="top">i like</td>', 'i like', '2003-04-23 14:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(275441, 18556, 7857, '<td valign="top">Great picture!</td>', 'Great picture!', '2003-04-23 14:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(275442, 18756, 5266, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!  I can see the nuts, thank you very much.  A very well endowed squirrel!!   Love his expression - great capture!!!</td>', 'LOL!!!  I can see the nuts, thank you very much.  A very well endowed squirrel!!   Love his expression - great capture!!!', '2003-04-23 14:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(275443, 18907, 7137, '<td valign="top">have you been sending in the american flags also???? great shot..</td>', 'have you been sending in the american flags also???? great shot..', '2003-04-23 14:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(275446, 19204, 5266, '<td valign="top">A little different lighting would have helped emphasize the outlines of these jellyfish - right now they just sort of blend into the blue of the water.</td>', 'A little different lighting would have helped emphasize the outlines of these jellyfish - right now they just sort of blend into the blue of the water.', '2003-04-23 14:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(275447, 19038, 7033, '<td valign="top">So... how did you get them all to pose like that?  (Never heard of trained pelicans before! :)  Seriously now, this is a very nice shot!  The colors in the birds themselves are very nice; I also like the overall subdued tone of the shot.  I might have preferred a slightly different crop, with a bit more black above the birds, and fewer branches showing at the bottom, but that''s simply my opinion.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'So... how did you get them all to pose like that?  (Never heard of trained pelicans before! :)  Seriously now, this is a very nice shot!  The colors in the birds themselves are very nice; I also like the overall subdued tone of the shot.  I might have preferred a slightly different crop, with a bit more black above the birds, and fewer branches showing at the bottom, but that''s simply my opinion.  Very nicely done!', '2003-04-23 14:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(275449, 19199, 5266, '<td valign="top">Bird porno!!!!  Great capture!!  Never actually seen birds doing what the birds &amp; bees do.</td>', 'Bird porno!!!!  Great capture!!  Never actually seen birds doing what the birds & bees do.', '2003-04-23 14:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(275451, 18442, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice approach to the challenge-- I like the strong colors in this shot.  However, it seems to be suffering from too-soft of focus, in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice approach to the challenge-- I like the strong colors in this shot.  However, it seems to be suffering from too-soft of focus, in my opinion.', '2003-04-23 14:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(275452, 18442, 5822, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it''s because of the falling snow, but it appears that the focus is too soft. I do however, like the composition and natural colors.</td>', 'I don''t know if it''s because of the falling snow, but it appears that the focus is too soft. I do however, like the composition and natural colors.', '2003-04-23 14:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(275453, 18443, 7890, '<td valign="top">beatiful bird, I would of liked to see more of him, great sharpness, and color.</td>', 'beatiful bird, I would of liked to see more of him, great sharpness, and color.', '2003-04-23 14:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(275454, 18591, 6230, '<td valign="top">Lighting can be improved.</td>', 'Lighting can be improved.', '2003-04-23 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(275455, 18482, 7890, '<td valign="top">I remember these days, paying for it now, good action shot.</td>', 'I remember these days, paying for it now, good action shot.', '2003-04-23 14:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(275456, 18472, 117, '<td valign="top">lighting is just a little bright or over exposed in spots-nice capture of the snake''s head and I like the angle.</td>', 'lighting is just a little bright or over exposed in spots-nice capture of the snake''s head and I like the angle.', '2003-04-23 14:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(275457, 18813, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  Colors work well for me.  In my opinion, I would have cropped just a bit tighter on top, (but my opinion only!).  Lighter flowers above the butterfly seem a bit overexposed.</td>', 'Very nice shot!  Colors work well for me.  In my opinion, I would have cropped just a bit tighter on top, (but my opinion only!).  Lighter flowers above the butterfly seem a bit overexposed.', '2003-04-23 14:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
