(275478, 19107, 5266, '<td valign="top">I agree with your title completely.  I have been marking "animals in captivity" down a couple of marks, but since you have acknowledged the fact, you aren''t losing the points!!  I like the head-on angle you have used here.  Could be interesting if you were a little lower and looking up at the horse as well.</td>', 'I agree with your title completely.  I have been marking "animals in captivity" down a couple of marks, but since you have acknowledged the fact, you aren''t losing the points!!  I like the head-on angle you have used here.  Could be interesting if you were a little lower and looking up at the horse as well.', '2003-04-23 14:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(275479, 19105, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot... was this taken at night?</td>', 'Very interesting shot... was this taken at night?', '2003-04-23 14:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(275481, 18728, 117, '<td valign="top">just a little too bright-should have darken it some with ps. Nice bunch of alligators</td>', 'just a little too bright-should have darken it some with ps. Nice bunch of alligators', '2003-04-23 14:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(275483, 18556, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful detail and an excellent splash of color... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'beautiful detail and an excellent splash of color... great shot :) - setzler', '2003-04-23 14:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(275484, 19098, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot... I think this composition is very strong and the exposure is perfect :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent shot... I think this composition is very strong and the exposure is perfect :) - setzler', '2003-04-23 14:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(275485, 18884, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent detail and the reflection is beautiful... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent detail and the reflection is beautiful... great shot :) - setzler', '2003-04-23 14:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(275486, 18866, 7033, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  I really like the deep rich color; shallow DOF and receding focus works very well.  One minor suggestion would be to work to eliminate the glare off the shell.  --9</td>', 'Excellent shot!  I really like the deep rich color; shallow DOF and receding focus works very well.  One minor suggestion would be to work to eliminate the glare off the shell.  --9', '2003-04-23 14:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(275487, 18380, 5266, '<td valign="top">Oh boy - you took a chance with this!!!  I think most people are going to assume this is a plant, but I know it''s an animal... or actually a bunch of them!!  Nice color variety here - they look like gem anenomes, from the northern regions, which is a nice change from the textbook anenome with clown fish in it.  I also like the crab-like animal on the right lower side.  Good job!!!</td>', 'Oh boy - you took a chance with this!!!  I think most people are going to assume this is a plant, but I know it''s an animal... or actually a bunch of them!!  Nice color variety here - they look like gem anenomes, from the northern regions, which is a nice change from the textbook anenome with clown fish in it.  I also like the crab-like animal on the right lower side.  Good job!!!', '2003-04-23 14:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(275488, 18883, 772, '<td valign="top">very interesting composition... the flash creates some harsh light though... - setzler</td>', 'very interesting composition... the flash creates some harsh light though... - setzler', '2003-04-23 14:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(275489, 18530, 7890, '<td valign="top">I would of saved the feet on the subject, and crop more of the sky. like the fence post, adds to the all around picture.</td>', 'I would of saved the feet on the subject, and crop more of the sky. like the fence post, adds to the all around picture.', '2003-04-23 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(275491, 18455, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent use of creative lighting :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent use of creative lighting :) - setzler', '2003-04-23 14:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(275492, 18981, 5266, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo.  But please, TURN OFF THE DATE FUNCTION, or CROP IT OUT.  The photo is ruined with yellow numbers across the bottom of it!!!</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo.  But please, TURN OFF THE DATE FUNCTION, or CROP IT OUT.  The photo is ruined with yellow numbers across the bottom of it!!!', '2003-04-23 14:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(275495, 19211, 5266, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any "fauna" here - would have been good for the "flora" challenge, though</td>', 'I don''t see any "fauna" here - would have been good for the "flora" challenge, though', '2003-04-23 14:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(275496, 19021, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  The overall subdued tone of the shot is very consistent; sharp focus is perfect.  (Too bad one of his buddies left a little present on the dock, though! :)</td>', 'Very nicely done!  The overall subdued tone of the shot is very consistent; sharp focus is perfect.  (Too bad one of his buddies left a little present on the dock, though! :)', '2003-04-23 14:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(275497, 19159, 6900, '<td valign="top">Submit a larger picture.  Good shot, however.</td>', 'Submit a larger picture.  Good shot, however.', '2003-04-23 14:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(275498, 18577, 7890, '<td valign="top">abit over-exposed, great color.</td>', 'abit over-exposed, great color.', '2003-04-23 14:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(275499, 18729, 772, '<td valign="top">The color in this shot is very dramatic... the composition is phenomenal... great use of shallow depth of field also... = 10 - setzler</td>', 'The color in this shot is very dramatic... the composition is phenomenal... great use of shallow depth of field also... = 10 - setzler', '2003-04-23 14:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(275501, 18455, 6900, '<td valign="top">Great shadows and capture of the expression.  I wish there wasn''t a slice of kitty lower on his/her body.</td>', 'Great shadows and capture of the expression.  I wish there wasn''t a slice of kitty lower on his/her body.', '2003-04-23 14:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(275502, 19052, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot, but that is one UGLY bird!  Lighting from behind works very well, in my opinion.</td>', 'Nicely shot, but that is one UGLY bird!  Lighting from behind works very well, in my opinion.', '2003-04-23 14:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(275503, 18554, 772, '<td valign="top">This is excellent work... looking into this image, i feel like *I* am another bug who is surveying an intruder on my own territory.   The softness of the image adds to the interesting perspective... great work :) - 10 - setzler</td>', 'This is excellent work... looking into this image, i feel like *I* am another bug who is surveying an intruder on my own territory.   The softness of the image adds to the interesting perspective... great work :) - 10 - setzler', '2003-04-23 14:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(275504, 18441, 5266, '<td valign="top">Perhaps for the flora challenge????  Don''t see any fauna here.</td>', 'Perhaps for the flora challenge????  Don''t see any fauna here.', '2003-04-23 14:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(275505, 18942, 5266, '<td valign="top">Hey Jeremy!!! Love this shot - glad you used it for the challenge!!</td>', 'Hey Jeremy!!! Love this shot - glad you used it for the challenge!!', '2003-04-23 14:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(275506, 18673, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  In my opinion, I would have desaturated a bit more to remove all traces of color, or brought back enough to emphasize a traditional sepia effect.</td>', 'Nice subject.  In my opinion, I would have desaturated a bit more to remove all traces of color, or brought back enough to emphasize a traditional sepia effect.', '2003-04-23 14:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(275507, 19136, 6900, '<td valign="top">Great capture!!  Perfect timing and excellent focus near the head and neck.  I would have cropped him not so dead center.</td>', 'Great capture!!  Perfect timing and excellent focus near the head and neck.  I would have cropped him not so dead center.', '2003-04-23 14:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(275509, 18756, 3735, '<td valign="top">between his leg''s   wooooo  lol 6</td>', 'between his leg''s   wooooo  lol 6', '2003-04-23 14:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(275512, 19136, 7033, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great capture!  I love the sense of motion you have created with this shot.  --10</td>', 'Wow!  Great capture!  I love the sense of motion you have created with this shot.  --10', '2003-04-23 14:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(275514, 18765, 7033, '<td valign="top">Fantastic macro shot!  Your clarity and detail is wonderful; color is fantastic!  --10</td>', 'Fantastic macro shot!  Your clarity and detail is wonderful; color is fantastic!  --10', '2003-04-23 14:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(275518, 19049, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great expression!  I think this would have been a stronger composition had you panned down a bit.  The head seems to be a bit too centered.</td>', 'Great expression!  I think this would have been a stronger composition had you panned down a bit.  The head seems to be a bit too centered.', '2003-04-23 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(275520, 18711, 3102, '<td valign="top">I may have zoomed in a bit to focus on just the one duck, cropping out some of the background at the top.  And why is there an apostrophe in "duck''s????"</td>', 'I may have zoomed in a bit to focus on just the one duck, cropping out some of the background at the top.  And why is there an apostrophe in "duck''s????"', '2003-04-23 14:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(275521, 19193, 117, '<td valign="top">I can just hear the animal lovers now. Well that what there is life and death</td>', 'I can just hear the animal lovers now. Well that what there is life and death', '2003-04-23 14:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(275523, 18471, 6900, '<td valign="top">AWESOME capture.</td>', 'AWESOME capture.', '2003-04-23 14:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(275526, 19111, 7743, '<td valign="top">This image seems to be slightly underexposed.  Owin looks a little grey rather than white.  Trying exposure compensation on the plus side might help.</td>', 'This image seems to be slightly underexposed.  Owin looks a little grey rather than white.  Trying exposure compensation on the plus side might help.', '2003-04-23 14:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(275530, 19187, 3102, '<td valign="top">I love the crispness of the exposure -- I think the composition may have been just a little stronger if the shot had been panned a bit down and to the left to include the full wing and feet.</td>', 'I love the crispness of the exposure -- I think the composition may have been just a little stronger if the shot had been panned a bit down and to the left to include the full wing and feet.', '2003-04-23 14:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(275532, 18366, 7743, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea for a photo.  Unfortunately the flash overexposed your friend''s prey.</td>', 'This is a good idea for a photo.  Unfortunately the flash overexposed your friend''s prey.', '2003-04-23 14:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(275534, 19028, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the subject/composition, but the shot seems to be a little oversharpened, or something.  The overall contrast seems to have some sort of issues...</td>', 'I like the subject/composition, but the shot seems to be a little oversharpened, or something.  The overall contrast seems to have some sort of issues...', '2003-04-23 14:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(275538, 18721, 5266, '<td valign="top">We actually call them SkyRats!!!  LIke the movement you have captured</td>', 'We actually call them SkyRats!!!  LIke the movement you have captured', '2003-04-23 15:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(275539, 18743, 772, '<td valign="top">Black subjects are definitely difficult to work with... this one looks a little overexposed and has lost detail in the black at the same time... this was a tough time to shoot for sure... - setzler</td>', 'Black subjects are definitely difficult to work with... this one looks a little overexposed and has lost detail in the black at the same time... this was a tough time to shoot for sure... - setzler', '2003-04-23 15:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(275540, 18981, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''re hearing the same things over &amp; over... the image is tilted to the left a bit, and you should definitely turn off the date thing :)</td>', 'I''m sure you''re hearing the same things over & over... the image is tilted to the left a bit, and you should definitely turn off the date thing :)', '2003-04-23 15:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(275541, 19134, 772, '<td valign="top">very ineteresting composition :)  I think the tops of the lizards are a little too close to the top of the frame, but still a good shot :) - setzler</td>', 'very ineteresting composition :)  I think the tops of the lizards are a little too close to the top of the frame, but still a good shot :) - setzler', '2003-04-23 15:03:48.000000', NULL, 1);
