(275542, 18869, 772, '<td valign="top">very major fauna :)  Great shot... - setzler</td>', 'very major fauna :)  Great shot... - setzler', '2003-04-23 15:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(275546, 19211, 6900, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo - wrong challenge.</td>', 'Amazing photo - wrong challenge.', '2003-04-23 15:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(275547, 18927, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice!  The only thig I''d suggest is to crop a bit on the right.</td>', 'Nice!  The only thig I''d suggest is to crop a bit on the right.', '2003-04-23 15:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(275548, 19163, 6900, '<td valign="top">WHOA!</td>', 'WHOA!', '2003-04-23 15:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(275549, 18526, 5266, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!! Love this fish - what exactly is it??   Excellent focus on the eye - interesting lips.  Aquarium or underwater?</td>', 'Great shot!!! Love this fish - what exactly is it??   Excellent focus on the eye - interesting lips.  Aquarium or underwater?', '2003-04-23 15:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(275550, 18736, 5266, '<td valign="top">I wish I knew what the animal was in the water - a dolphin?  a shark?  a turtle?  a manatee?  Right now all I can be sure there is in this photo is a man wearing goggles.</td>', 'I wish I knew what the animal was in the water - a dolphin?  a shark?  a turtle?  a manatee?  Right now all I can be sure there is in this photo is a man wearing goggles.', '2003-04-23 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(275552, 18435, 2856, '<td valign="top">My favourite this week. Colors, light, composition all great.</td>', 'My favourite this week. Colors, light, composition all great.', '2003-04-23 15:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(275556, 18360, 3569, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Interesting approach.  Nice shot.', '2003-04-23 15:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(275557, 18787, 7890, '<td valign="top">very good caption, color, sharpness,  very good entry.</td>', 'very good caption, color, sharpness,  very good entry.', '2003-04-23 15:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(275559, 18964, 3569, '<td valign="top">Fill-in flash would have helped eliminate the shadows. Subject nice.</td>', 'Fill-in flash would have helped eliminate the shadows. Subject nice.', '2003-04-23 15:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(275560, 18775, 7628, '<td valign="top">Great - love the balance of the three birds tails on either side, faces all looking different directions.  It is more that a picture of birds - it is a picture of thier attitude.  Crisp feathers, nice background.</td>', 'Great - love the balance of the three birds tails on either side, faces all looking different directions.  It is more that a picture of birds - it is a picture of thier attitude.  Crisp feathers, nice background.', '2003-04-23 15:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(275561, 18727, 3569, '<td valign="top">more butterfly would have got more votes from me.</td>', 'more butterfly would have got more votes from me.', '2003-04-23 15:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(275562, 19137, 3569, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Simply beautiful.  Nicely done.', '2003-04-23 15:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(275563, 19102, 7628, '<td valign="top">This would be really surreal if all yo could see was the fish and the bowl - and the trees and leaves through the bowl.  It would seem like the fish was swimming in a field!  As is it is neat to see a fish bowl in a tree, but doesn''t make a great composition, and you can barely see the fauna.</td>', 'This would be really surreal if all yo could see was the fish and the bowl - and the trees and leaves through the bowl.  It would seem like the fish was swimming in a field!  As is it is neat to see a fish bowl in a tree, but doesn''t make a great composition, and you can barely see the fauna.', '2003-04-23 15:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(275564, 19122, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit more contrast would have help.</td>', 'A bit more contrast would have help.', '2003-04-23 15:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(275565, 18969, 7890, '<td valign="top">I had to really look at this one to figure out what they where. cute little things, but one has a hot spot, and them together really distracts from the overall detail that there is three of them. maybe more sharpness or waiting for another shot with thwm in a different position. Like the composition.</td>', 'I had to really look at this one to figure out what they where. cute little things, but one has a hot spot, and them together really distracts from the overall detail that there is three of them. maybe more sharpness or waiting for another shot with thwm in a different position. Like the composition.', '2003-04-23 15:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
