(275640, 19088, 2586, '<td valign="top">Strictly from an artistic point of view, i would rate this image as one of the three best in this challenge. It has great impact on me. It''s so Zen-like. Technically very good, too. Like the B&amp;W and the toning and my eye gets a thrill out of the white wavy line. 10 Journey</td>', 'Strictly from an artistic point of view, i would rate this image as one of the three best in this challenge. It has great impact on me. It''s so Zen-like. Technically very good, too. Like the B&W and the toning and my eye gets a thrill out of the white wavy line. 10 Journey', '2003-04-23 16:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(275643, 18866, 7350, '<td valign="top">How did the snail get out on that plant?  I see them on the sidewalks and on the ground all the time, but that''s an awfully small leaf he''s treading.  There are a few little overexposed spots on the shell.</td>', 'How did the snail get out on that plant?  I see them on the sidewalks and on the ground all the time, but that''s an awfully small leaf he''s treading.  There are a few little overexposed spots on the shell.', '2003-04-23 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
