(275668, 19148, 7033, '<td valign="top">Absolutely perfect shot!  (And much better than the end result of my attempt at the same species earlier this week...)  Color, tone, composition, and emotion captured in this shot are amazing.  --10</td>', 'Absolutely perfect shot!  (And much better than the end result of my attempt at the same species earlier this week...)  Color, tone, composition, and emotion captured in this shot are amazing.  --10', '2003-04-23 16:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(275669, 18636, 7350, '<td valign="top">Backlighting from the sun caused the water to be perfectly exposed and the ducks, the main subjects of the shot, to be quite dark.  Try spot-metering on the ducks, or the ground right in front of them.</td>', 'Backlighting from the sun caused the water to be perfectly exposed and the ducks, the main subjects of the shot, to be quite dark.  Try spot-metering on the ducks, or the ground right in front of them.', '2003-04-23 16:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(275670, 18366, 2586, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing for a great action shot. Can''t believe the expression of the chameleon; he''s obviously looking forward to dinner. Looks like both he and you are having a good catch. 8 Journey</td>', 'Perfect timing for a great action shot. Can''t believe the expression of the chameleon; he''s obviously looking forward to dinner. Looks like both he and you are having a good catch. 8 Journey', '2003-04-23 16:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(275672, 18816, 3032, '<td valign="top">Every time I photograph lambs in the sun, the camera''s exposure meter is fooled by the bright whites. My experience is that it need''s 1/3th to 2/3th stop underexposure to get the best detail. Would work here as well.<br/>Nice setting.</td>', 'Every time I photograph lambs in the sun, the camera''s exposure meter is fooled by the bright whites. My experience is that it need''s 1/3th to 2/3th stop underexposure to get the best detail. Would work here as well.Nice setting.', '2003-04-23 16:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(275673, 18923, 3669, '<td valign="top">This is truly a great photo.  The sun hitting the guy on the rock is perfect.   There''s a lot of shine on his bald head, but my husband has a bald head and I''m used to seeing that.  LOL  I love the expression on his face.  The "misty" effect on the one below...is it caused from dust or is it a natural effect of the sunlight?  I notice that the shadow on the rock face above him starts to fade just a little above him.  It almost looks like a touch up.  In any event, the contrast is effective there and I like it.  Just slight over-exposure on the rock between the two apes and the top of the rock just in front of the one on the ground, but it really isn''t that distracting.  Above all, this is amoung my top 10 favorites.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is truly a great photo.  The sun hitting the guy on the rock is perfect.   There''s a lot of shine on his bald head, but my husband has a bald head and I''m used to seeing that.  LOL  I love the expression on his face.  The "misty" effect on the one below...is it caused from dust or is it a natural effect of the sunlight?  I notice that the shadow on the rock face above him starts to fade just a little above him.  It almost looks like a touch up.  In any event, the contrast is effective there and I like it.  Just slight over-exposure on the rock between the two apes and the top of the rock just in front of the one on the ground, but it really isn''t that distracting.  Above all, this is amoung my top 10 favorites.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-23 16:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(275674, 18794, 7033, '<td valign="top">Incredible capture!  Shallow DOF works for me... but I think I would have preferred just a bit more of the flower in focus.  Still, amazing shot!</td>', 'Incredible capture!  Shallow DOF works for me... but I think I would have preferred just a bit more of the flower in focus.  Still, amazing shot!', '2003-04-23 16:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(275675, 18326, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Well focused...shows detail and contrast.  Lighting seems to be perfect.  Amoung my top 10 favorites.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Well focused...shows detail and contrast.  Lighting seems to be perfect.  Amoung my top 10 favorites.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-23 16:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
