(275678, 18575, 3032, '<td valign="top">Man, this must be the cutest animal in the world. They are so cool, great attitude to the world, life and the rest.<br/>Nice setting, ultimate laziness. When I die I want to return as a Koala. :)</td>', 'Man, this must be the cutest animal in the world. They are so cool, great attitude to the world, life and the rest.Nice setting, ultimate laziness. When I die I want to return as a Koala. :)', '2003-04-23 16:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
