(275976, 18794, 7599, '<td valign="top">You chose a hard subject to capture. I would have preferred a little less sharp detail on the flower and more on the bee, but understandably the bee probably did not help you out with accomplishing this. Damn moving animals. *grin*</td>', 'You chose a hard subject to capture. I would have preferred a little less sharp detail on the flower and more on the bee, but understandably the bee probably did not help you out with accomplishing this. Damn moving animals. *grin*', '2003-04-23 19:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
