(275986, 19124, 7599, '<td valign="top">I love how they all look so determined. Looks like they''re all going off to work on a Monday morning. The image overall is a bit dark, but you have certainly captured an obvious emotion.</td>', 'I love how they all look so determined. Looks like they''re all going off to work on a Monday morning. The image overall is a bit dark, but you have certainly captured an obvious emotion.', '2003-04-23 19:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
