(275990, 18591, 7599, '<td valign="top">These cows are just too indistinct. It''s hard to get close with live, untamed animals though, I can appreciate that. Maybe next time try caturing a few stragglers that are not all in the same group.</td>', 'These cows are just too indistinct. It''s hard to get close with live, untamed animals though, I can appreciate that. Maybe next time try caturing a few stragglers that are not all in the same group.', '2003-04-23 19:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
