(275997, 18311, 7599, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space, and I love the angle of this photo. I feel like Heidi climbing the hills looking at this. I definitely would have minimized the white border, it distracts from the colour in the picture and enhances the white (blank) space of the lambs head. Overall great job.</td>', 'Great use of negative space, and I love the angle of this photo. I feel like Heidi climbing the hills looking at this. I definitely would have minimized the white border, it distracts from the colour in the picture and enhances the white (blank) space of the lambs head. Overall great job.', '2003-04-23 19:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(275998, 19022, 3882, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good dof.</td>', 'Nice shot, good dof.', '2003-04-23 19:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(275999, 19140, 3882, '<td valign="top">Yes, he looks very peaceful!  Great capture.</td>', 'Yes, he looks very peaceful!  Great capture.', '2003-04-23 19:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(276000, 19042, 3882, '<td valign="top">Underwater shots have always been very tricky for me so good for you for getting this shot!</td>', 'Underwater shots have always been very tricky for me so good for you for getting this shot!', '2003-04-23 19:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(276001, 19175, 3882, '<td valign="top">I like it!</td>', 'I like it!', '2003-04-23 19:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(276002, 19123, 7599, '<td valign="top">I had to keep coming back to this one to tell if I like it or not. I do like the movement and I almost wish the beak was more out of focus. I''m still in the air about the cropping though, can''t tell if I would make it tighter or not. One thing this photo did do was capture my attention, so points for that!</td>', 'I had to keep coming back to this one to tell if I like it or not. I do like the movement and I almost wish the beak was more out of focus. I''m still in the air about the cropping though, can''t tell if I would make it tighter or not. One thing this photo did do was capture my attention, so points for that!', '2003-04-23 19:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(276003, 19134, 7599, '<td valign="top">Great title, enhances a good humourous photo.</td>', 'Great title, enhances a good humourous photo.', '2003-04-23 19:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(276004, 18435, 7890, '<td valign="top">what a great shot, you captured all the many colors of this bird with a great expression, something not planned I''m sure, great eye.</td>', 'what a great shot, you captured all the many colors of this bird with a great expression, something not planned I''m sure, great eye.', '2003-04-23 19:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(276005, 18840, 7599, '<td valign="top">I think if the seagul was reversed with the light, this photo would have been far more effective. Too bad you weren''t standing on the other side *grin* However the composition is unusual and I like it.</td>', 'I think if the seagul was reversed with the light, this photo would have been far more effective. Too bad you weren''t standing on the other side *grin* However the composition is unusual and I like it.', '2003-04-23 19:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
