(276022, 18444, 7599, '<td valign="top">It''s so hard to capture animals in their natural environment without the photo getting overwhelmed with distracting elements. In this case you also have the added burden of picking an animal close in colour to the habitat, tricky subject. You made a good go of it, I think a tighter crop would have helped.</td>', 'It''s so hard to capture animals in their natural environment without the photo getting overwhelmed with distracting elements. In this case you also have the added burden of picking an animal close in colour to the habitat, tricky subject. You made a good go of it, I think a tighter crop would have helped.', '2003-04-23 19:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(276024, 19212, 7890, '<td valign="top">looks like a very direct sunlight shot here, good job on the capture.</td>', 'looks like a very direct sunlight shot here, good job on the capture.', '2003-04-23 19:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
