(276029, 18845, 7599, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Despite the fact the background is so close in colour to the dove, it''s soft enough to actually enhance rather then detract from the subject.  Love the angle of the head, and the location where you captured it. Best picture I''ve seen yet. There''s a great feel about this one.</td>', 'Excellent. Despite the fact the background is so close in colour to the dove, it''s soft enough to actually enhance rather then detract from the subject.  Love the angle of the head, and the location where you captured it. Best picture I''ve seen yet. There''s a great feel about this one.', '2003-04-23 20:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
