(276150, 18503, 2586, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. Are you familiar with the watercolors by Louis Agassiz Fuertes (from NY state, earlier part of 20th century)? If not, try to get your hands on a copy of one of his books from a library. He did exquisite watercolors of Herons, Secretary Birds, etc. You will probably be delighted to look at them. This image reminded me of his watercolors immediately. 10 Journey</td>', 'Lovely image. Are you familiar with the watercolors by Louis Agassiz Fuertes (from NY state, earlier part of 20th century)? If not, try to get your hands on a copy of one of his books from a library. He did exquisite watercolors of Herons, Secretary Birds, etc. You will probably be delighted to look at them. This image reminded me of his watercolors immediately. 10 Journey', '2003-04-23 21:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(276152, 18554, 7890, '<td valign="top">abit to much blur in the foreground, good comp, with color and subject.</td>', 'abit to much blur in the foreground, good comp, with color and subject.', '2003-04-23 21:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(276154, 19153, 2586, '<td valign="top">Enduring image. Beak is a tad softer. Background could have been blurred more but it works. For the title, would have preferred duckling over duckie. 8 Journey</td>', 'Enduring image. Beak is a tad softer. Background could have been blurred more but it works. For the title, would have preferred duckling over duckie. 8 Journey', '2003-04-23 21:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(276159, 18943, 7890, '<td valign="top">really like your point of angle here, interesting.</td>', 'really like your point of angle here, interesting.', '2003-04-23 21:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(276160, 18859, 2586, '<td valign="top">Wow! Had no idea how scary this world was until starting to vote on this challenge. Great picture. Love all the detail of the web. Great how you managed to blur the background to a non-interfering greyish blur. Final: 9Journey</td>', 'Wow! Had no idea how scary this world was until starting to vote on this challenge. Great picture. Love all the detail of the web. Great how you managed to blur the background to a non-interfering greyish blur. Final: 9Journey', '2003-04-23 21:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(276161, 18556, 2586, '<td valign="top">Such colors, such clarity, such detail, such dewlap (never knew what that was called). Good lighting and composition.  Very nice 8 Journey</td>', 'Such colors, such clarity, such detail, such dewlap (never knew what that was called). Good lighting and composition.  Very nice 8 Journey', '2003-04-23 21:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
