(276592, 18647, 6663, '<td valign="top">Very effective - like the way you''ve left the subject alone in the pic. If the sky had any clouds in it, this wouldn''t have worked but you''ve pulled it off. Good photography.</td>', 'Very effective - like the way you''ve left the subject alone in the pic. If the sky had any clouds in it, this wouldn''t have worked but you''ve pulled it off. Good photography.', '2003-04-24 05:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
