(276594, 19194, 6663, '<td valign="top">I have a few criticisms of this pic:<br/> <br/>1. It might have been nicer to get a shot of the animal in an environment at least similar to its natural habitat - this seems to be a table or floor.<br/>2. The lighting is very harsh - clearly a lam,p held quite close to the subject.<br/>3. I''m not keen on the thick border (this is more of a personal thing than a photography critique).<br/> <br/>Having said that you''ve brought out the texture on the shell very well indeed.</td>', 'I have a few criticisms of this pic: 1. It might have been nicer to get a shot of the animal in an environment at least similar to its natural habitat - this seems to be a table or floor.2. The lighting is very harsh - clearly a lam,p held quite close to the subject.3. I''m not keen on the thick border (this is more of a personal thing than a photography critique). Having said that you''ve brought out the texture on the shell very well indeed.', '2003-04-24 05:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(276595, 18443, 6663, '<td valign="top">He''s looking right at me with that beady little eye...there aren''t many pics which, when I first see them, i say ''Wow''. This was one. Excellent focus at close range, wonderful colours. 8</td>', 'He''s looking right at me with that beady little eye...there aren''t many pics which, when I first see them, i say ''Wow''. This was one. Excellent focus at close range, wonderful colours. 8', '2003-04-24 05:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(276596, 19088, 6663, '<td valign="top">Wonderful focus at this range. You didn''t have to pull a wing off the little fella to get him to hold still, did you? :)<br/> <br/>It cuts a very forlorn figure; nice picture.</td>', 'Wonderful focus at this range. You didn''t have to pull a wing off the little fella to get him to hold still, did you? :) It cuts a very forlorn figure; nice picture.', '2003-04-24 05:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(276597, 18793, 6663, '<td valign="top">Eurgh. I''ve never seen one of these before and i hope this is the closest I ever have to come to one. Gruesome.<br/> <br/>Great focus though; the shell has a real texture to it that I like.</td>', 'Eurgh. I''ve never seen one of these before and i hope this is the closest I ever have to come to one. Gruesome. Great focus though; the shell has a real texture to it that I like.', '2003-04-24 06:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(276598, 18513, 6663, '<td valign="top">Looks extremely grainy - was this shot compressed a lot? Also I''m not keen on the white section at the left - I guess that was an accident. Some nice greens but the pic gets very pixellated towards the back.</td>', 'Looks extremely grainy - was this shot compressed a lot? Also I''m not keen on the white section at the left - I guess that was an accident. Some nice greens but the pic gets very pixellated towards the back.', '2003-04-24 06:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
