(276607, 18969, 6663, '<td valign="top">Normally I''m not keen on borders but this one works - gives the shot a more cosy feel. I like the way you''ve captured the subjects off-centre too - is this the rule of thirds in action? A nice pic but it''s a pity you can''t make out a little more of their features.</td>', 'Normally I''m not keen on borders but this one works - gives the shot a more cosy feel. I like the way you''ve captured the subjects off-centre too - is this the rule of thirds in action? A nice pic but it''s a pity you can''t make out a little more of their features.', '2003-04-24 06:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
