(276705, 18950, 6663, '<td valign="top">Great title. This is quite an extraordinary shot to look at - if it wasn''t for the border you''d never notice the edge of it, for a start. It looks like you cut out a pic of a seagull and pasted it onto the page. Quite remarkable photo.<br/> <br/>On a more objective viewpoint, the focus is excellent and the expression on the face superb. One of the best photos this week.</td>', 'Great title. This is quite an extraordinary shot to look at - if it wasn''t for the border you''d never notice the edge of it, for a start. It looks like you cut out a pic of a seagull and pasted it onto the page. Quite remarkable photo. On a more objective viewpoint, the focus is excellent and the expression on the face superb. One of the best photos this week.', '2003-04-24 07:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
