(276787, 18577, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice color, but the subject is a little far away, maybe the size of the image could be bigger, also a polarizing filter might have separated the subject from the reflections on the water better.</td>', 'nice color, but the subject is a little far away, maybe the size of the image could be bigger, also a polarizing filter might have separated the subject from the reflections on the water better.', '2003-04-24 08:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
