(276820, 18686, 2634, '<td valign="top">That is funny, I almost submitted a very similiar shot! Nice shot, but it is a touch light. I also would have cropped a drop (but maybe you couldn''t). I''m curious where this was.  My shot was from Red Rock Canyon</td>', 'That is funny, I almost submitted a very similiar shot! Nice shot, but it is a touch light. I also would have cropped a drop (but maybe you couldn''t). I''m curious where this was.  My shot was from Red Rock Canyon', '2003-04-24 09:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(276822, 18815, 7743, '<td valign="top">I think a different vantage point closer to the water level would give this image more impact.  Also, zooming in a little would give your subjects more presence.</td>', 'I think a different vantage point closer to the water level would give this image more impact.  Also, zooming in a little would give your subjects more presence.', '2003-04-24 09:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(276827, 18776, 7743, '<td valign="top">The ladybug seems to be in shadow.  Spot metering on the ladybug would possibly have brought it out more.  Even though the background is nicely blurred it''s a bit distracting since it is crooked.</td>', 'The ladybug seems to be in shadow.  Spot metering on the ladybug would possibly have brought it out more.  Even though the background is nicely blurred it''s a bit distracting since it is crooked.', '2003-04-24 09:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(276830, 19211, 2634, '<td valign="top">I was there last week! Where is the fauna?</td>', 'I was there last week! Where is the fauna?', '2003-04-24 09:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(276833, 19072, 2634, '<td valign="top">this crop is not the best for the photo. If you had cut only the ears or the nose maybe.</td>', 'this crop is not the best for the photo. If you had cut only the ears or the nose maybe.', '2003-04-24 09:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(276837, 18447, 5728, '<td valign="top">A perfect capture! You have an excellent eye and a lot of patience for sure. The pollen flying around gives this image so much impact. That and the shallow DOF, you have a masterpiece here!</td>', 'A perfect capture! You have an excellent eye and a lot of patience for sure. The pollen flying around gives this image so much impact. That and the shallow DOF, you have a masterpiece here!', '2003-04-24 09:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(276838, 18684, 2634, '<td valign="top">got to watch for that red eye. Was this taken at night?</td>', 'got to watch for that red eye. Was this taken at night?', '2003-04-24 09:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(276839, 18962, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very good! The cropping is very original and works so well. Very clever and very well done.</td>', 'Very good! The cropping is very original and works so well. Very clever and very well done.', '2003-04-24 09:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(276842, 19049, 5728, '<td valign="top">Although the fence wires are a little disturbing, they don''t really decrease the quality of this image somehow. I think cropping out the top half of the ostrich out the back is more disturbing. Otherwise this is a great pic, with the main subject full in focus and the shallow DOF blurring the background. Personally, I would have kept the whole ostrich in the background in the shot.</td>', 'Although the fence wires are a little disturbing, they don''t really decrease the quality of this image somehow. I think cropping out the top half of the ostrich out the back is more disturbing. Otherwise this is a great pic, with the main subject full in focus and the shallow DOF blurring the background. Personally, I would have kept the whole ostrich in the background in the shot.', '2003-04-24 09:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(276843, 18761, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition! Well done.</td>', 'Excellent composition! Well done.', '2003-04-24 09:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(276844, 18808, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lovely pastel colors here, they work well with each other. The main subject is in focus, choice pic!</td>', 'Lovely pastel colors here, they work well with each other. The main subject is in focus, choice pic!', '2003-04-24 09:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(276846, 18851, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow, I like it! The water drop does a lot for this pic, good capture.</td>', 'Wow, I like it! The water drop does a lot for this pic, good capture.', '2003-04-24 09:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(276849, 18903, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good fauna shot, the border doesn''t seem to fit in though. The color clashes.</td>', 'Good fauna shot, the border doesn''t seem to fit in though. The color clashes.', '2003-04-24 09:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(276850, 19022, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice macro! The detail is amazing, good job.</td>', 'Choice macro! The detail is amazing, good job.', '2003-04-24 09:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(276853, 19200, 7743, '<td valign="top">Composition is good.  It seems to be a little overexposed.  Try zooming in so you don''t have to take a small crop from a large photo.</td>', 'Composition is good.  It seems to be a little overexposed.  Try zooming in so you don''t have to take a small crop from a large photo.', '2003-04-24 09:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
