(276931, 19072, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting crop and I am wondering if it was good to crop at both ends of the head or not. Cropping at the top is no problem but I am not sure I would go with the bottom crop. It isn''t a big issue just a personal niggle. The rest of the composition is excellent. The detail on the horse''s head is amazing, you got the focus bang on there. The title is funny, in fact the whole is image is very good.</td>', 'This is an interesting crop and I am wondering if it was good to crop at both ends of the head or not. Cropping at the top is no problem but I am not sure I would go with the bottom crop. It isn''t a big issue just a personal niggle. The rest of the composition is excellent. The detail on the horse''s head is amazing, you got the focus bang on there. The title is funny, in fact the whole is image is very good.', '2003-04-24 10:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(276932, 19136, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot.</td>', 'Nice action shot.', '2003-04-24 10:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(276933, 18942, 5391, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  I like the browns, also.  It all works together very nicely.  8</td>', 'Great composition.  I like the browns, also.  It all works together very nicely.  8', '2003-04-24 10:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(276934, 18519, 5391, '<td valign="top">One of the better "cat shots" I''ve ever seen.  Beautiful tones, and I like your choice of desaturating all but they eyes.  It really makes you connect with the subject in this case.  10</td>', 'One of the better "cat shots" I''ve ever seen.  Beautiful tones, and I like your choice of desaturating all but they eyes.  It really makes you connect with the subject in this case.  10', '2003-04-24 10:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(276935, 18599, 5628, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best cat pics I''ve ever seen. I''m not a cat person, but this is stunning!</td>', 'This is one of the best cat pics I''ve ever seen. I''m not a cat person, but this is stunning!', '2003-04-24 11:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(276937, 18686, 5391, '<td valign="top">Lovely postcard-like shot.  Your background really makes this feel like it lives up to the theme of the challenge - very natural.  Beautiful.  9</td>', 'Lovely postcard-like shot.  Your background really makes this feel like it lives up to the theme of the challenge - very natural.  Beautiful.  9', '2003-04-24 11:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(276938, 18725, 5628, '<td valign="top">Nice looking bird, but the grainy effect is not doing you any favours. The black and white background is also very distracting.</td>', 'Nice looking bird, but the grainy effect is not doing you any favours. The black and white background is also very distracting.', '2003-04-24 11:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(276939, 18969, 5391, '<td valign="top">Adorable.  Beautiful lighting and composition, and I also really like the frame.  A couple of hot spots from the spot light, (really hard exposure situation to deal with with a digital camera, I know) but other than that, it''s perfect.  9</td>', 'Adorable.  Beautiful lighting and composition, and I also really like the frame.  A couple of hot spots from the spot light, (really hard exposure situation to deal with with a digital camera, I know) but other than that, it''s perfect.  9', '2003-04-24 11:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(276941, 19051, 5628, '<td valign="top">This is a very good shot. Pity DPC doesn''t allow us to edit out things like the piece of bread in the bottom left corner. Without it this shot would have been a sure ten.</td>', 'This is a very good shot. Pity DPC doesn''t allow us to edit out things like the piece of bread in the bottom left corner. Without it this shot would have been a sure ten.', '2003-04-24 11:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
