(276946, 18298, 5628, '<td valign="top">They are so tiny I can''t see them :) But seriously, I can''t see them, what are they? Where are they?</td>', 'They are so tiny I can''t see them :) But seriously, I can''t see them, what are they? Where are they?', '2003-04-24 11:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(276949, 18688, 6230, '<td valign="top">Background ruined the image.</td>', 'Background ruined the image.', '2003-04-24 11:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(276953, 18649, 5728, '<td valign="top">The seagull is the main focal point although not 100% sharp, however you have managed to blur out the background enough with the DOF to highlight the gull more. The shadow on its face hiding its eye is a little bit of bad luck which you couldn''t really have done too much about. Overall a good pic in a nice composition.</td>', 'The seagull is the main focal point although not 100% sharp, however you have managed to blur out the background enough with the DOF to highlight the gull more. The shadow on its face hiding its eye is a little bit of bad luck which you couldn''t really have done too much about. Overall a good pic in a nice composition.', '2003-04-24 11:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(276955, 19137, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice macro and colours.extra DOF.</td>', 'Nice macro and colours.extra DOF.', '2003-04-24 11:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(276956, 19173, 7137, '<td valign="top">other than being a shade fuzzy, this is a great capture of bird chaos</td>', 'other than being a shade fuzzy, this is a great capture of bird chaos', '2003-04-24 11:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(276958, 18747, 6230, '<td valign="top">Subject is small and out of focus....</td>', 'Subject is small and out of focus....', '2003-04-24 11:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(276961, 18800, 8139, '<td valign="top">Very crisp, nice attitude</td>', 'Very crisp, nice attitude', '2003-04-24 11:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(276962, 19048, 5728, '<td valign="top">Cute family pic :-) The colors are brought out well by the sunlight here. It''s a pity this side of the foal is in shadows but you couldn''t have done too much more about it besides moving your position, but then you may not have been able to get such a good image.</td>', 'Cute family pic :-) The colors are brought out well by the sunlight here. It''s a pity this side of the foal is in shadows but you couldn''t have done too much more about it besides moving your position, but then you may not have been able to get such a good image.', '2003-04-24 11:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(276966, 18796, 6230, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2003-04-24 11:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(276967, 18711, 6230, '<td valign="top">Very sharp image.</td>', 'Very sharp image.', '2003-04-24 11:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(276968, 19209, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is certainly a different view of fauna :-) It''s a good idea, and well done as well. A very tight crop but it works here. Not much to criticize about, maybe just the flash on the gums is a little harsh (hot spot), but otherwise good (and funny!)</td>', 'Now this is certainly a different view of fauna :-) It''s a good idea, and well done as well. A very tight crop but it works here. Not much to criticize about, maybe just the flash on the gums is a little harsh (hot spot), but otherwise good (and funny!)', '2003-04-24 11:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(276969, 18696, 6230, '<td valign="top">The flowers at the bottom right looks prettier........</td>', 'The flowers at the bottom right looks prettier........', '2003-04-24 11:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(276970, 18981, 7137, '<td valign="top">fix that horizon and get that date off the picture and you''ve got a winner</td>', 'fix that horizon and get that date off the picture and you''ve got a winner', '2003-04-24 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(276971, 18938, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very original and well done. Come on, you trained those ladybirds didn''t you! The composition is good, nice tight crop. There is some grain in the background but it isn''t distractive in anyway. The lighting is also good.</td>', 'Very original and well done. Come on, you trained those ladybirds didn''t you! The composition is good, nice tight crop. There is some grain in the background but it isn''t distractive in anyway. The lighting is also good.', '2003-04-24 11:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(276972, 18761, 7137, '<td valign="top">very good, i know it''s the desert but this could probably stand to be color corrected</td>', 'very good, i know it''s the desert but this could probably stand to be color corrected', '2003-04-24 11:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(276973, 18813, 6230, '<td valign="top">The flowers at the top left hand corner is so much over-exposed it is glaring, good capture though.</td>', 'The flowers at the top left hand corner is so much over-exposed it is glaring, good capture though.', '2003-04-24 11:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
