(276979, 18491, 6230, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery.</td>', 'Beautiful scenery.', '2003-04-24 11:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(276980, 18727, 5728, '<td valign="top">I find the saturation levels could be tweaked a little more, or maybe just an auto levels in photoshop for example, I am sure you could make that green a lot richer that way. The composition is very good fully following the rule of thirds.</td>', 'I find the saturation levels could be tweaked a little more, or maybe just an auto levels in photoshop for example, I am sure you could make that green a lot richer that way. The composition is very good fully following the rule of thirds.', '2003-04-24 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(276981, 18761, 6230, '<td valign="top">Looks fierce...</td>', 'Looks fierce...', '2003-04-24 11:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(276982, 18441, 7364, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful picture!  I think it''s in the wrong challenge though.</td>', 'Wow, beautiful picture!  I think it''s in the wrong challenge though.', '2003-04-24 11:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(276983, 18866, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photo, the greens are fully saturated and together with the snail and all that transparent stuff (yuk!) make for an excellent image. The DOF is very good and so is the composition, choice! But the border! The green in your border clashes with the rest of the image.</td>', 'This is a very good photo, the greens are fully saturated and together with the snail and all that transparent stuff (yuk!) make for an excellent image. The DOF is very good and so is the composition, choice! But the border! The green in your border clashes with the rest of the image.', '2003-04-24 11:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(276984, 19174, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ahh, it''s the old "put-some-old-oranges-and-fruit-on-a-plate-to-attract-some-butterflies-to-get-their-photo" trick again! Good one! It worked :-) The only distracting part about this image is that the background is a little load. The plate is already full of all kinds of colors and action. It would have been better to have a neutral background or to have used quite a wide open aperture to blur it out.</td>', 'Ahh, it''s the old "put-some-old-oranges-and-fruit-on-a-plate-to-attract-some-butterflies-to-get-their-photo" trick again! Good one! It worked :-) The only distracting part about this image is that the background is a little load. The plate is already full of all kinds of colors and action. It would have been better to have a neutral background or to have used quite a wide open aperture to blur it out.', '2003-04-24 11:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(276985, 19098, 6230, '<td valign="top">Simple and nice.</td>', 'Simple and nice.', '2003-04-24 11:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(276986, 18982, 5728, '<td valign="top">Is it asleep? Nice pic, good shallow DOF and the crop is also top. I would have run an an auto levels or adjusted the saturation on it to bring out the colors more.</td>', 'Is it asleep? Nice pic, good shallow DOF and the crop is also top. I would have run an an auto levels or adjusted the saturation on it to bring out the colors more.', '2003-04-24 11:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(276988, 19194, 6230, '<td valign="top">Reflections on the subject....is it real and alive???</td>', 'Reflections on the subject....is it real and alive???', '2003-04-24 11:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(276989, 18518, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a nice looking speciman of fauna! Looks a bit dangerous to me and he''s looking at you in a not so nice way :-) It''s a pity the lighting wasn''t optimal for you or else this would have been amazingly good. I mean it is good now, but the dark part at the front isn''t so enhancing.</td>', 'Now that''s a nice looking speciman of fauna! Looks a bit dangerous to me and he''s looking at you in a not so nice way :-) It''s a pity the lighting wasn''t optimal for you or else this would have been amazingly good. I mean it is good now, but the dark part at the front isn''t so enhancing.', '2003-04-24 11:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(276990, 18365, 6230, '<td valign="top">Looks like a toy made of wood or plastic......</td>', 'Looks like a toy made of wood or plastic......', '2003-04-24 11:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(276995, 18295, 6230, '<td valign="top">The animal does not looks as if it is alive without the eyes.........</td>', 'The animal does not looks as if it is alive without the eyes.........', '2003-04-24 11:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(276997, 19051, 6230, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the white "thing" at the lefthand bottom part of the image. Cropping would make the reflection of the duck headless.</td>', 'Too bad about the white "thing" at the lefthand bottom part of the image. Cropping would make the reflection of the duck headless.', '2003-04-24 12:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(276999, 19038, 2586, '<td valign="top">How lucky you were to find this group photo op. These models are great. Nice picture, good composition, nice dof. My only question is whether this was oversharpened a little as my eye reads the branches and twigs on which the pelikans are sitting as a little too busy. It might have helped (for me!) if you had cropped out the bottom until about the first center pole. That would also give even more emphasis on the pelikans. 8 Journey</td>', 'How lucky you were to find this group photo op. These models are great. Nice picture, good composition, nice dof. My only question is whether this was oversharpened a little as my eye reads the branches and twigs on which the pelikans are sitting as a little too busy. It might have helped (for me!) if you had cropped out the bottom until about the first center pole. That would also give even more emphasis on the pelikans. 8 Journey', '2003-04-24 12:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(277001, 18729, 2586, '<td valign="top">This picture has a lot of ''presence''. That''s probably due to the nice curvy composition and the wonderful complimentary colors of the orangy-red beak and the olive green background. Really nice colors, nice clarity, nice dof. 8 Journey</td>', 'This picture has a lot of ''presence''. That''s probably due to the nice curvy composition and the wonderful complimentary colors of the orangy-red beak and the olive green background. Really nice colors, nice clarity, nice dof. 8 Journey', '2003-04-24 12:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(277007, 19051, 2586, '<td valign="top">Really nice, ''quiet'' picture. Like the colors, especially the warm reddish orange against the greyish blue water. Excellent composition. Love the goose''s reflection. You may get some comments about the white shape next to the bird (litter?) but the sape is so nicely abstract that it doesn''t bother me or actually adds a hint of mystery.  My only (post-challenge) suggestion would be to edit out that grey shape next to the goose''s white tail; it''s a little distracting (nitpick). 8 Journey</td>', 'Really nice, ''quiet'' picture. Like the colors, especially the warm reddish orange against the greyish blue water. Excellent composition. Love the goose''s reflection. You may get some comments about the white shape next to the bird (litter?) but the sape is so nicely abstract that it doesn''t bother me or actually adds a hint of mystery.  My only (post-challenge) suggestion would be to edit out that grey shape next to the goose''s white tail; it''s a little distracting (nitpick). 8 Journey', '2003-04-24 12:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(277008, 19038, 772, '<td valign="top">I can''t really put my finger on what it is about this image that is so strong... I love it... I think it''s partially the repeating patterns created by the pelicans and the chaos of the brush pile... the composition here is excellent... great work :) = 10 - setzler</td>', 'I can''t really put my finger on what it is about this image that is so strong... I love it... I think it''s partially the repeating patterns created by the pelicans and the chaos of the brush pile... the composition here is excellent... great work :) = 10 - setzler', '2003-04-24 12:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(277011, 18800, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent photo... being able to see the color in the eyes here is a strong element :)  I love watching mocking birds harass the neighborhood cats :) great shot.. = 10 - setzler</td>', 'excellent photo... being able to see the color in the eyes here is a strong element :)  I love watching mocking birds harass the neighborhood cats :) great shot.. = 10 - setzler', '2003-04-24 12:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(277012, 18816, 4729, '<td valign="top">Very nice family portrait, wish it were a little sharper, though.</td>', 'Very nice family portrait, wish it were a little sharper, though.', '2003-04-24 12:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
