(277636, 19211, 7033, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, colorful shot!  (Not sure it meets the challenge, though.)  Focus seems a bit soft on the right half of the frame.</td>', 'Fantastic, colorful shot!  (Not sure it meets the challenge, though.)  Focus seems a bit soft on the right half of the frame.', '2003-04-24 23:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
