(277650, 18342, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning photo that''s got great color and is a fantastic macro shot.  I do feel, however, that it''s a bit too overexposed.</td>', 'This is a stunning photo that''s got great color and is a fantastic macro shot.  I do feel, however, that it''s a bit too overexposed.', '2003-04-24 23:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(277659, 18688, 6172, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, nice subject.  The background looks staged.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, nice subject.  The background looks staged.', '2003-04-25 00:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(277660, 19088, 6172, '<td valign="top">Deduct a point for animal cruelty :)</td>', 'Deduct a point for animal cruelty :)', '2003-04-25 00:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(277664, 18743, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like this photo alot cause it''s so reminiscent of spring and has a great feel to it. The foliage and flowers and sky are just so bright they make me feel so good...I do however, think that you lost too much detail in the subject of the photo. Possibly spot metering of the bird would have gotten you more accurate exposure. I still like it alot all the same.</td>', 'I like this photo alot cause it''s so reminiscent of spring and has a great feel to it. The foliage and flowers and sky are just so bright they make me feel so good...I do however, think that you lost too much detail in the subject of the photo. Possibly spot metering of the bird would have gotten you more accurate exposure. I still like it alot all the same.', '2003-04-25 00:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(277678, 18609, 5400, '<td valign="top">pretty animal :). I think it''s a little bit overexposed.</td>', 'pretty animal :). I think it''s a little bit overexposed.', '2003-04-25 00:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(277680, 19139, 5400, '<td valign="top">This could have been a great shot if the focus was on the little birds themselves, and not on their nest...</td>', 'This could have been a great shot if the focus was on the little birds themselves, and not on their nest...', '2003-04-25 00:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(277691, 18803, 70, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite shot of the challenge. The lighting is perfect, the cropping is good and the photo is crisp and clear. Good job!</td>', 'This is my favorite shot of the challenge. The lighting is perfect, the cropping is good and the photo is crisp and clear. Good job!', '2003-04-25 00:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(277692, 18898, 70, '<td valign="top">Great catch. Nice background and good cropping.</td>', 'Great catch. Nice background and good cropping.', '2003-04-25 00:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(277694, 18490, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice detail. The background really adds to this shot. Spots on the window (?) detracts a bit but still a very nice shot.</td>', 'Nice detail. The background really adds to this shot. Spots on the window (?) detracts a bit but still a very nice shot.', '2003-04-25 00:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(277695, 18364, 6504, '<td valign="top">Hooray!! That''s a great picture, the clarity, light, compostion.  All.   And what a beauty of a cat -- to boot.</td>', 'Hooray!! That''s a great picture, the clarity, light, compostion.  All.   And what a beauty of a cat -- to boot.', '2003-04-25 00:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(277696, 19054, 6504, '<td valign="top">GREAT picture.  Perfect photographically in every way.    How ever in the word did you get this snail to perform long enough for a picture?</td>', 'GREAT picture.  Perfect photographically in every way.    How ever in the word did you get this snail to perform long enough for a picture?', '2003-04-25 00:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(277700, 19205, 6504, '<td valign="top">This has to be the winner!  Perfect picture and perfect timing.  Nice colors <br/>good background.  A 10 for this.</td>', 'This has to be the winner!  Perfect picture and perfect timing.  Nice colors good background.  A 10 for this.', '2003-04-25 01:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(277712, 18441, 3343, '<td valign="top">Where''s the fauna</td>', 'Where''s the fauna', '2003-04-25 01:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(277716, 18736, 3669, '<td valign="top">I''m having a tough time trying to decide what the creature is in the water.   My first thought is a sea turtle, but they don''t have long legs like this creature seems to have.  Could be water distortion...hmmm.  Other than a turtle, I don''t have any other guesses.  Okay, onto the voting...I feel that this is a good photo and that it meets the challenge, assuming that what I''m seeing is actually an animal..LOL  It is well framed...no wasted space.  The subjects are in good position.  I like how you were able to capture the water coming off the human.  Although maybe just a tad on the bright side and washed out, I like the colors and the glare off the water drops.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m having a tough time trying to decide what the creature is in the water.   My first thought is a sea turtle, but they don''t have long legs like this creature seems to have.  Could be water distortion...hmmm.  Other than a turtle, I don''t have any other guesses.  Okay, onto the voting...I feel that this is a good photo and that it meets the challenge, assuming that what I''m seeing is actually an animal..LOL  It is well framed...no wasted space.  The subjects are in good position.  I like how you were able to capture the water coming off the human.  Although maybe just a tad on the bright side and washed out, I like the colors and the glare off the water drops.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-25 01:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(277719, 19050, 5822, '<td valign="top">The harsh lighting makes for dark shadows that obscure and confuse the image here.</td>', 'The harsh lighting makes for dark shadows that obscure and confuse the image here.', '2003-04-25 02:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(277723, 18750, 3669, '<td valign="top">I could be wrong, but this looks like a picture taken with a low resolution camera.  When I had my first digital camera, I had problems getting good images that were in nice focus if they were taken at a distance.  Only thing I could do was always take pictures outside in natural light and get close to my objects so they filled the whole picture and I didn''t have to do any cropping in post-process.  Also, I found the zoom to be practically worthless in obtaining clear shots.  This is a beautiful tiger, but the blurriness distracts from seeing the details in his face.  I don''t know if you cropped in post-processing, but his hind end or rather his tail is cut off.  He needs just a little more space.  It''s neat how he seems to be looking at you, so good capture.  Good luck and keep working.</td>', 'I could be wrong, but this looks like a picture taken with a low resolution camera.  When I had my first digital camera, I had problems getting good images that were in nice focus if they were taken at a distance.  Only thing I could do was always take pictures outside in natural light and get close to my objects so they filled the whole picture and I didn''t have to do any cropping in post-process.  Also, I found the zoom to be practically worthless in obtaining clear shots.  This is a beautiful tiger, but the blurriness distracts from seeing the details in his face.  I don''t know if you cropped in post-processing, but his hind end or rather his tail is cut off.  He needs just a little more space.  It''s neat how he seems to be looking at you, so good capture.  Good luck and keep working.', '2003-04-25 02:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(277724, 18688, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like this photo alot as it''s very interesting and I feel I''m looking at a rare and exotic butterfly, but I find that the harsh lighting has made a for some dark and hard edged shadows to the left and below the main subject. Using fill light possibly would have helped that and improved the color rendition as well.</td>', 'I like this photo alot as it''s very interesting and I feel I''m looking at a rare and exotic butterfly, but I find that the harsh lighting has made a for some dark and hard edged shadows to the left and below the main subject. Using fill light possibly would have helped that and improved the color rendition as well.', '2003-04-25 02:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(277727, 18556, 5628, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot!</td>', 'Stunning shot!', '2003-04-25 02:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(277728, 18526, 1202, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe the clarity of you shot!   I assume this was taken through glass, if so you did a great job of eliminating the glare and reflections.   One of my 10''s this week.  Good job.</td>', 'I can''t believe the clarity of you shot!   I assume this was taken through glass, if so you did a great job of eliminating the glare and reflections.   One of my 10''s this week.  Good job.', '2003-04-25 02:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(277729, 19019, 3669, '<td valign="top">I love this bird in this picture and how it relates to the title that you gave it.  The picture itself is in good focus, but one thing I''m learning about right now is DOF.  This is another good example, I believe, where a narrower DOF would blurr out the background and bring out the bird better.  I''m getting slammed for that in my photo and I''m still trying to figure it all out myself.  If you''re like me, I only can control 2 f-stop settings on my camera and I always seem to forget which is which...LOL.  I guess we all gotta learn.  Anyway, the only other thing that I see is that it''s a little dark.   Unfortunately more than half the bird is in shadow, but a little adjustment to brightness/contrast in post-process will help brighten it up some.  Good capture and good luck in this challenge and those in the future.</td>', 'I love this bird in this picture and how it relates to the title that you gave it.  The picture itself is in good focus, but one thing I''m learning about right now is DOF.  This is another good example, I believe, where a narrower DOF would blurr out the background and bring out the bird better.  I''m getting slammed for that in my photo and I''m still trying to figure it all out myself.  If you''re like me, I only can control 2 f-stop settings on my camera and I always seem to forget which is which...LOL.  I guess we all gotta learn.  Anyway, the only other thing that I see is that it''s a little dark.   Unfortunately more than half the bird is in shadow, but a little adjustment to brightness/contrast in post-process will help brighten it up some.  Good capture and good luck in this challenge and those in the future.', '2003-04-25 02:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(277730, 18962, 1202, '<td valign="top">I like your use of DOF and super cropping.   Great focus and composition.   Very professional job.   10</td>', 'I like your use of DOF and super cropping.   Great focus and composition.   Very professional job.   10', '2003-04-25 02:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(277731, 18528, 1202, '<td valign="top">Perfect in every way, focus, composition, color and crop.   10</td>', 'Perfect in every way, focus, composition, color and crop.   10', '2003-04-25 02:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(277732, 18435, 1202, '<td valign="top">You get a 10 from me this week.   An outstanding job.</td>', 'You get a 10 from me this week.   An outstanding job.', '2003-04-25 02:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(277733, 18950, 1202, '<td valign="top">Shots of this quality are hard to get.   It looks as though he is stopped just waiting for you to take your sweet time.   10</td>', 'Shots of this quality are hard to get.   It looks as though he is stopped just waiting for you to take your sweet time.   10', '2003-04-25 02:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(277735, 18845, 3669, '<td valign="top">You did really good on this photo.  I''m learning and practicing on improving my DOF when I take pictures and I believe that this is a good example of proper DOF.  The bird is nicely in focus and stands out from the background.  I like how you were able to bring out the texture of the wood plank that he''s sitting on.  The perfectionist in me also notices that the bottom board is even when you cropped.  My only suggestion is that it''s a tad on the dark side and maybe a little adjustment would brighten it up some and help the bird stand out more in the picture.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You did really good on this photo.  I''m learning and practicing on improving my DOF when I take pictures and I believe that this is a good example of proper DOF.  The bird is nicely in focus and stands out from the background.  I like how you were able to bring out the texture of the wood plank that he''s sitting on.  The perfectionist in me also notices that the bottom board is even when you cropped.  My only suggestion is that it''s a tad on the dark side and maybe a little adjustment would brighten it up some and help the bird stand out more in the picture.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-25 02:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(277738, 19057, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture.  A bit overexposed.  Could use some adjustment in the brightness/contrast area to allow the people, objects and color stand out more.  The bright light coming in the window is a little too bright and distracting, but maybe the adjustments would fix that some...or could crop it out.  This picture really shows a lot of activity and you portrayed it well.  I love your title, even though it''s a little long.  I really like this picture, but, although humans are mammals, I have a hard time fitting them into fauna.  Picture-wise, it scores high, in my opinion.</td>', 'Very cool picture.  A bit overexposed.  Could use some adjustment in the brightness/contrast area to allow the people, objects and color stand out more.  The bright light coming in the window is a little too bright and distracting, but maybe the adjustments would fix that some...or could crop it out.  This picture really shows a lot of activity and you portrayed it well.  I love your title, even though it''s a little long.  I really like this picture, but, although humans are mammals, I have a hard time fitting them into fauna.  Picture-wise, it scores high, in my opinion.', '2003-04-25 02:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(277740, 18496, 3669, '<td valign="top">A very brave take on the challenge.  Unique, I''d have to say.  I''ll have to admit that I expected live animals.  However, your picture is colorful and very "Easter-ish".  Except for the purple bunnie in the middle and the small one in front of him, most all the other animals are cut off with the cropping.  Maybe with a little better positioning, more of them could get fully in the photo.  Focus is good.  Might be just a tad dark.  With a little adjustment in post-processing, it would brighten them up and show their colors better.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A very brave take on the challenge.  Unique, I''d have to say.  I''ll have to admit that I expected live animals.  However, your picture is colorful and very "Easter-ish".  Except for the purple bunnie in the middle and the small one in front of him, most all the other animals are cut off with the cropping.  Maybe with a little better positioning, more of them could get fully in the photo.  Focus is good.  Might be just a tad dark.  With a little adjustment in post-processing, it would brighten them up and show their colors better.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-25 02:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(277742, 19067, 3669, '<td valign="top">I really don''t find this photo very pleasing as I''m sure many have commented on.  You were very brave in submitting a photo like this in the challenge.  It definately emits an emotion of the "poor Bambi" effect.  It was fitting to desaturate the colors and it works well.  There is absolutely nothing wrong with the technical aspects of this photo from what I can see....it''s just an icky subject and one that most people will vote down because of it.  I''ll be interested in finding out where you place.</td>', 'I really don''t find this photo very pleasing as I''m sure many have commented on.  You were very brave in submitting a photo like this in the challenge.  It definately emits an emotion of the "poor Bambi" effect.  It was fitting to desaturate the colors and it works well.  There is absolutely nothing wrong with the technical aspects of this photo from what I can see....it''s just an icky subject and one that most people will vote down because of it.  I''ll be interested in finding out where you place.', '2003-04-25 02:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(277745, 19193, 3669, '<td valign="top">Oh ick...I really dislike this photo just because of what the subject is, but I try to be fair since death is a part of life and it''s reality whether we want to face it or not.  One has to ask, though, what is the purpose for taken such a photo...shock value?  art?...I don''t know.  However, enough sermon.  You were brave submitting such a picture for the challenge as I''m sure most people will vote it down just for the negitive subject matter.  Technically, it is not all that bad.  Perhaps a little out of focus.</td>', 'Oh ick...I really dislike this photo just because of what the subject is, but I try to be fair since death is a part of life and it''s reality whether we want to face it or not.  One has to ask, though, what is the purpose for taken such a photo...shock value?  art?...I don''t know.  However, enough sermon.  You were brave submitting such a picture for the challenge as I''m sure most people will vote it down just for the negitive subject matter.  Technically, it is not all that bad.  Perhaps a little out of focus.', '2003-04-25 02:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(277747, 18444, 5822, '<td valign="top">This picture is so busy that it''s hard to look at. It''s hard to seperate the main subject from the background and I think it would have been better if you were able to isolate the bird from the background, maybe with a more narrow DOF.</td>', 'This picture is so busy that it''s hard to look at. It''s hard to seperate the main subject from the background and I think it would have been better if you were able to isolate the bird from the background, maybe with a more narrow DOF.', '2003-04-25 03:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(277748, 18626, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very distinquished guy or gal, but very sad.  With the exception of the annoying stick in the foreground, which I know couldn''t be helped, this well composed.  He/she is framed nicely in the picture.  The lighting is good.  It''s just over-sharpened.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very distinquished guy or gal, but very sad.  With the exception of the annoying stick in the foreground, which I know couldn''t be helped, this well composed.  He/she is framed nicely in the picture.  The lighting is good.  It''s just over-sharpened.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-25 03:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(277751, 18298, 3669, '<td valign="top">You know, this photo really needs a bigger subject.  It''s pretty blurry and my eyes really can''t find anything to identify.  I make every attempt to comment positive as well as negitive when I do, but to be brutally honest, I can''t find anything postive.  Sorry.</td>', 'You know, this photo really needs a bigger subject.  It''s pretty blurry and my eyes really can''t find anything to identify.  I make every attempt to comment positive as well as negitive when I do, but to be brutally honest, I can''t find anything postive.  Sorry.', '2003-04-25 03:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(277752, 18962, 51167, '<td valign="top">I love the way you''ve framed this.  Great shot!!</td>', 'I love the way you''ve framed this.  Great shot!!', '2003-04-25 03:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(277754, 19134, 51167, '<td valign="top">what is that other lizard?  It looks like it has mouths for feet.  Very cool looking.  Good shot.</td>', 'what is that other lizard?  It looks like it has mouths for feet.  Very cool looking.  Good shot.', '2003-04-25 03:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(277755, 18965, 3669, '<td valign="top">To be brutally honest, I''m not sure what the purpose of this picture is except maybe to be gross.  You were brave in submitting a photo like this in the challenge if you were serious in photography.  To be fair, I strive to comment on the positive aspects of a photo as well as the negitive.  However, I really can''t find anything positive.  Lighting seems to be off and it''s just a slightly blurred image of a dead fish.</td>', 'To be brutally honest, I''m not sure what the purpose of this picture is except maybe to be gross.  You were brave in submitting a photo like this in the challenge if you were serious in photography.  To be fair, I strive to comment on the positive aspects of a photo as well as the negitive.  However, I really can''t find anything positive.  Lighting seems to be off and it''s just a slightly blurred image of a dead fish.', '2003-04-25 03:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(277757, 18942, 5822, '<td valign="top">I find that the interesting lines and textures of the wooden fence and masonry overwhelm the little bird which is partly covered in shadow and lacks the intricate detail of the other larger and more interesting elements. Perhaps a tighter shot of the bird would have worked better.</td>', 'I find that the interesting lines and textures of the wooden fence and masonry overwhelm the little bird which is partly covered in shadow and lacks the intricate detail of the other larger and more interesting elements. Perhaps a tighter shot of the bird would have worked better.', '2003-04-25 03:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(277759, 19107, 3669, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion, but I think I would have like to have seen a side angle view to this horse and carriage.  We could see more of his harness get-up and part of the carriage that he is hitched to.  From what I can see, he may be fairly thin and a side view would be disturbing if that were true, but would definately hit home the slave part.  I do like the fact that we only see the feet of the owner.  Technically, I find nothing wrong...it is well focused and lighting is appropriate.</td>', 'Just my opinion, but I think I would have like to have seen a side angle view to this horse and carriage.  We could see more of his harness get-up and part of the carriage that he is hitched to.  From what I can see, he may be fairly thin and a side view would be disturbing if that were true, but would definately hit home the slave part.  I do like the fact that we only see the feet of the owner.  Technically, I find nothing wrong...it is well focused and lighting is appropriate.', '2003-04-25 03:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(277762, 18546, 5822, '<td valign="top">While the setting here is correctly exposed, the main subjects of the photo (cattle) are too dark and lack detail. Perhaps spot metering of one of the cows would have corrected this matter. Also, I would prefer for you to have used a landscape format here.</td>', 'While the setting here is correctly exposed, the main subjects of the photo (cattle) are too dark and lack detail. Perhaps spot metering of one of the cows would have corrected this matter. Also, I would prefer for you to have used a landscape format here.', '2003-04-25 03:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(277763, 19124, 5822, '<td valign="top">The blue cast here is perfect and gives "atomosphere" and I also like the way the rocks and birds mimick each otther.</td>', 'The blue cast here is perfect and gives "atomosphere" and I also like the way the rocks and birds mimick each otther.', '2003-04-25 03:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(277777, 18923, 5728, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! You have really caught the moment with this photo. The expressions on those faces are priceless, well done.</td>', 'I love this shot! You have really caught the moment with this photo. The expressions on those faces are priceless, well done.', '2003-04-25 04:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(277778, 19124, 5728, '<td valign="top">The blue tone comes through well here. Grouping the gulls together and asking them to all walk in the same direction was a good idea. I especially like the placement of the gulls in your pic and the rocks in the foreground give it that extra touch. The blue frame might be overdoing it just a tad though, it clashed with the other blues in the image.</td>', 'The blue tone comes through well here. Grouping the gulls together and asking them to all walk in the same direction was a good idea. I especially like the placement of the gulls in your pic and the rocks in the foreground give it that extra touch. The blue frame might be overdoing it just a tad though, it clashed with the other blues in the image.', '2003-04-25 04:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(277779, 18782, 5728, '<td valign="top">Even though the fence is a nuisance (I know myself from shooting at the zoo last weekend!) it doesn''t seem to be so bothersome in this image. The positioning of the "fauna" is optimal and the cropping, although tight, is also good. The only small problem is the overall darkness in the image, but I guess you couldn''t have done too much about that right?</td>', 'Even though the fence is a nuisance (I know myself from shooting at the zoo last weekend!) it doesn''t seem to be so bothersome in this image. The positioning of the "fauna" is optimal and the cropping, although tight, is also good. The only small problem is the overall darkness in the image, but I guess you couldn''t have done too much about that right?', '2003-04-25 04:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(277780, 18384, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice soft image here which does look appealing. The choice to go black and white with sepia toning wasn''t wrong, it looks very good! Maybe there is just a little too much softness in your "fauna", but it isn''t negative at all. Good job.</td>', 'Nice soft image here which does look appealing. The choice to go black and white with sepia toning wasn''t wrong, it looks very good! Maybe there is just a little too much softness in your "fauna", but it isn''t negative at all. Good job.', '2003-04-25 04:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(277785, 18986, 6913, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture. I would like to see more light on the lamb though to increase the contrast with the background.</td>', 'Lovely picture. I would like to see more light on the lamb though to increase the contrast with the background.', '2003-04-25 05:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(277787, 19183, 6913, '<td valign="top">Hazy - is it taken early in the morning? Anyway, it probably needs Levels adjustment...</td>', 'Hazy - is it taken early in the morning? Anyway, it probably needs Levels adjustment...', '2003-04-25 05:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(277789, 19202, 6913, '<td valign="top">It is very beautiful - I like the contrast between the reeds and the reflection of the blue sky...</td>', 'It is very beautiful - I like the contrast between the reeds and the reflection of the blue sky...', '2003-04-25 05:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(277791, 18775, 6913, '<td valign="top">Amazing DOF here...</td>', 'Amazing DOF here...', '2003-04-25 05:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(277792, 18765, 7687, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a great shot.  I love the color and sharpness, not to mention the composition!</td>', 'Wow, this is a great shot.  I love the color and sharpness, not to mention the composition!', '2003-04-25 05:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(277793, 18526, 7687, '<td valign="top">Holy cow!  This is just a great image, there''s not much more I can say.</td>', 'Holy cow!  This is just a great image, there''s not much more I can say.', '2003-04-25 05:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(277794, 19165, 6913, '<td valign="top">Another crop? to shift the squirrel off centre a bit and take advantage of the thick branches shap... The thin branches on the left are distracting.</td>', 'Another crop? to shift the squirrel off centre a bit and take advantage of the thick branches shap... The thin branches on the left are distracting.', '2003-04-25 05:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(277796, 19020, 6913, '<td valign="top">Witty...</td>', 'Witty...', '2003-04-25 05:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(277797, 19134, 6913, '<td valign="top">Great shot - it is so difficult to shoot in these conditions!</td>', 'Great shot - it is so difficult to shoot in these conditions!', '2003-04-25 06:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(277803, 18942, 6913, '<td valign="top">I like the monochrome feel of this shot...</td>', 'I like the monochrome feel of this shot...', '2003-04-25 06:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(277806, 19126, 6913, '<td valign="top">The sun is too high - it left your turtle overexposed, while deepening the shadows too much...</td>', 'The sun is too high - it left your turtle overexposed, while deepening the shadows too much...', '2003-04-25 06:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(277811, 18832, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice macro with good DOF. Iparticularly like the ''step'' arrangement of the leaves in the background.</td>', 'Nice macro with good DOF. Iparticularly like the ''step'' arrangement of the leaves in the background.', '2003-04-25 07:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(277812, 18345, 3290, '<td valign="top">The brightly-lit segments of sky detract rather from the main subject. This one would benefit greatly from a tighter crop, I think.</td>', 'The brightly-lit segments of sky detract rather from the main subject. This one would benefit greatly from a tighter crop, I think.', '2003-04-25 07:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(277813, 18798, 3290, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Could perhaps use a tad more sharpness but you''ve done well to capture it at all. Lovely warm colours in it too. Well done.</td>', 'Lovely. Could perhaps use a tad more sharpness but you''ve done well to capture it at all. Lovely warm colours in it too. Well done.', '2003-04-25 07:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(277814, 18782, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great subject, shame about the bars. You could perhaps have blurred them by moving the camera lens right up close to them.</td>', 'Great subject, shame about the bars. You could perhaps have blurred them by moving the camera lens right up close to them.', '2003-04-25 07:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(277816, 18962, 3290, '<td valign="top">This could be the winner. Great composition, and the contrast between the green grass and stripey zebra works very well indeed. Well done.</td>', 'This could be the winner. Great composition, and the contrast between the green grass and stripey zebra works very well indeed. Well done.', '2003-04-25 07:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(277817, 18792, 3290, '<td valign="top">Lovely birds, but the background is something of a distraction. A bit less DOF would have helped.</td>', 'Lovely birds, but the background is something of a distraction. A bit less DOF would have helped.', '2003-04-25 07:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(277818, 18907, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice, but the head loses impact against the brightly-lit sky. A darker background would have worked much better (but difficult if there isn''t one :-)</td>', 'Nice, but the head loses impact against the brightly-lit sky. A darker background would have worked much better (but difficult if there isn''t one :-)', '2003-04-25 07:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(277819, 18554, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very nice cathc of an attractive subject in an unusual pose. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice cathc of an attractive subject in an unusual pose. Well done.', '2003-04-25 07:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(277824, 18981, 3028, '<td valign="top">The date!!!!</td>', 'The date!!!!', '2003-04-25 07:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(277827, 19189, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with pleasant warm colours. What sort of bird is it?</td>', 'Nice composition with pleasant warm colours. What sort of bird is it?', '2003-04-25 07:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(277828, 18604, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pleasant colours and nice sharp, clear shot. Was it shot underwater or through glass?</td>', 'Pleasant colours and nice sharp, clear shot. Was it shot underwater or through glass?', '2003-04-25 07:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(277829, 18344, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective - could use a little more DOF. The background and reflections in the eyes are a distraction.</td>', 'Nice perspective - could use a little more DOF. The background and reflections in the eyes are a distraction.', '2003-04-25 07:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(277830, 18869, 3290, '<td valign="top">Would benefit from a tighter crop on the left, I think.</td>', 'Would benefit from a tighter crop on the left, I think.', '2003-04-25 07:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(277833, 18957, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. I''d like to see the bird occupy more of the picture, I think.</td>', 'Nice catch. I''d like to see the bird occupy more of the picture, I think.', '2003-04-25 07:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(277834, 18728, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great textures. I tink I''d try it without the water - just the alligators.</td>', 'Great textures. I tink I''d try it without the water - just the alligators.', '2003-04-25 07:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(277836, 19049, 3290, '<td valign="top">This would have been marvellous with a tight crop around the ostrich''s head, I think. The wires are a distraction.</td>', 'This would have been marvellous with a tight crop around the ostrich''s head, I think. The wires are a distraction.', '2003-04-25 07:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(277838, 18898, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The best shot like this I''ve seen this challenge (so far). A tad more sharpness (and lightness) wouldn''t have gone amiss, but this is still very good. Is the squirrel friendly or do you have a long lens?</td>', 'Great composition. The best shot like this I''ve seen this challenge (so far). A tad more sharpness (and lightness) wouldn''t have gone amiss, but this is still very good. Is the squirrel friendly or do you have a long lens?', '2003-04-25 07:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(277840, 18688, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great colours.</td>', 'Great colours.', '2003-04-25 07:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(277842, 18577, 3290, '<td valign="top">The picture is too small and from what I can see, the duck''s flanks are overexposed. If you camera has it, try centre-weighted or even spot metering next time.</td>', 'The picture is too small and from what I can see, the duck''s flanks are overexposed. If you camera has it, try centre-weighted or even spot metering next time.', '2003-04-25 07:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(277846, 18719, 3290, '<td valign="top">Some nasty pixellation on the dusk''s wings - perhaps too high a level of compression? Or did you resize it to a very low res? Or is it a very low-res camera?</td>', 'Some nasty pixellation on the dusk''s wings - perhaps too high a level of compression? Or did you resize it to a very low res? Or is it a very low-res camera?', '2003-04-25 07:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(277848, 18528, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice. A nit pick: the shadow of the crest spoils the detail on the bird''s face. But still a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice. A nit pick: the shadow of the crest spoils the detail on the bird''s face. But still a nice shot.', '2003-04-25 07:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(277849, 18444, 3290, '<td valign="top">Camouflage at work: the bird is rather hard to distinguish from the background. The shot alos seems a little overexposed.</td>', 'Camouflage at work: the bird is rather hard to distinguish from the background. The shot alos seems a little overexposed.', '2003-04-25 07:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(277850, 18542, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good catch, but the bright background is a distraction. Also, a tighter crop wouldn''t hurt, IMHO.</td>', 'Good catch, but the bright background is a distraction. Also, a tighter crop wouldn''t hurt, IMHO.', '2003-04-25 07:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(277851, 19211, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. But where are the fauna?</td>', 'Very pretty. But where are the fauna?', '2003-04-25 07:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(277852, 18503, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good one. Lovely definition on the wings and neck. Crop a bit off the left to make the bird less central and ovoid the empty space.</td>', 'Good one. Lovely definition on the wings and neck. Crop a bit off the left to make the bird less central and ovoid the empty space.', '2003-04-25 07:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(277853, 19163, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great colours and sense of motion. I really like this. I''d crop some off the bottom.</td>', 'Great colours and sense of motion. I really like this. I''d crop some off the bottom.', '2003-04-25 07:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(277854, 18883, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. Lose the part-bird on the right and some of the empty space on the left, then make the whole thing bigger.</td>', 'Nice catch. Lose the part-bird on the right and some of the empty space on the left, then make the whole thing bigger.', '2003-04-25 07:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(277855, 18812, 3290, '<td valign="top">Made me smile. Nice catch. And how did you get that expression out of a Rhino? Well done.</td>', 'Made me smile. Nice catch. And how did you get that expression out of a Rhino? Well done.', '2003-04-25 07:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(277856, 18593, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Crop tightly around the flower, since it''s central anyway and that''s the focus. The empty space arounbd the edges is wasted, IMHO.</td>', 'Pretty. Crop tightly around the flower, since it''s central anyway and that''s the focus. The empty space arounbd the edges is wasted, IMHO.', '2003-04-25 08:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(277857, 18286, 3290, '<td valign="top">Beautiful creature.</td>', 'Beautiful creature.', '2003-04-25 08:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(277858, 18447, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool. Seems rather overdsharpened, which spoils it a bit.</td>', 'Cool. Seems rather overdsharpened, which spoils it a bit.', '2003-04-25 08:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(277860, 18394, 3290, '<td valign="top">Way too small - you''re allowed a dimension of 640 pixels on the longest side. If your file was too big, increase the amount of JPEG compression (i.e. reduce the quality) when you save your file with your editing software.</td>', 'Way too small - you''re allowed a dimension of 640 pixels on the longest side. If your file was too big, increase the amount of JPEG compression (i.e. reduce the quality) when you save your file with your editing software.', '2003-04-25 08:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(277861, 18334, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice. I''d lose some of the empty space above its head.</td>', 'Nice. I''d lose some of the empty space above its head.', '2003-04-25 08:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(277866, 18599, 6325, '<td valign="top">Well composed. Focus and detail are appropriate for this subject.</td>', 'Well composed. Focus and detail are appropriate for this subject.', '2003-04-25 08:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(277869, 18447, 3320, '<td valign="top">Great pictures, I like the composition. I think it''s oversharpened. 8</td>', 'Great pictures, I like the composition. I think it''s oversharpened. 8', '2003-04-25 08:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(277870, 19045, 3320, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Does the noise come heavy sharpening ? 7</td>', 'Nice composition. Does the noise come heavy sharpening ? 7', '2003-04-25 08:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(277871, 18937, 3320, '<td valign="top">Very nice .. almost like an abstract ... I like itcomposition is perfect for me. very nice , one of my prefered this week.8</td>', 'Very nice .. almost like an abstract ... I like itcomposition is perfect for me. very nice , one of my prefered this week.8', '2003-04-25 08:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(277901, 19014, 6284, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.', '2003-04-25 09:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(277916, 18575, 6261, '<td valign="top">great colors, sharp focus - I''m not a border fan but I love this photo.</td>', 'great colors, sharp focus - I''m not a border fan but I love this photo.', '2003-04-25 09:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(277919, 18526, 6261, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2003-04-25 09:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(277926, 19137, 6261, '<td valign="top">Great Capture</td>', 'Great Capture', '2003-04-25 09:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(277927, 18362, 6202, '<td valign="top">The dog itself is beautiful.  Not sure how you are doing in the voting but I think you could have improved on the beauty of the dog by cropping in on one side.  If you crop in from the left and remove the plants you make the dog appear to be gaurding the bird cage.  If you were to crop in from the right you would make it appear the dog is watching something in the plants.  As it is now, its just a pretty dog sitting there with a lot going on around it.</td>', 'The dog itself is beautiful.  Not sure how you are doing in the voting but I think you could have improved on the beauty of the dog by cropping in on one side.  If you crop in from the left and remove the plants you make the dog appear to be gaurding the bird cage.  If you were to crop in from the right you would make it appear the dog is watching something in the plants.  As it is now, its just a pretty dog sitting there with a lot going on around it.', '2003-04-25 09:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(277928, 18491, 6202, '<td valign="top">This is definately one of the most colorful and different photos of the week, but now with transportation being next weeks challenge bet you wish you could use it again.</td>', 'This is definately one of the most colorful and different photos of the week, but now with transportation being next weeks challenge bet you wish you could use it again.', '2003-04-25 09:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(277937, 18765, 6261, '<td valign="top">Awesome - I love being able to see a hint of the garden in the background (and a blurry little bug).  Because of your background and excellant cropping, your image tells us a story of the beauty of spring and possibly where this guy has been, without the background you have another great macro of an insect on a flower.  This was my favorite!  Thanks for the pleasure.</td>', 'Awesome - I love being able to see a hint of the garden in the background (and a blurry little bug).  Because of your background and excellant cropping, your image tells us a story of the beauty of spring and possibly where this guy has been, without the background you have another great macro of an insect on a flower.  This was my favorite!  Thanks for the pleasure.', '2003-04-25 09:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(277938, 18447, 6261, '<td valign="top">Amazing - great job - great score</td>', 'Amazing - great job - great score', '2003-04-25 09:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(277939, 19054, 6261, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the colors of this image - great job</td>', 'I love the composition and the colors of this image - great job', '2003-04-25 09:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(277955, 19028, 2146, '<td valign="top">i like this one...very nice and clear..good work</td>', 'i like this one...very nice and clear..good work', '2003-04-25 10:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(277956, 19040, 2146, '<td valign="top">awwwww now that is sweet</td>', 'awwwww now that is sweet', '2003-04-25 10:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(277965, 18856, 8061, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2003-04-25 10:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(277967, 18696, 3735, '<td valign="top">Most interesting photo,  I have never seen a cow like this. Looks like she could use a few good meals. lol  Lighting is good and in good focus, I really like her horns as well.</td>', 'Most interesting photo,  I have never seen a cow like this. Looks like she could use a few good meals. lol  Lighting is good and in good focus, I really like her horns as well.', '2003-04-25 10:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(277968, 18966, 8061, '<td valign="top">good title, croping would have helped, along witha fill flash maybe.</td>', 'good title, croping would have helped, along witha fill flash maybe.', '2003-04-25 10:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(277969, 19099, 3735, '<td valign="top">very good photo and the blured backgrown is really good</td>', 'very good photo and the blured backgrown is really good', '2003-04-25 10:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
