(278214, 19132, 6230, '<td valign="top">Better if you can zoom in or get closer. Isn''t that a cockcroach.</td>', 'Better if you can zoom in or get closer. Isn''t that a cockcroach.', '2003-04-25 12:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(278218, 19009, 7711, '<td valign="top">adorable shot, though I feel as if I am being poked in the eyes by the out of focus flowers in the foreground. Might have benefitted from pushing a few of them aside or to the very edges of the frame?</td>', 'adorable shot, though I feel as if I am being poked in the eyes by the out of focus flowers in the foreground. Might have benefitted from pushing a few of them aside or to the very edges of the frame?', '2003-04-25 13:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(278220, 18862, 7711, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea to have it as a portrait set up, I''m sure you planned it that way! ;) It has an intimate sort of feel about it, and the focus is sharp on the lioness, though I think it might be a bit soft on the lion (might be my monitor though)</td>', 'Very cool idea to have it as a portrait set up, I''m sure you planned it that way! ;) It has an intimate sort of feel about it, and the focus is sharp on the lioness, though I think it might be a bit soft on the lion (might be my monitor though)', '2003-04-25 13:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(278222, 19127, 7711, '<td valign="top">no comments on the bit of something hanging down underneath the guy, though it is a bit distracting! Also seemed either over exposed or otherwise a bit bright and oversharp, though I like that he''s looking right at the camera! Good capture.</td>', 'no comments on the bit of something hanging down underneath the guy, though it is a bit distracting! Also seemed either over exposed or otherwise a bit bright and oversharp, though I like that he''s looking right at the camera! Good capture.', '2003-04-25 13:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(278223, 18800, 6230, '<td valign="top">Smaller DOF would have added more impact to the image. Good composition.</td>', 'Smaller DOF would have added more impact to the image. Good composition.', '2003-04-25 13:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(278224, 19104, 6477, '<td valign="top">a GREAT macro!</td>', 'a GREAT macro!', '2003-04-25 13:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(278225, 18518, 6230, '<td valign="top">Image a little dark at the front.</td>', 'Image a little dark at the front.', '2003-04-25 13:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(278227, 18649, 6230, '<td valign="top">A little dark on the bird''s face. Nice and interesting background.</td>', 'A little dark on the bird''s face. Nice and interesting background.', '2003-04-25 13:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(278229, 19141, 6230, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait of the "king".</td>', 'Nice portrait of the "king".', '2003-04-25 13:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(278230, 19167, 7711, '<td valign="top">Not sure I would have opted for bw on this one, but perhaps the colours were too similar to give the effect you wanted, I would be curious to see the colour version.</td>', 'Not sure I would have opted for bw on this one, but perhaps the colours were too similar to give the effect you wanted, I would be curious to see the colour version.', '2003-04-25 13:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(278232, 19052, 6230, '<td valign="top">Noisy background, smaller DOF would make the bird stand-out.</td>', 'Noisy background, smaller DOF would make the bird stand-out.', '2003-04-25 13:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(278233, 19049, 6230, '<td valign="top">Should have waited for the other bird to get out of the way or re-position yourself for a better composition. The wire is also another problem. Good focusing though.</td>', 'Should have waited for the other bird to get out of the way or re-position yourself for a better composition. The wire is also another problem. Good focusing though.', '2003-04-25 13:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(278235, 18813, 7639, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to hop on his back for a ride.</td>', 'Makes me want to hop on his back for a ride.', '2003-04-25 13:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(278236, 18865, 7711, '<td valign="top">lovely idea, though woefully out of focus and a bit dark on the dog..could you have focused on him to get your light reading (assuming your camera is like mine and not manual) and then recomposed to get the shot?</td>', 'lovely idea, though woefully out of focus and a bit dark on the dog..could you have focused on him to get your light reading (assuming your camera is like mine and not manual) and then recomposed to get the shot?', '2003-04-25 13:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(278237, 19162, 7711, '<td valign="top">neat reflections. I would have cut out more of the foreground to bring emphasis to the goose.</td>', 'neat reflections. I would have cut out more of the foreground to bring emphasis to the goose.', '2003-04-25 13:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(278238, 18518, 7639, '<td valign="top">There is something surreal about this picture.  Would make a great poster.</td>', 'There is something surreal about this picture.  Would make a great poster.', '2003-04-25 13:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(278239, 18686, 6230, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery. A little more contrast would be great.</td>', 'Nice scenery. A little more contrast would be great.', '2003-04-25 13:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(278241, 19163, 7639, '<td valign="top">Ferocious looking - I wonder if they''re good to eat.  I think the motion adds to the pic.</td>', 'Ferocious looking - I wonder if they''re good to eat.  I think the motion adds to the pic.', '2003-04-25 13:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(278242, 18519, 6230, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.......</td>', 'Nice portrait.......', '2003-04-25 13:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(278243, 18380, 7639, '<td valign="top">Like people, sometimes beauty can sting.</td>', 'Like people, sometimes beauty can sting.', '2003-04-25 13:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(278246, 18884, 6230, '<td valign="top">Good portrait and reflection.</td>', 'Good portrait and reflection.', '2003-04-25 13:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(278248, 18905, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2003-04-25 13:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(278250, 18647, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great colour contrast. This one''s crying out for a good cropping :-) I''d lose some of the blue either side and make it a more vertical composition.</td>', 'Great colour contrast. This one''s crying out for a good cropping :-) I''d lose some of the blue either side and make it a more vertical composition.', '2003-04-25 13:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(278251, 19098, 7639, '<td valign="top">Now you''re in Dutch. I couldn''t find the word ''sheeps'' in Websters dictionary.<br/>The sheep almost look posed.</td>', 'Now you''re in Dutch. I couldn''t find the word ''sheeps'' in Websters dictionary.The sheep almost look posed.', '2003-04-25 13:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(278252, 19038, 3290, '<td valign="top">All in a row! How much fish did you have to pay them to get them to pose?-) The foreground is a distraction - I''d lose some of it. Probably up to the post in the middle of the shot.</td>', 'All in a row! How much fish did you have to pay them to get them to pose?-) The foreground is a distraction - I''d lose some of it. Probably up to the post in the middle of the shot.', '2003-04-25 13:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(278254, 19150, 3290, '<td valign="top">Neat</td>', 'Neat', '2003-04-25 13:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(278256, 19105, 7639, '<td valign="top">Eerie effect with the moon.</td>', 'Eerie effect with the moon.', '2003-04-25 13:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(278257, 18793, 3290, '<td valign="top">Now *that''s* a cricket. What a monster. Nice catch. What is it and where do you get them?</td>', 'Now *that''s* a cricket. What a monster. Nice catch. What is it and where do you get them?', '2003-04-25 13:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(278258, 18676, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool. Is it a pet, or an unwelcome visitor. Good idea well executed.</td>', 'Cool. Is it a pet, or an unwelcome visitor. Good idea well executed.', '2003-04-25 13:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(278259, 19182, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good colours.</td>', 'Good colours.', '2003-04-25 13:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(278260, 18287, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice gaggle. If you''d moved round to the left a bit, you could have left out the path, which spoils the shot a bit.</td>', 'Nice gaggle. If you''d moved round to the left a bit, you could have left out the path, which spoils the shot a bit.', '2003-04-25 13:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(278262, 18937, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great colour on the water. The egret is a bit overexposed, but still a nice shot.</td>', 'Great colour on the water. The egret is a bit overexposed, but still a nice shot.', '2003-04-25 13:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(278264, 18856, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. Good sharpness and DOF. background is a slight distraction, but not too bad. Well done.</td>', 'Nice macro. Good sharpness and DOF. background is a slight distraction, but not too bad. Well done.', '2003-04-25 13:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(278266, 19141, 3290, '<td valign="top">Hope that''s not your leg :-) I like the way he''s looking right at the camera.</td>', 'Hope that''s not your leg :-) I like the way he''s looking right at the camera.', '2003-04-25 13:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(278267, 19025, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch.</td>', 'Nice catch.', '2003-04-25 13:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(278268, 19120, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice rural shot. Good job.I might crop out some of the green grass in the foreground.</td>', 'Nice rural shot. Good job.I might crop out some of the green grass in the foreground.', '2003-04-25 13:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(278269, 19200, 6230, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.........Nice composition though.</td>', 'Out of focus.........Nice composition though.', '2003-04-25 13:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(278271, 19030, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty (and serene). The crop is a little too tight for my tastes.</td>', 'Pretty (and serene). The crop is a little too tight for my tastes.', '2003-04-25 13:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(278273, 18441, 3290, '<td valign="top">oops. wrong challenge?</td>', 'oops. wrong challenge?', '2003-04-25 13:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(278274, 18598, 6230, '<td valign="top">Very soothing colours, it would have been better if the bee was facing the camera. Nothing you can do about that but wait or reposition yourself........</td>', 'Very soothing colours, it would have been better if the bee was facing the camera. Nothing you can do about that but wait or reposition yourself........', '2003-04-25 13:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(278275, 18491, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great colours and clarity. Would like to see a bigger version.</td>', 'Great colours and clarity. Would like to see a bigger version.', '2003-04-25 13:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(278276, 18519, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice use of (lack of) colour.</td>', 'Nice use of (lack of) colour.', '2003-04-25 13:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(278277, 18798, 6230, '<td valign="top">Great shot, is the bee real and alive???</td>', 'Great shot, is the bee real and alive???', '2003-04-25 13:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(278278, 19136, 3290, '<td valign="top">But is it wild? :-) Great capture. Right combination of stillness and movement. I like this one a lot. Well done.</td>', 'But is it wild? :-) Great capture. Right combination of stillness and movement. I like this one a lot. Well done.', '2003-04-25 13:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(278279, 19153, 3290, '<td valign="top">Ahhh. Wins the cute vote hands down.</td>', 'Ahhh. Wins the cute vote hands down.', '2003-04-25 13:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(278280, 19213, 6230, '<td valign="top">Subjects are too small.</td>', 'Subjects are too small.', '2003-04-25 13:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(278281, 18784, 6230, '<td valign="top">Nice combination. Some "noise" in the background.</td>', 'Nice combination. Some "noise" in the background.', '2003-04-25 14:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(278284, 18574, 6230, '<td valign="top">Good and simple composition. Image is a little soft though.</td>', 'Good and simple composition. Image is a little soft though.', '2003-04-25 14:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(278289, 18546, 6230, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery. Overall image is a little soft. Composition can be improved by repositioning the camera to avoid the building in the background.</td>', 'Nice scenery. Overall image is a little soft. Composition can be improved by repositioning the camera to avoid the building in the background.', '2003-04-25 14:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(278292, 18735, 6230, '<td valign="top">Over-exposure at the mouth area ruined a good portrait.</td>', 'Over-exposure at the mouth area ruined a good portrait.', '2003-04-25 14:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(278294, 19183, 6230, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Is the fog real???</td>', 'Nice composition. Is the fog real???', '2003-04-25 14:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(278296, 18349, 6230, '<td valign="top">The backdrop ruined a good portrait.....</td>', 'The backdrop ruined a good portrait.....', '2003-04-25 14:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(278297, 18930, 6230, '<td valign="top">Could have waited for the bird to lift up its head for a better shot........and reposition to avoid the tree trunk in the background.</td>', 'Could have waited for the bird to lift up its head for a better shot........and reposition to avoid the tree trunk in the background.', '2003-04-25 14:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(278299, 18287, 6230, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2003-04-25 14:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(278300, 19123, 6230, '<td valign="top">Would have been great if the subject is in focus and to see its head.</td>', 'Would have been great if the subject is in focus and to see its head.', '2003-04-25 14:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
