(278525, 18645, 6370, '<td valign="top">don''t you love it when they sit still for so long?  makes life much easier.  :)</td>', 'don''t you love it when they sit still for so long?  makes life much easier.  :)', '2003-04-25 15:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(278533, 19186, 6202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful horse, I was wondering if you tried cropping out the post on the left side.  The post takes away from the horse and pulls the eyes out away from it.</td>', 'Beautiful horse, I was wondering if you tried cropping out the post on the left side.  The post takes away from the horse and pulls the eyes out away from it.', '2003-04-25 15:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(278541, 19016, 4122, '<td valign="top">lighting questionable</td>', 'lighting questionable', '2003-04-25 16:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(278557, 19111, 7889, '<td valign="top">Err - very cute!</td>', 'Err - very cute!', '2003-04-25 16:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(278558, 19088, 7889, '<td valign="top">A good strong image</td>', 'A good strong image', '2003-04-25 16:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(278559, 19205, 7889, '<td valign="top">I have a weakness for Chickens! - maybe if the photo was cropped to get rid of the body and concentrate on the head it would be better?</td>', 'I have a weakness for Chickens! - maybe if the photo was cropped to get rid of the body and concentrate on the head it would be better?', '2003-04-25 16:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(278560, 18528, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good shot - love the way the it draws you to the birds eye.</td>', 'Good shot - love the way the it draws you to the birds eye.', '2003-04-25 16:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(278561, 18751, 7889, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. love the colours</td>', 'Nice shot. love the colours', '2003-04-25 16:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(278564, 19113, 7889, '<td valign="top">Love the caption ! - a very good photo</td>', 'Love the caption ! - a very good photo', '2003-04-25 16:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(278570, 18472, 7889, '<td valign="top">Hope you used a zoom lense,,,,,,</td>', 'Hope you used a zoom lense,,,,,,', '2003-04-25 16:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(278571, 18905, 4411, '<td valign="top">Shame you didn''t get the shot half a second later when the swan wouldn''t have been quite so tight on the edge of the frame, but otherwise this is stunning.<br/>I love the way the the ripples make the line of sunlight curve towards the swan, leading the eye straight to the subject. Great shot, well done.</td>', 'Shame you didn''t get the shot half a second later when the swan wouldn''t have been quite so tight on the edge of the frame, but otherwise this is stunning.I love the way the the ripples make the line of sunlight curve towards the swan, leading the eye straight to the subject. Great shot, well done.', '2003-04-25 16:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(278574, 19204, 1143, '<td valign="top">These guys are a lot of fun. Unfortunately, the lighting here wasn''t the best and your focus is soft. I think you could''ve made them a little more visible with some level adjustments.</td>', 'These guys are a lot of fun. Unfortunately, the lighting here wasn''t the best and your focus is soft. I think you could''ve made them a little more visible with some level adjustments.', '2003-04-25 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(278576, 18645, 2923, '<td valign="top">looks more like a dead bobcat.</td>', 'looks more like a dead bobcat.', '2003-04-25 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(278578, 18832, 6261, '<td valign="top">really nice shot - good sharp detail - great job<br/></td>', 'really nice shot - good sharp detail - great job', '2003-04-25 17:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(278579, 18697, 7711, '<td valign="top">he''s a bit dark.. I would have loved to bring out some more of the texture of his skin..though this would have probably messed with the lighting of the background. This probably isn''t as helpful as I had hoped! But good shot nonetheless.</td>', 'he''s a bit dark.. I would have loved to bring out some more of the texture of his skin..though this would have probably messed with the lighting of the background. This probably isn''t as helpful as I had hoped! But good shot nonetheless.', '2003-04-25 17:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(278581, 19057, 6261, '<td valign="top">great photo - I don''t feel it meet challenge, but it''s still a nice shot</td>', 'great photo - I don''t feel it meet challenge, but it''s still a nice shot', '2003-04-25 17:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(278582, 18815, 7711, '<td valign="top">lovely idea, but the ducks just aren''t standing out enough in this shot.</td>', 'lovely idea, but the ducks just aren''t standing out enough in this shot.', '2003-04-25 17:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(278583, 19211, 6261, '<td valign="top">beautiful landscape but doesn''t meet challenge in my opinion</td>', 'beautiful landscape but doesn''t meet challenge in my opinion', '2003-04-25 17:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(278584, 18626, 7711, '<td valign="top">you''ve got this looking like a drawing, I''d be curious to know what post processing you did. Brilliant capute on the gorilla''s expression and pose -- composition is lovely.</td>', 'you''ve got this looking like a drawing, I''d be curious to know what post processing you did. Brilliant capute on the gorilla''s expression and pose -- composition is lovely.', '2003-04-25 17:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(278585, 18441, 6261, '<td valign="top">is this in the wrong challenge? - it''s beatiful anyway.</td>', 'is this in the wrong challenge? - it''s beatiful anyway.', '2003-04-25 17:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(278586, 18287, 7711, '<td valign="top">that''s a fun title! I have never seen creatures with heads/beaks quite like these. Nice and bright too.</td>', 'that''s a fun title! I have never seen creatures with heads/beaks quite like these. Nice and bright too.', '2003-04-25 17:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(278587, 18402, 6261, '<td valign="top">I can''t see the subject of your picture.  I thought this was just a flower at first.  Seems a bit blurry</td>', 'I can''t see the subject of your picture.  I thought this was just a flower at first.  Seems a bit blurry', '2003-04-25 17:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(278588, 18399, 6261, '<td valign="top">Seems a little out of focus.</td>', 'Seems a little out of focus.', '2003-04-25 17:21:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(278590, 18298, 6261, '<td valign="top">hmmm - a little too small and out of focus</td>', 'hmmm - a little too small and out of focus', '2003-04-25 17:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(278593, 19067, 6261, '<td valign="top">sad - seems too out of focus</td>', 'sad - seems too out of focus', '2003-04-25 17:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(278594, 19050, 6261, '<td valign="top">Needs more light on eyes - I feel as though I have to search for them</td>', 'Needs more light on eyes - I feel as though I have to search for them', '2003-04-25 17:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(278601, 18792, 1005, '<td valign="top">Love eagle shots!  This is very nice!  The fences are a nit that I just can''t nip your score for.  The feathers came through really nice.  You''re getting a little shock glare on the heads, but I''ve done and submitted worse (I called it an artsy glare).  Easy 10 for me.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Love eagle shots!  This is very nice!  The fences are a nit that I just can''t nip your score for.  The feathers came through really nice.  You''re getting a little shock glare on the heads, but I''ve done and submitted worse (I called it an artsy glare).  Easy 10 for me.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-25 17:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(278605, 19148, 1005, '<td valign="top">I love eagle shots.  This is much better than my eagle entry a few weeks ago.  Very nicely done.  The lighting is just right.  You''re getting a little of the white softness under the chin, but much less noticable than my shot.  Bit o glare on the beak, but I''m not quibbling over that either.  I have to give this a 10.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'I love eagle shots.  This is much better than my eagle entry a few weeks ago.  Very nicely done.  The lighting is just right.  You''re getting a little of the white softness under the chin, but much less noticable than my shot.  Bit o glare on the beak, but I''m not quibbling over that either.  I have to give this a 10.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-25 17:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(278608, 18503, 1005, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love heron shots.  This is one of the nicest I''ve seen in a long time.  VERY well done.  Focus is very fine.  Color seems perfect.  Love the big S neck line!!  This is an easy 10 for me.  (I''d go higher, but the scale doesn''t allow it)<br/>Rob the Swash</td>', 'Absolutely love heron shots.  This is one of the nicest I''ve seen in a long time.  VERY well done.  Focus is very fine.  Color seems perfect.  Love the big S neck line!!  This is an easy 10 for me.  (I''d go higher, but the scale doesn''t allow it)Rob the Swash', '2003-04-25 17:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(278612, 18775, 1005, '<td valign="top">These are lovely birds.  I like the capture very much.  The timing of getting all three looking in different directions...very cool.  Wonderful detail.  (Wish I could spell the bird''s name...)  10 Rob the Swash</td>', 'These are lovely birds.  I like the capture very much.  The timing of getting all three looking in different directions...very cool.  Wonderful detail.  (Wish I could spell the bird''s name...)  10 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-25 17:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(278614, 19137, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  Very little glare, focus is extra sharp down to the tail spike, color is wonderful and very eye catchy.  The flower at the edge of the frame is a touch distracting, but I''m not quibbling with it.  10 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very nice shot!  Very little glare, focus is extra sharp down to the tail spike, color is wonderful and very eye catchy.  The flower at the edge of the frame is a touch distracting, but I''m not quibbling with it.  10 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-25 17:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(278616, 19159, 2158, '<td valign="top">I wish you''d submitted this in a larger size.  It''s really difficult to judge it fairly.</td>', 'I wish you''d submitted this in a larger size.  It''s really difficult to judge it fairly.', '2003-04-25 17:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(278618, 18447, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  Hard to believe this is real (the lighting is so very killer good!!).  Feels like a shot with everything under control, but unless the bee is dead, that would be extremely rare catch!  (I chose to believe this isn''t a set up, I''ll only be slightly disappointed if I''m wrong)  I love this shot.  10 Rob the Swash<br/> <br/>Incredible!!  Wow!  I just can''t get over this shot!<br/> <br/> <br/>Still looking......<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Very nice shot!  Hard to believe this is real (the lighting is so very killer good!!).  Feels like a shot with everything under control, but unless the bee is dead, that would be extremely rare catch!  (I chose to believe this isn''t a set up, I''ll only be slightly disappointed if I''m wrong)  I love this shot.  10 Rob the Swash Incredible!!  Wow!  I just can''t get over this shot!  Still looking......  ', '2003-04-25 17:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(278630, 18950, 4411, '<td valign="top">Fabulous capture.<br/>Love the position of the legs and the way it''s lokking at you, kinda like it''s stopped midflight to check out what you''re doing. Would be worth trying to brighten it up to see how that looks. Great shot, well done.</td>', 'Fabulous capture.Love the position of the legs and the way it''s lokking at you, kinda like it''s stopped midflight to check out what you''re doing. Would be worth trying to brighten it up to see how that looks. Great shot, well done.', '2003-04-25 18:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
