(279034, 19181, 4380, '<td valign="top">my only 1 10s for the challenge, because i want you to win the blue ribbon, my second choices grades are all 8s.  Amazing colour, when you viewed for a longer time, it looks like a 3d to me. i love to photograph peacock, they are simply beautiful and lovable and i knw the time you consumed to wait for the peacock to spread the wings..good timing and exposure.  I really wanted to your image with a blue ribbon after the challenge. Excellent work and congratulation for this absolutely beautiful image.  A PERFECT 10!!!!! take a bow now, you deserved it.</td>', 'my only 1 10s for the challenge, because i want you to win the blue ribbon, my second choices grades are all 8s.  Amazing colour, when you viewed for a longer time, it looks like a 3d to me. i love to photograph peacock, they are simply beautiful and lovable and i knw the time you consumed to wait for the peacock to spread the wings..good timing and exposure.  I really wanted to your image with a blue ribbon after the challenge. Excellent work and congratulation for this absolutely beautiful image.  A PERFECT 10!!!!! take a bow now, you deserved it.', '2003-04-26 06:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(279035, 19111, 4380, '<td valign="top">ha, ha, ha, ha, ha....yeey! very beautiful doggy! i like it so much. nice posing. Good work...8</td>', 'ha, ha, ha, ha, ha....yeey! very beautiful doggy! i like it so much. nice posing. Good work...8', '2003-04-26 06:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(279036, 19174, 4380, '<td valign="top">what''s happening here?</td>', 'what''s happening here?', '2003-04-26 06:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(279037, 18435, 4380, '<td valign="top">nice catch, excellent composition and lighting..dont tell me that you invited this beautiful lady inside your studio (nope, just kidding!)...One of the best entry this challenge...congrats...you deserve a ribbon here..Congrats!!!  before i forgot...she got a very expressive eyes.....i think she likes you so much. congrats again...</td>', 'nice catch, excellent composition and lighting..dont tell me that you invited this beautiful lady inside your studio (nope, just kidding!)...One of the best entry this challenge...congrats...you deserve a ribbon here..Congrats!!!  before i forgot...she got a very expressive eyes.....i think she likes you so much. congrats again...', '2003-04-26 06:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(279038, 18519, 4380, '<td valign="top">another domestic animal...after i gave comments and rate the cute puppy (of course with a favorable/high mark), i saw your entry. Excellent image, but im not totally agreed with your choice of composition (just my opinion...how about not to centered?)anyway, composition is not the only criteria  im using...i like the idea of converting the cat in to black and white and retaining his eyes in colour...not so original idea but still work for your image.  i like his posing, his expressive eyes catch my attention..Excellent work and you deserved a very high mark.  congrats</td>', 'another domestic animal...after i gave comments and rate the cute puppy (of course with a favorable/high mark), i saw your entry. Excellent image, but im not totally agreed with your choice of composition (just my opinion...how about not to centered?)anyway, composition is not the only criteria  im using...i like the idea of converting the cat in to black and white and retaining his eyes in colour...not so original idea but still work for your image.  i like his posing, his expressive eyes catch my attention..Excellent work and you deserved a very high mark.  congrats', '2003-04-26 06:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(279039, 18905, 4380, '<td valign="top">i like the colour of sunset in your image, i also love the composition...im glad you captured this image, its wonderful and beautiful. congrats.</td>', 'i like the colour of sunset in your image, i also love the composition...im glad you captured this image, its wonderful and beautiful. congrats.', '2003-04-26 06:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
