(279102, 18344, 5792, '<td valign="top">I like that you captured the cat''s distain at being photographed close up. I''d like to know the f/stop used here. Greater DOF might work better if you could have stopped your camera down more.</td>', 'I like that you captured the cat''s distain at being photographed close up. I''d like to know the f/stop used here. Greater DOF might work better if you could have stopped your camera down more.', '2003-04-26 09:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
