(279225, 18832, 7711, '<td valign="top">he''s got wings, he''ll make it! I love the colour on this, and the detail on the fly is great too, especially since you''re not "face to face" with it! Good use of the green around the fly too.</td>', 'he''s got wings, he''ll make it! I love the colour on this, and the detail on the fly is great too, especially since you''re not "face to face" with it! Good use of the green around the fly too.', '2003-04-26 13:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
