(279312, 18800, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Super shot.  Very exciting.  Love the blurred background.  Can''t wait to see your equipment and your crop factor.  Good luck.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Wow!  Super shot.  Very exciting.  Love the blurred background.  Can''t wait to see your equipment and your crop factor.  Good luck.  Jacko.  9', '2003-04-26 15:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
