(279316, 19148, 2716, '<td valign="top">wo.  Looks kinda cranky.  Great close-up.  I''m looking forward to seeing your equipment set up and crop factor.  Good job.  Jacko.</td>', 'wo.  Looks kinda cranky.  Great close-up.  I''m looking forward to seeing your equipment set up and crop factor.  Good job.  Jacko.', '2003-04-26 15:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
