(279355, 19173, 6202, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Catching birds in flight and not having it blurry is not easy.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Catching birds in flight and not having it blurry is not easy.', '2003-04-26 16:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(279357, 18615, 6202, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful dog portrait.  The icey blue of the dog''s eye really catches your attention.  Not sure why you did the boarder the way you did, but still worth a 7.</td>', 'Simply beautiful dog portrait.  The icey blue of the dog''s eye really catches your attention.  Not sure why you did the boarder the way you did, but still worth a 7.', '2003-04-26 16:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(279358, 19178, 6202, '<td valign="top">Amusing.  Only thing missing is a kid ride on harley in the background to complete the look.</td>', 'Amusing.  Only thing missing is a kid ride on harley in the background to complete the look.', '2003-04-26 16:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(279360, 18878, 6202, '<td valign="top">this has to be one of the hardest photos for me to vote on.  I have a terrible fear of snakes and yet I had to come back and comment on it.  The focus and dof are fantastic.  The scales show up beautifully and the color is incredibly good.</td>', 'this has to be one of the hardest photos for me to vote on.  I have a terrible fear of snakes and yet I had to come back and comment on it.  The focus and dof are fantastic.  The scales show up beautifully and the color is incredibly good.', '2003-04-26 16:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(279362, 18981, 6202, '<td valign="top">Sunset is beautiful, you may want to try turning off your date on your settings, would impove the image greatly without that there.</td>', 'Sunset is beautiful, you may want to try turning off your date on your settings, would impove the image greatly without that there.', '2003-04-26 16:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(279363, 18310, 6202, '<td valign="top">Only thing missing is a small child to complete the enviroment.  What is a little rubber ducky without the child chasing it about the tub.</td>', 'Only thing missing is a small child to complete the enviroment.  What is a little rubber ducky without the child chasing it about the tub.', '2003-04-26 16:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(279370, 19198, 543, '<td valign="top">Great colors, and nice selective DOF.  The lighting is a little patchy (darker on his face and at LRC), but not a big issue.  Very fine work.</td>', 'Great colors, and nice selective DOF.  The lighting is a little patchy (darker on his face and at LRC), but not a big issue.  Very fine work.', '2003-04-26 16:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(279371, 18923, 7543, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot, lighting is great, composition is great, great poses by the subjects, it''s just all great. Congrats, i''m sure your getting a ribbon for this one.</td>', 'Amazing shot, lighting is great, composition is great, great poses by the subjects, it''s just all great. Congrats, i''m sure your getting a ribbon for this one.', '2003-04-26 16:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(279372, 18775, 543, '<td valign="top">What a great composition.  You were lucky to get this!  I wish the hindmost bird were in better focus, but with a long lens like that the DOF must have been pretty narrow.  The BG is a bit wierd.  It would be nice if there were something in the middle distance to keep them from looking like they''re posed against a backdrop.  Very nice work, overall.</td>', 'What a great composition.  You were lucky to get this!  I wish the hindmost bird were in better focus, but with a long lens like that the DOF must have been pretty narrow.  The BG is a bit wierd.  It would be nice if there were something in the middle distance to keep them from looking like they''re posed against a backdrop.  Very nice work, overall.', '2003-04-26 16:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(279373, 18869, 543, '<td valign="top">I guess you were trying to exclude bits of the surroundings, but I find the missing trunk and leg distracting.  Would much rather have seen this in portrait orientation.  Otherwise, excellent focus and exposure (a little blowout on the tusk is not a showstopper).  The elephant has great texture.  Open eye might have been better.  Very good, overall.</td>', 'I guess you were trying to exclude bits of the surroundings, but I find the missing trunk and leg distracting.  Would much rather have seen this in portrait orientation.  Otherwise, excellent focus and exposure (a little blowout on the tusk is not a showstopper).  The elephant has great texture.  Open eye might have been better.  Very good, overall.', '2003-04-26 16:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(279376, 19133, 543, '<td valign="top">The symmetry of the two birds is great.  I''m a bit torn over the tree, though.  Cropping it out would leave their heads too close to the edge of the frame, but it''s also distracting.  Too bad you couldn''t get the shot from an angle which excluded the tree.  Otherwise, fantastic.  Getting a good exposure on those white feathers is no easy trick.</td>', 'The symmetry of the two birds is great.  I''m a bit torn over the tree, though.  Cropping it out would leave their heads too close to the edge of the frame, but it''s also distracting.  Too bad you couldn''t get the shot from an angle which excluded the tree.  Otherwise, fantastic.  Getting a good exposure on those white feathers is no easy trick.', '2003-04-26 16:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(279377, 19181, 543, '<td valign="top">A very impressive spread.  I''d have liked to see the feet, I think.  Alternately, moving the body off center and seing the edge of his fan on one side would make for a less static composition.  Nice work, regardless.</td>', 'A very impressive spread.  I''d have liked to see the feet, I think.  Alternately, moving the body off center and seing the edge of his fan on one side would make for a less static composition.  Nice work, regardless.', '2003-04-26 16:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(279379, 19038, 543, '<td valign="top">Gotta grade this a little higher on second viewing.  Great clarity and colors.</td>', 'Gotta grade this a little higher on second viewing.  Great clarity and colors.', '2003-04-26 16:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(279384, 18729, 543, '<td valign="top">This is really good, but I find myself put off by the angle.  Was he looking away, or were you shooting from below somehow?</td>', 'This is really good, but I find myself put off by the angle.  Was he looking away, or were you shooting from below somehow?', '2003-04-26 17:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(279387, 19131, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  How did you get so close? Good job.</td>', 'Very nice image.  How did you get so close? Good job.', '2003-04-26 17:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(279388, 18842, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  There is a lot of negative space in this photo.  You should have tried a closer shot.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice image.  There is a lot of negative space in this photo.  You should have tried a closer shot.  Good job.', '2003-04-26 17:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(279389, 19214, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Good shot.  I like the different textures in the image and the angle from which this was shot provides a nice shadow in the image as well.</td>', 'Very nice image.  Good shot.  I like the different textures in the image and the angle from which this was shot provides a nice shadow in the image as well.', '2003-04-26 17:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(279390, 18565, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I really like the background and the rocks in the photo.</td>', 'Nice image. I really like the background and the rocks in the photo.', '2003-04-26 17:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(279391, 18796, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image and very good focus. The image is very clear and bright.</td>', 'Nice image and very good focus. The image is very clear and bright.', '2003-04-26 17:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(279392, 18447, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Good focus and clarity.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice image.  Good focus and clarity.  Good job.', '2003-04-26 17:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(279393, 18703, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice image.  Good job.', '2003-04-26 17:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(279394, 18435, 7033, '<td valign="top">That is one wild looking bird!  I like the strong contrast of the black background with the yellow plume, and the angle of the birds neck entering the shot creates an interesting shot.  Blue cast to the white portions of the image is a bit strong, in my opinion.  --9</td>', 'That is one wild looking bird!  I like the strong contrast of the black background with the yellow plume, and the angle of the birds neck entering the shot creates an interesting shot.  Blue cast to the white portions of the image is a bit strong, in my opinion.  --9', '2003-04-26 17:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(279395, 19022, 3697, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great shot. Detail and color are amazing, and DOF is just perfect. 9</td>', 'Wow, what a great shot. Detail and color are amazing, and DOF is just perfect. 9', '2003-04-26 17:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(279396, 18645, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great pose... the poor thing almost looks stuffed!  (Wait a minute... is it? :)  Nice color tones, focus is nice; composition and perspective work well.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Great pose... the poor thing almost looks stuffed!  (Wait a minute... is it? :)  Nice color tones, focus is nice; composition and perspective work well.  Nicely done!', '2003-04-26 17:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(279398, 18562, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great subject!  I wish the lighting of the head area were better in order to show more detail.  Also, composition seems a bit lacking... not certain whether it is the placement of the subject, or the lines created by the slope in the background.</td>', 'Great subject!  I wish the lighting of the head area were better in order to show more detail.  Also, composition seems a bit lacking... not certain whether it is the placement of the subject, or the lines created by the slope in the background.', '2003-04-26 17:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(279399, 19181, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  (I tried to capture a peacock myself, but couldn''t get one to display for me... )  In my opinion, a bit more diffused lighting (looks like a flash hotspot) for the head area would improve the shot a bit.  --9</td>', 'Great shot!  (I tried to capture a peacock myself, but couldn''t get one to display for me... )  In my opinion, a bit more diffused lighting (looks like a flash hotspot) for the head area would improve the shot a bit.  --9', '2003-04-26 17:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(279400, 18761, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great closeup!  I wish the lizard were just a bit lighter; tough to do with the bright white surroundings.  Very nice overall.  --8</td>', 'Great closeup!  I wish the lizard were just a bit lighter; tough to do with the bright white surroundings.  Very nice overall.  --8', '2003-04-26 17:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(279402, 19200, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition... I wish it were a bit sharper-- perhaps using less compression to bring it closer to the 150 kb limit?  BTW, it seems strange seeing a jackrabbit in the grass-- we have plenty around here, but it''s mostly sand and sagebrush.</td>', 'Very nice composition... I wish it were a bit sharper-- perhaps using less compression to bring it closer to the 150 kb limit?  BTW, it seems strange seeing a jackrabbit in the grass-- we have plenty around here, but it''s mostly sand and sagebrush.', '2003-04-26 17:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(279403, 19049, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  I wish the darker bird was less conspicuous in the background; the fence isn''t overly distracting, but might be better without it.</td>', 'Very nice capture.  I wish the darker bird was less conspicuous in the background; the fence isn''t overly distracting, but might be better without it.', '2003-04-26 17:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(279404, 19022, 7033, '<td valign="top">Fantastic detail... warm colors are especially nice!  I do wish the shadow behind the bee were less pronounced, though.  Very nice overall.  --9</td>', 'Fantastic detail... warm colors are especially nice!  I do wish the shadow behind the bee were less pronounced, though.  Very nice overall.  --9', '2003-04-26 17:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(279405, 19132, 7033, '<td valign="top">This looks like something out of a sci-fi movie! Love your lighting and texture.</td>', 'This looks like something out of a sci-fi movie! Love your lighting and texture.', '2003-04-26 17:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(279406, 18796, 7033, '<td valign="top">Whoa! Where does the flower end and the bug begin? Maybe a slightly deeper depth of field and I would have chosen to keep the background in focus but that is a cool shot!</td>', 'Whoa! Where does the flower end and the bug begin? Maybe a slightly deeper depth of field and I would have chosen to keep the background in focus but that is a cool shot!', '2003-04-26 17:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(279407, 18812, 7033, '<td valign="top">ROTFLMAO! Great texture and light!</td>', 'ROTFLMAO! Great texture and light!', '2003-04-26 17:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(279409, 19099, 6913, '<td valign="top">Tighter crop maybe?</td>', 'Tighter crop maybe?', '2003-04-26 17:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(279411, 18615, 7033, '<td valign="top">The dog makes a great subject, I never thought a dog would, but this is an awesome looking animal. I don''t think your background works at all, however and is a bit overexposed. (and busy, maybe?)  Also, I was very impressed when the top portion of the dog''s head was loading (exposing that awesome colored eye) but I was disappointed by the large mouth and teeth. I either would have cropped his mouth and background off (just use the top right portion of the photo)  or taken a different angle entirely. He''s pretty though. I think a few more shots of Bear and you would have had it.</td>', 'The dog makes a great subject, I never thought a dog would, but this is an awesome looking animal. I don''t think your background works at all, however and is a bit overexposed. (and busy, maybe?)  Also, I was very impressed when the top portion of the dog''s head was loading (exposing that awesome colored eye) but I was disappointed by the large mouth and teeth. I either would have cropped his mouth and background off (just use the top right portion of the photo)  or taken a different angle entirely. He''s pretty though. I think a few more shots of Bear and you would have had it.', '2003-04-26 18:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(279412, 19214, 7033, '<td valign="top">Lurking? More like dozing. Nice color.</td>', 'Lurking? More like dozing. Nice color.', '2003-04-26 18:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(279414, 18734, 7033, '<td valign="top">I must say, I''m tired of looking at fowl but this is the best one. Great color, you caught the water just right (movement I mean) and your centering is good. Great job.</td>', 'I must say, I''m tired of looking at fowl but this is the best one. Great color, you caught the water just right (movement I mean) and your centering is good. Great job.', '2003-04-26 18:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(279415, 19113, 7033, '<td valign="top">Incredible capture! So cute!  The color is magnificent... 10 all the way. I must say though that is this was my shot I would have titled it....... "Fat Little Wife"</td>', 'Incredible capture! So cute!  The color is magnificent... 10 all the way. I must say though that is this was my shot I would have titled it....... "Fat Little Wife"', '2003-04-26 18:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(279416, 18928, 543, '<td valign="top">Wonderful action pan.  You might consider cropping 15% or so off the top.</td>', 'Wonderful action pan.  You might consider cropping 15% or so off the top.', '2003-04-26 18:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(279417, 18688, 7033, '<td valign="top">Awesome color. Nice capture.</td>', 'Awesome color. Nice capture.', '2003-04-26 18:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(279418, 19082, 543, '<td valign="top">Very nice bit of Fauna Photojournalism.  The WA lens and angled composition work for me.  Not so wild about the blown out sky in the bg, but that''s the cost of a proper foregound exposure.  Nice work.</td>', 'Very nice bit of Fauna Photojournalism.  The WA lens and angled composition work for me.  Not so wild about the blown out sky in the bg, but that''s the cost of a proper foregound exposure.  Nice work.', '2003-04-26 18:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(279419, 19014, 7033, '<td valign="top">One of the better captures of ducks. Niceley centered and it looks like a family. Nice work.</td>', 'One of the better captures of ducks. Niceley centered and it looks like a family. Nice work.', '2003-04-26 18:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(279420, 19170, 543, '<td valign="top">There''s a strange vignetting effect, particularly visible at the top of the image.  Did you use some kind of teleconverter?  I think cropping the top down by 20% or so would strengthen the composition, anyway.  Nice group shot.</td>', 'There''s a strange vignetting effect, particularly visible at the top of the image.  Did you use some kind of teleconverter?  I think cropping the top down by 20% or so would strengthen the composition, anyway.  Nice group shot.', '2003-04-26 18:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(279421, 18636, 7033, '<td valign="top">this is a good capture. it could use a deeper depth of field for better focus and some fill-in lighting would have been nice  Not bad, though.</td>', 'this is a good capture. it could use a deeper depth of field for better focus and some fill-in lighting would have been nice  Not bad, though.', '2003-04-26 18:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(279422, 19098, 543, '<td valign="top">Not wild about the square format for this.  Rather see it trimmed on the sides and just a little off the top.  Otherwise, the colors are great, and I like the sheep standing on the horizon line.  Very fine.</td>', 'Not wild about the square format for this.  Rather see it trimmed on the sides and just a little off the top.  Otherwise, the colors are great, and I like the sheep standing on the horizon line.  Very fine.', '2003-04-26 18:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(279423, 19018, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The water looks surreal! I like how the swan isn''t centered in the photo. Great job.</td>', 'Great composition. The water looks surreal! I like how the swan isn''t centered in the photo. Great job.', '2003-04-26 18:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(279425, 19133, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great title.... I love these birds! Awesome texture and their white feathers are so pure. Nice shade of green in the background, too. 9</td>', 'Great title.... I love these birds! Awesome texture and their white feathers are so pure. Nice shade of green in the background, too. 9', '2003-04-26 18:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(279426, 19063, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of emotion. Pretty animal, too. Great black and white  9</td>', 'Nice capture of emotion. Pretty animal, too. Great black and white  9', '2003-04-26 18:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(279427, 18697, 543, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, and a good composition (if a little tight at L).  A narrower DOF would keep the background from intruding as it does here, but that isn''t always possible.  Nice work.</td>', 'Nice detail, and a good composition (if a little tight at L).  A narrower DOF would keep the background from intruding as it does here, but that isn''t always possible.  Nice work.', '2003-04-26 18:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(279428, 18856, 7033, '<td valign="top">Textbook photo. The red in the background? Kind of detracts but I still like it, I think. Awesome, truly.</td>', 'Textbook photo. The red in the background? Kind of detracts but I still like it, I think. Awesome, truly.', '2003-04-26 18:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(279429, 18518, 543, '<td valign="top">Getting down just a little bit lower to exclude the branch at URC would have strengthened the picture.  Great color on the cow.  A little fill flash or reflector to cut the shadows (or, in post-processing, some + gamma) would help to reveal shadow detail lost shooting into the light.</td>', 'Getting down just a little bit lower to exclude the branch at URC would have strengthened the picture.  Great color on the cow.  A little fill flash or reflector to cut the shadows (or, in post-processing, some + gamma) would help to reveal shadow detail lost shooting into the light.', '2003-04-26 18:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(279430, 18286, 543, '<td valign="top">Bet he didn''t like getting flashed like that.</td>', 'Bet he didn''t like getting flashed like that.', '2003-04-26 18:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(279431, 18310, 543, '<td valign="top">I''m a big rubber duck fan, but... no.  Not for this challenge.</td>', 'I''m a big rubber duck fan, but... no.  Not for this challenge.', '2003-04-26 18:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(279432, 18575, 7033, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''m totally biased now because for once, this is a picture of something other than a duck or a swan but THAT is one awesome picture. Where is this? If this is at the zoo you totally fooled me.... Great job!  --10  p.s. you didn''t need that ugly border.</td>', 'Okay, I''m totally biased now because for once, this is a picture of something other than a duck or a swan but THAT is one awesome picture. Where is this? If this is at the zoo you totally fooled me.... Great job!  --10  p.s. you didn''t need that ugly border.', '2003-04-26 18:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(279433, 19123, 543, '<td valign="top">This realy needed a faster shutter speed.  A little motion in the wings is fine by me, but the whole bird is just a blur here.  You might have gotten away with panning if the bird''s motion had been perpendicualr to the lens, but for a static shot this just won''t work.</td>', 'This realy needed a faster shutter speed.  A little motion in the wings is fine by me, but the whole bird is just a blur here.  You might have gotten away with panning if the bird''s motion had been perpendicualr to the lens, but for a static shot this just won''t work.', '2003-04-26 18:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(279458, 19040, 3557, '<td valign="top">Good composition and the flowers add a nice touch of color.</td>', 'Good composition and the flowers add a nice touch of color.', '2003-04-26 19:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
