(279473, 18898, 7711, '<td valign="top">my favourite of the squirrels! :) What a superb expression on its face, and brilliant composition, I really like the green space to the left. well done!</td>', 'my favourite of the squirrels! :) What a superb expression on its face, and brilliant composition, I really like the green space to the left. well done!', '2003-04-26 19:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
