(279528, 19146, 509, '<td valign="top">Aquarium shots are very tough.  The only way I was able to get decent shots at a place like this was with 800 ISO (froze the motion, but lots of noise).  Not sure what you used here, but it works.  I like the overall darkness of this shot, and you managed to get good focus and a fast enough shutter speed on the shark. - 9 - Mav</td>', 'Aquarium shots are very tough.  The only way I was able to get decent shots at a place like this was with 800 ISO (froze the motion, but lots of noise).  Not sure what you used here, but it works.  I like the overall darkness of this shot, and you managed to get good focus and a fast enough shutter speed on the shark. - 9 - Mav', '2003-04-26 21:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(279531, 18763, 509, '<td valign="top">Beautiful framing.  I like the negative space.  That combined with the environment gives good meaning to your title.  Nice work</td>', 'Beautiful framing.  I like the negative space.  That combined with the environment gives good meaning to your title.  Nice work', '2003-04-26 21:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(279532, 18311, 509, '<td valign="top">Very cute, even looks like the lamb is smiling.  The negative space is ok, but I wonder how a closer crop on the lamb would look.</td>', 'Very cute, even looks like the lamb is smiling.  The negative space is ok, but I wonder how a closer crop on the lamb would look.', '2003-04-26 21:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(279534, 18808, 509, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I''ve ever seen a squirrel that color, but he contrasts nicely with the green vegetation.  Framing is nice as well - 7 - Mav</td>', 'I don''t think I''ve ever seen a squirrel that color, but he contrasts nicely with the green vegetation.  Framing is nice as well - 7 - Mav', '2003-04-26 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(279535, 19150, 509, '<td valign="top">Very original, and kinda unusual too!  What were they after in that sink?  Nice job - Mav</td>', 'Very original, and kinda unusual too!  What were they after in that sink?  Nice job - Mav', '2003-04-26 21:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(279537, 18471, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but I think I would like a closer crop on just a few of them.  It''s hard to find a particular part of the photo that catches my eye.  A wider aperture might have worked too, maybe focused on the white seal on the left leaving some of the others slightly blurred.  Just a suggestion. - Mav</td>', 'Nice subject, but I think I would like a closer crop on just a few of them.  It''s hard to find a particular part of the photo that catches my eye.  A wider aperture might have worked too, maybe focused on the white seal on the left leaving some of the others slightly blurred.  Just a suggestion. - Mav', '2003-04-26 21:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(279542, 18615, 509, '<td valign="top">The color reflections in the eye really add interest to this shot, nicely done</td>', 'The color reflections in the eye really add interest to this shot, nicely done', '2003-04-26 21:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(279543, 18969, 509, '<td valign="top">The lighting and framing are superb, but I can''t really tell what it (they?) are.  I''m guessing 3 baby chicks, but I wish I could see more detail on them.</td>', 'The lighting and framing are superb, but I can''t really tell what it (they?) are.  I''m guessing 3 baby chicks, but I wish I could see more detail on them.', '2003-04-26 21:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(279544, 18310, 509, '<td valign="top">Lol, cute, and the reflection is nice too.  Interesting take on fauna (i''m sure you''ll hear complaints about the noise, but I like it actually ~ helps de-emphasize the background) - 6 - Mav</td>', 'Lol, cute, and the reflection is nice too.  Interesting take on fauna (i''m sure you''ll hear complaints about the noise, but I like it actually ~ helps de-emphasize the background) - 6 - Mav', '2003-04-26 21:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(279550, 18433, 7711, '<td valign="top">crop the bottom of the picture (foreground) its out of focus anyway and you''d probably get a better balanced shot of ol'' six eyes! (creepything!)</td>', 'crop the bottom of the picture (foreground) its out of focus anyway and you''d probably get a better balanced shot of ol'' six eyes! (creepything!)', '2003-04-26 21:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(279552, 18937, 7711, '<td valign="top">..and great reflections!! I love the low sun of the water and the reflection of the egret, this is well done in my humble opinion.</td>', '..and great reflections!! I love the low sun of the water and the reflection of the egret, this is well done in my humble opinion.', '2003-04-26 22:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
