(279562, 18898, 7033, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot!  (Not too in love with the border, though)  This is one of my absolute favorites this week.  The resolution in the whiskers is fantastic; color saturation is perfect, and the lighting works very well.  Shallow DOF really draws my attention back to the subject.  --10!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot!  (Not too in love with the border, though)  This is one of my absolute favorites this week.  The resolution in the whiskers is fantastic; color saturation is perfect, and the lighting works very well.  Shallow DOF really draws my attention back to the subject.  --10!', '2003-04-26 22:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(279563, 18775, 7790, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.</td>', 'Nice capture.', '2003-04-26 23:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(279564, 18837, 7790, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Looks like you might''ve been shooting through glass. SS</td>', 'Nice shot. Looks like you might''ve been shooting through glass. SS', '2003-04-26 23:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(279565, 18851, 7033, '<td valign="top">Clever title!  Reflection and foreground colors are very nice; head area seems a bit overexposed, though.</td>', 'Clever title!  Reflection and foreground colors are very nice; head area seems a bit overexposed, though.', '2003-04-26 23:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(279566, 18832, 7033, '<td valign="top">Fabulous detail!  I love the rich greens, as well.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Fabulous detail!  I love the rich greens, as well.  Very nicely done.', '2003-04-26 23:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(279567, 18750, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice emotion in the subject.  Unfortunately, there isn''t enough resolution here to do it justice.  Probably tough to get too much closer, though.</td>', 'Nice emotion in the subject.  Unfortunately, there isn''t enough resolution here to do it justice.  Probably tough to get too much closer, though.', '2003-04-26 23:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(279569, 18380, 7033, '<td valign="top">Color is fantastic in this shot...  Definitely would rate higher if the reflection in the upper left portion of the frame were gone.  Don''t know if it were possible, but you might consider shooting with a polarizing filter, or perhaps at a different angle to the glass.</td>', 'Color is fantastic in this shot...  Definitely would rate higher if the reflection in the upper left portion of the frame were gone.  Don''t know if it were possible, but you might consider shooting with a polarizing filter, or perhaps at a different angle to the glass.', '2003-04-26 23:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(279570, 18298, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge... would definitely have rated much higher if it were in focus.  Sorry....</td>', 'Great take on the challenge... would definitely have rated much higher if it were in focus.  Sorry....', '2003-04-26 23:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(279571, 18444, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and an interesting subject.  In my opinion, the background is just too busy... it seriously detracts from the shot.</td>', 'Nice composition and an interesting subject.  In my opinion, the background is just too busy... it seriously detracts from the shot.', '2003-04-26 23:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(279572, 18747, 7033, '<td valign="top">This shot definitely has potential, but suffers from a lack of focus, in my opinion.</td>', 'This shot definitely has potential, but suffers from a lack of focus, in my opinion.', '2003-04-26 23:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(279573, 18792, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  (And much better than my attempt of the same subject).  Don''t know if you could have captured these without the fences...</td>', 'Very nice shot!  (And much better than my attempt of the same subject).  Don''t know if you could have captured these without the fences...', '2003-04-26 23:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(279574, 18577, 7033, '<td valign="top">Perhaps your title should have been Psychedelic Duck?  I''m unsure what effect you were going after, but this one turned out pretty wierd.</td>', 'Perhaps your title should have been Psychedelic Duck?  I''m unsure what effect you were going after, but this one turned out pretty wierd.', '2003-04-26 23:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(279575, 18950, 4811, '<td valign="top">Have the makings of a great photo here. With some editing, I think it can be enhanced...try one or several of the following: 1) Levels adjustment: Move left and right siders to the edges of the histogram to improve overall contrast 2) Selective Color adjustment: Under the "Whites" option, move the black slider to the left to your liking, if any. 3) Crop: I find taking out some negative space improves compo. -&gt; Top and bottom for a panoramic shot, or all areas around bird except for a little space... Give these a try if you like...<br/> <br/>Excellent capture!</td>', 'Have the makings of a great photo here. With some editing, I think it can be enhanced...try one or several of the following: 1) Levels adjustment: Move left and right siders to the edges of the histogram to improve overall contrast 2) Selective Color adjustment: Under the "Whites" option, move the black slider to the left to your liking, if any. 3) Crop: I find taking out some negative space improves compo. -> Top and bottom for a panoramic shot, or all areas around bird except for a little space... Give these a try if you like... Excellent capture!', '2003-04-26 23:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(279576, 18763, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Almost Surreal.</td>', 'Very nice. Almost Surreal.', '2003-04-26 23:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
