(281323, 18447, 2158, '<td valign="top">I keep trying with bees, but I just can''t get decent results.  I''m really jealous of this one.</td>', 'I keep trying with bees, but I just can''t get decent results.  I''m really jealous of this one.', '2003-04-28 19:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(281326, 18472, 7711, '<td valign="top">I''m not the biggest lover of snakes, reptilian or otherwise, but this one I really liked, the lighting was spot on, like a bright sunny day without too letting any of the shadows get in the way, and a nice shallow DOF to keep the attention focussed on the snakes head, and not the leaves and twigs it was moving about in. 9</td>', 'I''m not the biggest lover of snakes, reptilian or otherwise, but this one I really liked, the lighting was spot on, like a bright sunny day without too letting any of the shadows get in the way, and a nice shallow DOF to keep the attention focussed on the snakes head, and not the leaves and twigs it was moving about in. 9', '2003-04-28 19:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(281333, 18721, 2158, '<td valign="top">Unusual compostion, but it works for me.  Looking at it, I do fear for the bird''s safety though :)</td>', 'Unusual compostion, but it works for me.  Looking at it, I do fear for the bird''s safety though :)', '2003-04-28 20:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(281336, 18962, 2158, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this would look bitter if you desaturated it a bit.  The green grass is competing too much with the zebra for attention the way it is now.  I like the composition though.</td>', 'In my opinion this would look bitter if you desaturated it a bit.  The green grass is competing too much with the zebra for attention the way it is now.  I like the composition though.', '2003-04-28 20:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(281338, 18649, 2158, '<td valign="top">It''s just a little thing, but it''s a pity you couldn''t have got a bit further to the right so that the bird''s tail was separated from the structure below.  But then it would probably have flown away before you got the shot!</td>', 'It''s just a little thing, but it''s a pity you couldn''t have got a bit further to the right so that the bird''s tail was separated from the structure below.  But then it would probably have flown away before you got the shot!', '2003-04-28 20:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(281345, 18883, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped out the guy on the right.  Also, the light (flash?) is too harsh.</td>', 'I''d have cropped out the guy on the right.  Also, the light (flash?) is too harsh.', '2003-04-28 20:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(281346, 18512, 2158, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately your camera seems to have focused on the bars rather than the birds.</td>', 'Unfortunately your camera seems to have focused on the bars rather than the birds.', '2003-04-28 20:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(281361, 18394, 2158, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see what it was.  It''s just too small.</td>', 'I wish I could see what it was.  It''s just too small.', '2003-04-28 21:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(281373, 18789, 2158, '<td valign="top">Good shot. <br/> <br/>I find the background a bit too bright.  Decreasing the saturation of the yellows would take care of this.  It would also take a bit of colour out of the monkey''s eyes though.  Still that is my preference.  Others may disagree.</td>', 'Good shot.  I find the background a bit too bright.  Decreasing the saturation of the yellows would take care of this.  It would also take a bit of colour out of the monkey''s eyes though.  Still that is my preference.  Others may disagree.', '2003-04-28 21:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(281382, 18364, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting why half her head is cut off.   Looks a lot like one of my cats, although he used to be male.</td>', 'I''m not getting why half her head is cut off.   Looks a lot like one of my cats, although he used to be male.', '2003-04-28 21:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(281385, 18456, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty good shot of the bee.  I''m not wild about the pic as a whole.  The leaves could''ve been darker and I think it would''ve really enhanced the bee.  I believe it would''ve provided a little more contrast and darkened the bright spot at the very bottom of the leaf on which the bee rests.</td>', 'This is a pretty good shot of the bee.  I''m not wild about the pic as a whole.  The leaves could''ve been darker and I think it would''ve really enhanced the bee.  I believe it would''ve provided a little more contrast and darkened the bright spot at the very bottom of the leaf on which the bee rests.', '2003-04-28 21:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(281389, 18509, 3540, '<td valign="top">I used one of these in the indoor macro challenge a few weeks ago.  Unfortunately mine was much smaller and not in a natural setting, as this one appears to be.   The background does not help this guy though.  The part under his chin is light as is his skin and the part over his eyes is dark, as is the part over his eyes.  A more uniform background would''ve made something about his head stand out more.  As it is I think he''s blending in a little too much.</td>', 'I used one of these in the indoor macro challenge a few weeks ago.  Unfortunately mine was much smaller and not in a natural setting, as this one appears to be.   The background does not help this guy though.  The part under his chin is light as is his skin and the part over his eyes is dark, as is the part over his eyes.  A more uniform background would''ve made something about his head stand out more.  As it is I think he''s blending in a little too much.', '2003-04-28 21:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(281393, 18751, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is almost really good.  There is just too much yellow to this.  I think its oversaturated and it''s not the clearest shot either which makes little yellow ghosts around the little yellow flowers.  Maybe a ladybug would provide a little more contrast.   I think if it were just a little sharper, the framing and the distance of the bee would overcome the yellow and I would have to score it higher.  But as is, its an almost very good shot.</td>', 'This is almost really good.  There is just too much yellow to this.  I think its oversaturated and it''s not the clearest shot either which makes little yellow ghosts around the little yellow flowers.  Maybe a ladybug would provide a little more contrast.   I think if it were just a little sharper, the framing and the distance of the bee would overcome the yellow and I would have to score it higher.  But as is, its an almost very good shot.', '2003-04-28 21:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(281398, 18789, 3540, '<td valign="top">The expression has won me over.  The background was disenchanting me until I saw her eyes.  This is a very humbling, poignant photograph that is very strong with subject but the background is a little bright.  You''ll have to take a 7</td>', 'The expression has won me over.  The background was disenchanting me until I saw her eyes.  This is a very humbling, poignant photograph that is very strong with subject but the background is a little bright.  You''ll have to take a 7', '2003-04-28 21:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(281403, 18862, 3540, '<td valign="top">The male looks like he''s suffering from male pattern baldness.  The photo quality here is not very good though.  Looks like it wasn''t taken very well and someone tried to fix it a little with PS or equivalent.  It really lacks sharpness all the way around.  Excellent subjects though, too bad the pic didn''t come out better.  Hope you get a good one someday.</td>', 'The male looks like he''s suffering from male pattern baldness.  The photo quality here is not very good though.  Looks like it wasn''t taken very well and someone tried to fix it a little with PS or equivalent.  It really lacks sharpness all the way around.  Excellent subjects though, too bad the pic didn''t come out better.  Hope you get a good one someday.', '2003-04-28 21:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(281406, 18803, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture quality.  Good subjects and background - 9</td>', 'Excellent picture quality.  Good subjects and background - 9', '2003-04-28 21:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(281409, 18447, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good sharp crisp and clear photo.  I don''t know if that''s pollen or not, but to capture it is remarkable.  Very nice shot - 9</td>', 'Good sharp crisp and clear photo.  I don''t know if that''s pollen or not, but to capture it is remarkable.  Very nice shot - 9', '2003-04-28 21:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(281412, 18813, 3540, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous butterfly.  Very nicely framed and the colors are pretty good.  THey could use a little more saturation.  The biggest disappointment to me is that the image quality is not quite there.  The butterfly though is a very good capture.</td>', 'Gorgeous butterfly.  Very nicely framed and the colors are pretty good.  THey could use a little more saturation.  The biggest disappointment to me is that the image quality is not quite there.  The butterfly though is a very good capture.', '2003-04-28 21:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(281415, 18287, 3540, '<td valign="top">cute title.  Too bad the road is in the background.  with the grass and maybe some trees I think this would work well.  Just the plain grass is a little too...well plain frankly.  But the road is definitely not the thing to break up the monotony</td>', 'cute title.  Too bad the road is in the background.  with the grass and maybe some trees I think this would work well.  Just the plain grass is a little too...well plain frankly.  But the road is definitely not the thing to break up the monotony', '2003-04-28 21:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(281431, 18676, 2158, '<td valign="top">Cute :)<br/></td>', 'Cute :)', '2003-04-28 22:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(281432, 18892, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  He looks very interesting.  Actually he reminds me of some sort of sea creature.  Too bad the head (the part nearest us) is slightly out of focus.  Overall not a bad shot</td>', 'Nice subject.  He looks very interesting.  Actually he reminds me of some sort of sea creature.  Too bad the head (the part nearest us) is slightly out of focus.  Overall not a bad shot', '2003-04-28 22:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
