(281436, 19179, 3540, '<td valign="top">The contrast on this needs to be turned up some.  The whole photo has a sort of hazy look to it.  The ducks are very good.  I really like their green heads.  I think you might have been able to saturate and lighten that green a little too so it would stand out a bit more.  Contrast is key here though.</td>', 'The contrast on this needs to be turned up some.  The whole photo has a sort of hazy look to it.  The ducks are very good.  I really like their green heads.  I think you might have been able to saturate and lighten that green a little too so it would stand out a bit more.  Contrast is key here though.', '2003-04-28 22:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(281437, 18905, 2158, '<td valign="top">I think I''d have cropped out the ducks.  There just seems to be too much on the left hand side with nothing to balance it out on the right.</td>', 'I think I''d have cropped out the ducks.  There just seems to be too much on the left hand side with nothing to balance it out on the right.', '2003-04-28 22:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(281438, 18866, 3540, '<td valign="top">If only the head could''ve been a little more focused.  THis is  a cute photo.  I can''t say I''ve seen but a snail or two on land in the wild.   The DOF on this pic is just a pinch too shallow.  I think the top of the photo isn''t really adding anything either.</td>', 'If only the head could''ve been a little more focused.  THis is  a cute photo.  I can''t say I''ve seen but a snail or two on land in the wild.   The DOF on this pic is just a pinch too shallow.  I think the top of the photo isn''t really adding anything either.', '2003-04-28 22:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(281441, 18911, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good perspective.  Excellent background.  Shame about the wires.  Horses are so majestic and you''ve really captured that using this upward perspective.  Nice job - 8</td>', 'Good perspective.  Excellent background.  Shame about the wires.  Horses are so majestic and you''ve really captured that using this upward perspective.  Nice job - 8', '2003-04-28 22:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(281449, 18334, 6325, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the BIG MOUTH. Shows the flesh tones in the cheeks.</td>', 'Great capture of the BIG MOUTH. Shows the flesh tones in the cheeks.', '2003-04-28 22:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(281450, 19198, 6325, '<td valign="top">You did a good job of capturing the weird eye. Nice texture in the skin. Background would have been better (IMO) more out of focus.</td>', 'You did a good job of capturing the weird eye. Nice texture in the skin. Background would have been better (IMO) more out of focus.', '2003-04-28 22:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(281451, 19183, 4267, '<td valign="top">quick where''s my rifle! dinner time!</td>', 'quick where''s my rifle! dinner time!', '2003-04-28 22:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(281452, 19018, 6325, '<td valign="top">The water does look like quicksilver. Would like to have seen more of the swan.</td>', 'The water does look like quicksilver. Would like to have seen more of the swan.', '2003-04-28 22:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(281456, 18693, 6325, '<td valign="top">The high contrast works well. Not crazy about the color effect.</td>', 'The high contrast works well. Not crazy about the color effect.', '2003-04-28 22:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(281461, 19030, 6325, '<td valign="top">Creates a contempative mood. Soft colors and focus are good in this shot.</td>', 'Creates a contempative mood. Soft colors and focus are good in this shot.', '2003-04-28 22:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(281463, 18562, 6325, '<td valign="top">I wish had one of these in my back yard. Composition is very good. I think the colors could have been more saturated.</td>', 'I wish had one of these in my back yard. Composition is very good. I think the colors could have been more saturated.', '2003-04-28 23:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(281464, 18556, 6325, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors. Well focused.</td>', 'Stunning colors. Well focused.', '2003-04-28 23:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(281467, 18360, 6325, '<td valign="top">I think he missed a spot when flossing. Very good tones captured well.</td>', 'I think he missed a spot when flossing. Very good tones captured well.', '2003-04-28 23:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(281472, 18728, 4811, '<td valign="top">My take is that cropping out any part of the image that contains water (leaving a panorma that consists of the lower 3rd to 1/2 of the photo) produces an almost abstract shot thats more appealing  to me. What immediately draws me to the photo is the mass of alligators looking in different directions and the muddy, refelective water draws your eyes away from all the action.</td>', 'My take is that cropping out any part of the image that contains water (leaving a panorma that consists of the lower 3rd to 1/2 of the photo) produces an almost abstract shot thats more appealing  to me. What immediately draws me to the photo is the mass of alligators looking in different directions and the muddy, refelective water draws your eyes away from all the action.', '2003-04-28 23:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(281473, 18962, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good pose.</td>', 'Good pose.', '2003-04-28 23:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(281474, 18435, 4811, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and composition, only looks slightly underexposed. A small levels tweaking would fix this.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and composition, only looks slightly underexposed. A small levels tweaking would fix this.', '2003-04-28 23:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(281477, 19054, 5822, '<td valign="top">Super rich colors...very nicely done.</td>', 'Super rich colors...very nicely done.', '2003-04-28 23:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(281478, 18721, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is almost a really great capture.  If it were only a little clearer in terms of the subject.  The car could remain blurred with little ill effect but the subject should be clearer.  Really close.  Good effort</td>', 'This is almost a really great capture.  If it were only a little clearer in terms of the subject.  The car could remain blurred with little ill effect but the subject should be clearer.  Really close.  Good effort', '2003-04-28 23:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(281481, 18326, 3540, '<td valign="top">The lighting might be just a little too flat or the exposure a little too long.  These are really nice subjects for this picture and the picture for the most part is pretty well done.  Nice work</td>', 'The lighting might be just a little too flat or the exposure a little too long.  These are really nice subjects for this picture and the picture for the most part is pretty well done.  Nice work', '2003-04-28 23:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(281483, 18574, 3540, '<td valign="top">This isn''t too bad really, but the sky color is really not helping this bird.  A richer bluer sky would really bring out the bird a little more.  I think if it were me I''d sacrifice a little with a slightly oversaturated sky to make the bird stand out more.  Just a thought....</td>', 'This isn''t too bad really, but the sky color is really not helping this bird.  A richer bluer sky would really bring out the bird a little more.  I think if it were me I''d sacrifice a little with a slightly oversaturated sky to make the bird stand out more.  Just a thought....', '2003-04-28 23:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(281484, 18441, 6325, '<td valign="top">Even with no animal (fauna) in sight, it''s a good photography. With my patented scoring system, a better than average composition and execution gets a five. Would have been an eight with a bug.</td>', 'Even with no animal (fauna) in sight, it''s a good photography. With my patented scoring system, a better than average composition and execution gets a five. Would have been an eight with a bug.', '2003-04-28 23:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(281485, 18804, 6325, '<td valign="top">Everything just fades together.</td>', 'Everything just fades together.', '2003-04-28 23:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(281486, 18955, 3540, '<td valign="top">If that wire in front of the horse didn''t play such a prominent part of this photo I would be apt to rate it quite a bit higher but unfortunately its very distracting.  I like the high-keyness of the photo and the old look to it.</td>', 'If that wire in front of the horse didn''t play such a prominent part of this photo I would be apt to rate it quite a bit higher but unfortunately its very distracting.  I like the high-keyness of the photo and the old look to it.', '2003-04-28 23:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(281487, 19131, 3540, '<td valign="top">Can''t say I recall seeing the face of a porcupine so close.  Very cute with the vegetation on his nose.  Generally all the pictures we see focus on their quills and not so much on their faces.  This is really well done.</td>', 'Can''t say I recall seeing the face of a porcupine so close.  Very cute with the vegetation on his nose.  Generally all the pictures we see focus on their quills and not so much on their faces.  This is really well done.', '2003-04-28 23:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(281488, 18980, 5822, '<td valign="top">I think you did a marvelous job on focus and exposure, but I find the compostion to be too busy and do not like the bars of the cage.</td>', 'I think you did a marvelous job on focus and exposure, but I find the compostion to be too busy and do not like the bars of the cage.', '2003-04-28 23:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(281489, 18518, 6870, '<td valign="top">Who''d have thought that a cow could be this lovely. Nice lighting, colors. Rule of Thirds may have added a bit more interest, but superb work.</td>', 'Who''d have thought that a cow could be this lovely. Nice lighting, colors. Rule of Thirds may have added a bit more interest, but superb work.', '2003-04-28 23:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(281491, 18927, 3540, '<td valign="top">The green stripe around the photo has to go.  As for the photo itself, its almost really good.  A little more DOF and you''d have me, but at least the subject should be in focus here.  This shot has some real potential though.</td>', 'The green stripe around the photo has to go.  As for the photo itself, its almost really good.  A little more DOF and you''d have me, but at least the subject should be in focus here.  This shot has some real potential though.', '2003-04-28 23:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(281492, 19054, 6325, '<td valign="top">Impactful colors. I think shooting with all of the snail and part of the flower would have been a better composition.</td>', 'Impactful colors. I think shooting with all of the snail and part of the flower would have been a better composition.', '2003-04-28 23:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(281493, 18360, 6870, '<td valign="top">Creative idea! And oh such nice photography all around. Woohoo! Hope it does well! 9</td>', 'Creative idea! And oh such nice photography all around. Woohoo! Hope it does well! 9', '2003-04-28 23:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(281494, 18677, 3540, '<td valign="top">The varying sizes of the birds which I feel is attributed to their proximity to the camera is very well done.  I think I''d have cropped a little of the gorgeous blue sky out to get just a little closer.  Overall as is its pretty good though</td>', 'The varying sizes of the birds which I feel is attributed to their proximity to the camera is very well done.  I think I''d have cropped a little of the gorgeous blue sky out to get just a little closer.  Overall as is its pretty good though', '2003-04-28 23:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(281496, 19120, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely pastoral. It  highlights the animals,too. Nice work.</td>', 'Lovely pastoral. It  highlights the animals,too. Nice work.', '2003-04-28 23:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(281497, 18765, 3540, '<td valign="top">THis is the best bee shot so far.  I really think the detail on the bee came out remarkably well.  The flower is also in really good focus and its all pretty well exposed -9</td>', 'THis is the best bee shot so far.  I really think the detail on the bee came out remarkably well.  The flower is also in really good focus and its all pretty well exposed -9', '2003-04-28 23:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(281498, 18604, 3540, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors in this one.  A great shot to portray the texture of the anemone (I think that''s what it is).  The fish is just a smidge out of focus or my glasses need cleaning.  Almost exceptional, but you''ll have to settle for a really good on this one. Nice work!</td>', 'Brilliant colors in this one.  A great shot to portray the texture of the anemone (I think that''s what it is).  The fish is just a smidge out of focus or my glasses need cleaning.  Almost exceptional, but you''ll have to settle for a really good on this one. Nice work!', '2003-04-28 23:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(281499, 18734, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely water tones! Almost impressionistic! I don''t find the goose as attractive as its water. Still, nice light!</td>', 'Lovely water tones! Almost impressionistic! I don''t find the goose as attractive as its water. Still, nice light!', '2003-04-28 23:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(281501, 18347, 6870, '<td valign="top">Are these better fried or chocolate covered? Insect on right is more clear than the other, and with better light. Fun work!</td>', 'Are these better fried or chocolate covered? Insect on right is more clear than the other, and with better light. Fun work!', '2003-04-28 23:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(281502, 18869, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful texture shot.  Very well done.  Colors are good, exposure is just right so that we can still see every wrinkle.  I think you did a very good job with this shot -8</td>', 'This is a wonderful texture shot.  Very well done.  Colors are good, exposure is just right so that we can still see every wrinkle.  I think you did a very good job with this shot -8', '2003-04-28 23:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(281503, 18287, 6870, '<td valign="top">Yep. That''s a gaggle. Nice composition, tones and framing.</td>', 'Yep. That''s a gaggle. Nice composition, tones and framing.', '2003-04-28 23:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(281504, 18794, 3540, '<td valign="top">If this were just a little more focused, you''d have me sold on this pic.  Its good, but without being crystal clear it removes itself from being really exceptional</td>', 'If this were just a little more focused, you''d have me sold on this pic.  Its good, but without being crystal clear it removes itself from being really exceptional', '2003-04-28 23:56:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(281505, 18798, 6870, '<td valign="top">How do you know that it''s a baby? Just kidding. Nice macro.</td>', 'How do you know that it''s a baby? Just kidding. Nice macro.', '2003-04-28 23:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(281506, 18864, 1330, '<td valign="top">my favorite</td>', 'my favorite', '2003-04-28 23:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(281507, 18812, 6870, '<td valign="top">Crystal clear focus is appropriate here. I don''t even mind the harsh light.</td>', 'Crystal clear focus is appropriate here. I don''t even mind the harsh light.', '2003-04-28 23:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(281508, 18310, 6870, '<td valign="top">Or is it "squeak squeak?" Good composition. Reflection is nice.</td>', 'Or is it "squeak squeak?" Good composition. Reflection is nice.', '2003-04-28 23:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(281509, 19028, 6325, '<td valign="top">Looks like Jurassic Park.  Resolution is a little low.</td>', 'Looks like Jurassic Park.  Resolution is a little low.', '2003-04-28 23:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(281510, 18728, 6870, '<td valign="top">Makes ya want to jump on one, mate! Nice use of contrast and tones.</td>', 'Makes ya want to jump on one, mate! Nice use of contrast and tones.', '2003-04-28 23:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(281511, 19150, 6870, '<td valign="top">Don''t they drive you crazy! Nice use of line here.</td>', 'Don''t they drive you crazy! Nice use of line here.', '2003-04-28 23:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(281512, 18803, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones and use of focus. Really beautiful shot! Composition is perfect. 10</td>', 'Lovely tones and use of focus. Really beautiful shot! Composition is perfect. 10', '2003-04-28 23:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(281513, 19175, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good use of focus here.</td>', 'Good use of focus here.', '2003-04-29 00:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(281514, 18677, 6870, '<td valign="top">...Can''t be choosers. Nice capture. I like the simplicity of this shot.</td>', '...Can''t be choosers. Nice capture. I like the simplicity of this shot.', '2003-04-29 00:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(281515, 18865, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun action. MOtion blur would have been better than blur from out of focus. Still, you capture the essence of action and playfulness here.</td>', 'Fun action. MOtion blur would have been better than blur from out of focus. Still, you capture the essence of action and playfulness here.', '2003-04-29 00:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(281516, 19140, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice expression on this sea lion! The contrast is kind of weird to me,though. The water looks like snow? Great composition.</td>', 'Nice expression on this sea lion! The contrast is kind of weird to me,though. The water looks like snow? Great composition.', '2003-04-29 00:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(281517, 18699, 6870, '<td valign="top">Cool pet. What''s his name? Good point of view here!</td>', 'Cool pet. What''s his name? Good point of view here!', '2003-04-29 00:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(281518, 19018, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones and focus!</td>', 'Lovely tones and focus!', '2003-04-29 00:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(281520, 19139, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun shot. I wish the birds had as much focus and attention as the nest...</td>', 'Fun shot. I wish the birds had as much focus and attention as the nest...', '2003-04-29 00:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(281521, 18645, 6870, '<td valign="top">Looks stuffed, but I won''t hold it against you. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Looks stuffed, but I won''t hold it against you. Nice lighting.', '2003-04-29 00:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(281522, 18888, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever title! Nice of them to pose for you in that position!</td>', 'Clever title! Nice of them to pose for you in that position!', '2003-04-29 00:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(281523, 18742, 6870, '<td valign="top">Remarkable photo of this monkey. The light seems harsh, but composition is great.</td>', 'Remarkable photo of this monkey. The light seems harsh, but composition is great.', '2003-04-29 00:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(281524, 19126, 6870, '<td valign="top">Actually, this is a tortoise, not a turtle. And I love how you''ve placed him in the frame. The light is a bit harsh on him.</td>', 'Actually, this is a tortoise, not a turtle. And I love how you''ve placed him in the frame. The light is a bit harsh on him.', '2003-04-29 00:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(281525, 19132, 6870, '<td valign="top">Almost spooky macro! Nice tones and use of light.</td>', 'Almost spooky macro! Nice tones and use of light.', '2003-04-29 00:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(281526, 18927, 1847, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DOF, but a BIT more DOF would have been good.  The spiral on the shell would be interesting to see.</td>', 'I like the shallow DOF, but a BIT more DOF would have been good.  The spiral on the shell would be interesting to see.', '2003-04-29 00:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(281527, 19181, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition! I just wish this bird were more in focus.</td>', 'Wonderful composition! I just wish this bird were more in focus.', '2003-04-29 00:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(281528, 19167, 6325, '<td valign="top">Black and white is a good choice. Focus could have been sharper.</td>', 'Black and white is a good choice. Focus could have been sharper.', '2003-04-29 00:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(281529, 18650, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like darkness to build mood, and you''ve done that well here,but I do wish I could see this fella just a bit better.</td>', 'I like darkness to build mood, and you''ve done that well here,but I do wish I could see this fella just a bit better.', '2003-04-29 00:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(281530, 18636, 6870, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title,but I love how the chicks are looking opposite directions. Wish they were more in focus, as they are getting the attention here.</td>', 'I don''t get the title,but I love how the chicks are looking opposite directions. Wish they were more in focus, as they are getting the attention here.', '2003-04-29 00:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(281531, 18444, 6325, '<td valign="top">Very difficult to find the subject. Higher contrast might have pulled him out of the background.</td>', 'Very difficult to find the subject. Higher contrast might have pulled him out of the background.', '2003-04-29 00:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(281532, 18509, 6870, '<td valign="top">Get your finger away from that mouth! Yikes! Good lighting and excellent focus. Just great work here.</td>', 'Get your finger away from that mouth! Yikes! Good lighting and excellent focus. Just great work here.', '2003-04-29 00:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(281536, 18862, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Colors seem to be off. Deeper depth of field would have put the male in focus also.</td>', 'Good composition. Colors seem to be off. Deeper depth of field would have put the male in focus also.', '2003-04-29 00:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(281537, 18686, 6870, '<td valign="top">Light is a bit harsh, but when you see these guys, you just gotta shoot! Nice composition.</td>', 'Light is a bit harsh, but when you see these guys, you just gotta shoot! Nice composition.', '2003-04-29 00:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(281538, 18729, 6325, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen this angle before. Good composition. Nice and sharp.</td>', 'I''ve never seen this angle before. Good composition. Nice and sharp.', '2003-04-29 00:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(281539, 18729, 6870, '<td valign="top">...and you make us focus right on that eye with lines and contrasts. good job.</td>', '...and you make us focus right on that eye with lines and contrasts. good job.', '2003-04-29 00:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(281540, 19124, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones. Very pleasant photograph.</td>', 'Lovely tones. Very pleasant photograph.', '2003-04-29 00:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(281541, 18792, 6870, '<td valign="top">Too bad these are fenced in. Nice composition.The lighting is a bit harsh.</td>', 'Too bad these are fenced in. Nice composition.The lighting is a bit harsh.', '2003-04-29 00:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(281542, 18950, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! Nice expression and especially good focus.</td>', 'Fantastic! Nice expression and especially good focus.', '2003-04-29 00:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(281543, 18803, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good angle - many photographers shoot from too high up - sometimes you have to lay down on the ground. High contast and saturation gives impact.</td>', 'Good angle - many photographers shoot from too high up - sometimes you have to lay down on the ground. High contast and saturation gives impact.', '2003-04-29 00:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(281544, 18530, 6325, '<td valign="top">Colors work very well - muted except on the peafowl.</td>', 'Colors work very well - muted except on the peafowl.', '2003-04-29 00:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(281545, 18471, 6325, '<td valign="top">The shades of brown are very intriguing. Composing without the green may have enhanced this aspect.</td>', 'The shades of brown are very intriguing. Composing without the green may have enhanced this aspect.', '2003-04-29 00:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(281546, 18735, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Think the saturation is too strong.</td>', 'Good composition. Think the saturation is too strong.', '2003-04-29 00:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(281547, 19182, 6325, '<td valign="top">Tones seem spot on. A unique view of the world.</td>', 'Tones seem spot on. A unique view of the world.', '2003-04-29 00:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(281552, 18981, 6870, '<td valign="top">This heron does indeed have the focus here, well besides the date. Nice mood established.</td>', 'This heron does indeed have the focus here, well besides the date. Nice mood established.', '2003-04-29 00:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(281556, 18878, 6870, '<td valign="top">The colors of this animal are amazing, but what makes this photo work so well are the loops that lead our eye all around the photograph, and also the contrasts of colors here. Dramatic pose, too!</td>', 'The colors of this animal are amazing, but what makes this photo work so well are the loops that lead our eye all around the photograph, and also the contrasts of colors here. Dramatic pose, too!', '2003-04-29 00:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(281566, 19211, 6870, '<td valign="top">Are the rocks turtles? If so creative idea. Wonderful sky!</td>', 'Are the rocks turtles? If so creative idea. Wonderful sky!', '2003-04-29 01:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(281582, 18366, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good colors. Too bad you couldn''t get the toungue out.</td>', 'Good colors. Too bad you couldn''t get the toungue out.', '2003-04-29 01:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(281584, 18878, 6325, '<td valign="top">Well composed. Great colors.</td>', 'Well composed. Great colors.', '2003-04-29 01:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(281589, 18800, 6870, '<td valign="top">Crystal clear, and excellent composition. The waterfall keeps leading our eye back to this wonderful bird. 10</td>', 'Crystal clear, and excellent composition. The waterfall keeps leading our eye back to this wonderful bird. 10', '2003-04-29 01:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(281590, 18776, 6325, '<td valign="top">Colors are good. Backgorund handled OK. A much closer composition would have been better.</td>', 'Colors are good. Backgorund handled OK. A much closer composition would have been better.', '2003-04-29 01:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(281594, 18526, 6870, '<td valign="top">Brilliant focus and great use of framing and background! 10</td>', 'Brilliant focus and great use of framing and background! 10', '2003-04-29 01:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(281596, 19178, 6325, '<td valign="top">And does the fauna like this? Attention to the background and more lighting/exposure would have added visual impact.</td>', 'And does the fauna like this? Attention to the background and more lighting/exposure would have added visual impact.', '2003-04-29 01:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(281602, 19136, 6870, '<td valign="top">MOtion blur works here. Nice job.</td>', 'MOtion blur works here. Nice job.', '2003-04-29 01:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(281604, 18898, 6325, '<td valign="top">Great detail. Composition is very good.</td>', 'Great detail. Composition is very good.', '2003-04-29 01:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(281606, 19134, 6870, '<td valign="top">Ha! I don''t know how you mananged to get such good lighting here,but the whole image works well for me. 10</td>', 'Ha! I don''t know how you mananged to get such good lighting here,but the whole image works well for me. 10', '2003-04-29 01:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(281607, 18593, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good, tight composition. Seems over exposed/saturated.</td>', 'Good, tight composition. Seems over exposed/saturated.', '2003-04-29 01:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
