(281995, 18365, 4684, '<td valign="top">I didn''t like the flattening effect of the flash when I saw the thumbnail, but on second thought the flatness is one of the charms of this photo. It would be interesting to see it made into a kind of semi-abstract art piece. The owl''s expression is really neat too.</td>', 'I didn''t like the flattening effect of the flash when I saw the thumbnail, but on second thought the flatness is one of the charms of this photo. It would be interesting to see it made into a kind of semi-abstract art piece. The owl''s expression is really neat too.', '2003-04-29 14:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
