(282028, 19211, 6155, '<td valign="top">gorgeous picture, lovely sunset, vibrant and vivid colours, but alas no fauna 5, prob 9 or 10 if it had been landscape or sunset challenge<br/>i wish this was available as a print!</td>', 'gorgeous picture, lovely sunset, vibrant and vivid colours, but alas no fauna 5, prob 9 or 10 if it had been landscape or sunset challengei wish this was available as a print!', '2003-04-29 14:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(282035, 18368, 7711, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and great job getting most of them to look your way! It is a bit dark though, and I have this same problem with the way I take shots where the subject is dark but there is a lot of surrounding light (as it appears here, like an early morning shot), so at the risk of being impertinent, what did you focus and meter on when you took this shot?</td>', 'I really like the composition and great job getting most of them to look your way! It is a bit dark though, and I have this same problem with the way I take shots where the subject is dark but there is a lot of surrounding light (as it appears here, like an early morning shot), so at the risk of being impertinent, what did you focus and meter on when you took this shot?', '2003-04-29 14:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(282037, 18684, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear shot.  Nice amount of detail (maybe too much detail ;)  The flash was needed, I''m sure, but casts that unnatural shadow.  The ducks seem oily/dirty, true to what you saw, but less appealing.  I think I may have hard on the photo due to the subject, score upgrade from 6 to 7.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very clear shot.  Nice amount of detail (maybe too much detail ;)  The flash was needed, I''m sure, but casts that unnatural shadow.  The ducks seem oily/dirty, true to what you saw, but less appealing.  I think I may have hard on the photo due to the subject, score upgrade from 6 to 7.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-29 14:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(282038, 19030, 7711, '<td valign="top">seems a tad bit dark or underexposed, especially right bottom, but its a beautiful capture with great warm tones, I like the lighting a lot and good crop with the swan filling the frame, I think it works well!</td>', 'seems a tad bit dark or underexposed, especially right bottom, but its a beautiful capture with great warm tones, I like the lighting a lot and good crop with the swan filling the frame, I think it works well!', '2003-04-29 14:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
