(282257, 18750, 1005, '<td valign="top">I really want to like this one...cool subject.  Picture seems clear enough, but pixelated.  Zoos are such sad environments for wild big cats.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'I really want to like this one...cool subject.  Picture seems clear enough, but pixelated.  Zoos are such sad environments for wild big cats.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-29 17:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(282262, 19057, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool motion pic, for that part you''ve done very well.  Even though humans are animals, this does not work for me as a fauna challenge subject.  For a motion, or city life type challenge, I could score this very well.  6 is about the top I can go for Fauna.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cool motion pic, for that part you''ve done very well.  Even though humans are animals, this does not work for me as a fauna challenge subject.  For a motion, or city life type challenge, I could score this very well.  6 is about the top I can go for Fauna.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-29 17:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(282264, 18577, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat scene, but oh so overly saturated (restraint needed).  This is a male mallard duck (what''s with the title?).  I like your framing.  The reflections in the water look very nice, but I keep coming back to the saturation issue.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Neat scene, but oh so overly saturated (restraint needed).  This is a male mallard duck (what''s with the title?).  I like your framing.  The reflections in the water look very nice, but I keep coming back to the saturation issue.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-29 17:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(282265, 18693, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sharp image!  Good detail.  Personally, I don''t care for the coloration used.  Female mallards have lovely, subtlely colored feathers.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Sharp image!  Good detail.  Personally, I don''t care for the coloration used.  Female mallards have lovely, subtlely colored feathers.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-29 17:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(282266, 18899, 1005, '<td valign="top">Looks like a pretty long hair cat.  Did you want the reflections?  (Too bad about the overhead wires in the reflection)  A little polarization would have lowered the strength of the reflections - allow more of the cat to show through.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Looks like a pretty long hair cat.  Did you want the reflections?  (Too bad about the overhead wires in the reflection)  A little polarization would have lowered the strength of the reflections - allow more of the cat to show through.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-29 17:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(282268, 18384, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene.  I like what the dual tone did to the body of the foremost swan, nice subtle coloration, but  the shadows remove a great deal of the detail that I would have liked to have seen.  Pretty sharp, but still hard to see.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Pretty scene.  I like what the dual tone did to the body of the foremost swan, nice subtle coloration, but  the shadows remove a great deal of the detail that I would have liked to have seen.  Pretty sharp, but still hard to see.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-29 17:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(282269, 18433, 4224, '<td valign="top">doesn''t it have eight?  cool picture though, rather creepy too.</td>', 'doesn''t it have eight?  cool picture though, rather creepy too.', '2003-04-29 17:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(282270, 19180, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of (I think) inverse black and white.  The ant shows up very well, but some of the detail seems to be lost.  (Calling this Albino Ant might have confused some of these issues for the better)  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Interesting use of (I think) inverse black and white.  The ant shows up very well, but some of the detail seems to be lost.  (Calling this Albino Ant might have confused some of these issues for the better)  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-29 17:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
