(282274, 18384, 1032, '<td valign="top">The heads of the ducks/geese look fuzzy and unclear.  But I like look.</td>', 'The heads of the ducks/geese look fuzzy and unclear.  But I like look.', '2003-04-29 17:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(282276, 18591, 1005, '<td valign="top">Herd o cows - that works!  Black againt black is very hard on the details.  Image is a bit small for all this activity.  Heavy haze in the distance, probably not good, but honestly nearly out of the picture.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Herd o cows - that works!  Black againt black is very hard on the details.  Image is a bit small for all this activity.  Heavy haze in the distance, probably not good, but honestly nearly out of the picture.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-29 17:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(282277, 18743, 1032, '<td valign="top">Red Winged Blackbird is one of the mascots for my high school.  Acutally that''s what the marching band is called.  It is always announced as a symbol of the start of spring.  Your picture does justice to the bird.  Although the head of the bird looks a little out of focus.  But great capture.</td>', 'Red Winged Blackbird is one of the mascots for my high school.  Acutally that''s what the marching band is called.  It is always announced as a symbol of the start of spring.  Your picture does justice to the bird.  Although the head of the bird looks a little out of focus.  But great capture.', '2003-04-29 17:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(282278, 18842, 1032, '<td valign="top">Blurry</td>', 'Blurry', '2003-04-29 17:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(282279, 19211, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very pretty scene.  (Drop dead gorgeous! really) But I need fauna visible for this challenge, their environment isn''t quite enough (even as beautiful as this).  For a landscape, weather or even textures, this would be a fantastic submittion.  The best I can go is a 6 for this challenge.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very pretty scene.  (Drop dead gorgeous! really) But I need fauna visible for this challenge, their environment isn''t quite enough (even as beautiful as this).  For a landscape, weather or even textures, this would be a fantastic submittion.  The best I can go is a 6 for this challenge.  Rob the Swash', '2003-04-29 17:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(282281, 18512, 1005, '<td valign="top">Chickens!  Challenge met.  Very grainy and a bit dark of an image.  The grain takes away much of the detail available and subdues the color.  You might try a lower ISO setting, if available, or different lighting.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Chickens!  Challenge met.  Very grainy and a bit dark of an image.  The grain takes away much of the detail available and subdues the color.  You might try a lower ISO setting, if available, or different lighting.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-29 17:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
