(282425, 18342, 1847, '<td valign="top">This could be a really good photo.  The main problem is the (apparent) use of a flash.  Really blows out the shot.  Perhaps your camera has the capability to turn the flash down a bit.</td>', 'This could be a really good photo.  The main problem is the (apparent) use of a flash.  Really blows out the shot.  Perhaps your camera has the capability to turn the flash down a bit.', '2003-04-29 22:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(282426, 19150, 6771, '<td valign="top">This is the best idea I have seen!  It is very interesting how they all lined up around there.  Is kind of funny too.  Not the greatest of focus, could be tighter, but I am giving it a 9 for the best idea.</td>', 'This is the best idea I have seen!  It is very interesting how they all lined up around there.  Is kind of funny too.  Not the greatest of focus, could be tighter, but I am giving it a 9 for the best idea.', '2003-04-29 22:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(282427, 19017, 1847, '<td valign="top">Really like how this one is kinda overexposed.</td>', 'Really like how this one is kinda overexposed.', '2003-04-29 22:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(282428, 18950, 1847, '<td valign="top">Hilarious shot.  He actually looks a little puzzled.  Plus, it''s very well exposed!</td>', 'Hilarious shot.  He actually looks a little puzzled.  Plus, it''s very well exposed!', '2003-04-29 22:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(282429, 18380, 6771, '<td valign="top">Spectacular colors.  Love the crab in the bottom right corner.  Also the little white one.  A little tighter focus, but a 9, also for original<br/></td>', 'Spectacular colors.  Love the crab in the bottom right corner.  Also the little white one.  A little tighter focus, but a 9, also for original', '2003-04-29 22:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(282430, 19156, 1847, '<td valign="top">Maybe a wider crop, giving more of a context to the duck would help the photo.</td>', 'Maybe a wider crop, giving more of a context to the duck would help the photo.', '2003-04-29 22:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(282432, 18689, 6771, '<td valign="top">Another great and original idea...seen only about 5.  Love the tire (society), kind of shows how WE intrude on others lives.</td>', 'Another great and original idea...seen only about 5.  Love the tire (society), kind of shows how WE intrude on others lives.', '2003-04-29 22:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(282433, 18905, 6771, '<td valign="top">Fabulous capture.  Excellent silhouette.  Not a fan of borders but still an 8</td>', 'Fabulous capture.  Excellent silhouette.  Not a fan of borders but still an 8', '2003-04-29 22:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(282434, 19064, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Very good focus and DOF field even with flying birds and most likely moving boat.   8</td>', 'Nice capture.  Very good focus and DOF field even with flying birds and most likely moving boat.   8', '2003-04-29 22:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(282436, 18607, 6771, '<td valign="top">Macro of Microfauna (sorta).  Love the black and white, and the impications of there are many struggles no matter how small.   8</td>', 'Macro of Microfauna (sorta).  Love the black and white, and the impications of there are many struggles no matter how small.   8', '2003-04-29 22:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(282438, 18950, 6771, '<td valign="top">I just love the "expression" on this birds face!   Hysterical.  SOmething like.."what the hell are you doing?  What are you looking at?  Are my privates showing?"   LOL  Love this  7</td>', 'I just love the "expression" on this birds face!   Hysterical.  SOmething like.."what the hell are you doing?  What are you looking at?  Are my privates showing?"   LOL  Love this  7', '2003-04-29 22:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(282441, 18981, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot.  Love the lone heron (?).  Of course the date stamp needs to be gone.  I was criticized on my flora shot because it was said by one that the subject was more the background/sunset.  I think that there is fauna here, it is just a beautiful backdrop.  Just as if someone set one up in their studio.  Great shot</td>', 'Very pretty shot.  Love the lone heron (?).  Of course the date stamp needs to be gone.  I was criticized on my flora shot because it was said by one that the subject was more the background/sunset.  I think that there is fauna here, it is just a beautiful backdrop.  Just as if someone set one up in their studio.  Great shot', '2003-04-29 22:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(282446, 18697, 8155, '<td valign="top">I quite like this photo. Seems a bit light to me at the bottom but hey, what do I know?</td>', 'I quite like this photo. Seems a bit light to me at the bottom but hey, what do I know?', '2003-04-29 22:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(282447, 19099, 8155, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the background was meant to be blured but it just seems a bit to much for my liking. I keep looking at that, otherwise a really nice picture.</td>', 'I''m sure the background was meant to be blured but it just seems a bit to much for my liking. I keep looking at that, otherwise a really nice picture.', '2003-04-29 22:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
