(282466, 18447, 4267, '<td valign="top">superior lighting, DoF, and focus... damn I wish I could get my macros that sharp.. this one rocks.. the pollen in the air really makes it... a better angle on the bee would make it a more powerful subject.. right now the flower shares much of the limelight, and ths is about the animals... however the quality is still so high I will give it at least a 9 if not a 10...</td>', 'superior lighting, DoF, and focus... damn I wish I could get my macros that sharp.. this one rocks.. the pollen in the air really makes it... a better angle on the bee would make it a more powerful subject.. right now the flower shares much of the limelight, and ths is about the animals... however the quality is still so high I will give it at least a 9 if not a 10...', '2003-04-29 23:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
