(282570, 18556, 3669, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your win!!  It''s an absolutely stunning photo!  Good news for us Canon Powershot A40 users.  I do have hope!</td>', 'Congrats on your win!!  It''s an absolutely stunning photo!  Good news for us Canon Powershot A40 users.  I do have hope!', '2003-04-30 01:04:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(282571, 18556, 6505, '<td valign="top">YESSS!!!  I won a ribbon...I won a ribbon!!  Sweet!<br/> <br/>Thanks to everyone and to my little anole friend for displaying for me.  And thanks to my Powershot Canon A-series friends for helping me become a better photographer.  Not bad for a 2MP camera.  <br/> <br/>YES!!!</td>', 'YESSS!!!  I won a ribbon...I won a ribbon!!  Sweet! Thanks to everyone and to my little anole friend for displaying for me.  And thanks to my Powershot Canon A-series friends for helping me become a better photographer.  Not bad for a 2MP camera.   YES!!!', '2003-04-30 01:04:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(282572, 18556, 4162, '<td valign="top">What an absolutely fantastic shot! A well deserved win!</td>', 'What an absolutely fantastic shot! A well deserved win!', '2003-04-30 01:04:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(282575, 19113, 6325, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. Congratulations on the score.<br/> <br/>Dennis</td>', 'One of my favorites. Congratulations on the score. Dennis', '2003-04-30 01:06:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(282576, 19204, 6900, '<td valign="top">Congrats!</td>', 'Congrats!', '2003-04-30 01:06:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(282577, 19183, 6900, '<td valign="top">Thanks all!  It''s fog, not blur...but I''ll forgive ya.</td>', 'Thanks all!  It''s fog, not blur...but I''ll forgive ya.', '2003-04-30 01:07:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(282581, 18528, 2586, '<td valign="top">Well Jubei, i feel you deserve a ribbon more than that other shot (although i gave 10s to both) as technically this is far by the more demanding of the two shots and imho the more sophisticated.. I read some comments here about the shadows; didn''t bother me at all, just loved the detail on the beak. Anyway, still a good score and a great picture (which is the most important).</td>', 'Well Jubei, i feel you deserve a ribbon more than that other shot (although i gave 10s to both) as technically this is far by the more demanding of the two shots and imho the more sophisticated.. I read some comments here about the shadows; didn''t bother me at all, just loved the detail on the beak. Anyway, still a good score and a great picture (which is the most important).', '2003-04-30 01:09:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(282582, 19204, 7711, '<td valign="top">thanks so much for the comments. I was a bit limited by both my equipment, which seems to love soft focus on everything! and the fact that I couldn''t exactly pick the lighting on these guys. If I had seen indigo''s jellyfish before I submitted this, I probably wouldn''t have! :) I tried to play with levels,etc, but there just wasn''t the info there to bring these guys out.</td>', 'thanks so much for the comments. I was a bit limited by both my equipment, which seems to love soft focus on everything! and the fact that I couldn''t exactly pick the lighting on these guys. If I had seen indigo''s jellyfish before I submitted this, I probably wouldn''t have! :) I tried to play with levels,etc, but there just wasn''t the info there to bring these guys out.', '2003-04-30 01:10:10.000000', NULL, 0),
