(283045, 18898, 472, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments!  I nicknamed this guy ''Mr. Studly'' because he''s just such a dude.  I thought for sure he''d win! :) <br/> <br/>For those who were wondering - this guy is not tame or domesticated or fed.  I had to stalk him very very carefully and slowly and painstakingly and then when he looked out from around his tree to see where I was, blammo, I got his pic!  This is almost a 100% crop, which is why it looks a little grainy.<br/> <br/>More squirrels (and other fauna) here -- <a href="//www.pbase.com/magnetic9999/gallery/ff" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">LINK</a></td>', 'Thanks for the comments!  I nicknamed this guy ''Mr. Studly'' because he''s just such a dude.  I thought for sure he''d win! :)  For those who were wondering - this guy is not tame or domesticated or fed.  I had to stalk him very very carefully and slowly and painstakingly and then when he looked out from around his tree to see where I was, blammo, I got his pic!  This is almost a 100% crop, which is why it looks a little grainy. More squirrels (and other fauna) here -- LINK', '2003-04-30 09:24:16.000000', NULL, 0),
