(283413, 19123, 2382, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ricky Cleave:</b></div><hr/><i>they always fly of before you can get close enough. are you sure its not a stork?</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I can assure you this is a Blue Heron, one of my favorites.  Unfortunately my shutter speed was a bit too slow to stop the slower forward movement and put him in better focus but I kinda like the blurred effect.  Thanks for all the comments on my first submission!</td>', 'Originally posted by Ricky Cleave:they always fly of before you can get close enough. are you sure its not a stork?  I can assure you this is a Blue Heron, one of my favorites.  Unfortunately my shutter speed was a bit too slow to stop the slower forward movement and put him in better focus but I kinda like the blurred effect.  Thanks for all the comments on my first submission!', '2003-04-30 12:55:07.000000', NULL, 0),
