(284045, 18751, 2586, '<td valign="top">I''ll be darned, not a macro! And i resent the fact that you proclaim that out of principle you never crop and then end up doing it big time. Whenever i was working on my pictures, i recalled that post and felt so pitiful that i needed to resort so often to cropping. <br/>Funny too, that Gordon said that the saturation hurts his eyes. I really love the colors and it was me who criticized Rockwell''s colors :) Thx for the channel mixer tip; for pictures, i tended to use hue/sat.</td>', 'I''ll be darned, not a macro! And i resent the fact that you proclaim that out of principle you never crop and then end up doing it big time. Whenever i was working on my pictures, i recalled that post and felt so pitiful that i needed to resort so often to cropping. Funny too, that Gordon said that the saturation hurts his eyes. I really love the colors and it was me who criticized Rockwell''s colors :) Thx for the channel mixer tip; for pictures, i tended to use hue/sat.', '2003-04-30 20:33:10.000000', NULL, 0),
