(293620, 18892, 714, '<td valign="top">I just read comment.  It is a bummer when you forget to reset your camera settings.  I went out the other day and forgot to reset my picture size. When I got back home all my pictures were really small.  grrrr....<br/>The picture isn''t to bad.  I just can''t believe how big he is.  What a creepy looking bug.</td>', 'I just read comment.  It is a bummer when you forget to reset your camera settings.  I went out the other day and forgot to reset my picture size. When I got back home all my pictures were really small.  grrrr....The picture isn''t to bad.  I just can''t believe how big he is.  What a creepy looking bug.', '2003-05-09 17:47:30.000000', NULL, 0),
