(306447, 18763, 2586, '<td valign="top">Man, this is beautiful.<br/>It''s because of pictures like this, that i hate myself at times. During voting had only given it a 7. I spent a lot of time on voting and commenting, and each week there are a couple that i just miss and don''t give them the time of day they deserve (that''s my biggest qualm of having to vote on 300+ pictures a week on a slow modem).</td>', 'Man, this is beautiful.It''s because of pictures like this, that i hate myself at times. During voting had only given it a 7. I spent a lot of time on voting and commenting, and each week there are a couple that i just miss and don''t give them the time of day they deserve (that''s my biggest qualm of having to vote on 300+ pictures a week on a slow modem).', '2003-05-25 15:15:26.000000', NULL, 0),
