(377568, 19113, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!  Love the sentiment.  It was worth the effort of carrying all that gear.  (Small suggestion - get a cart at an office supply store - so much easier to pull than to carry)</td>', 'Wonderful shot!  Love the sentiment.  It was worth the effort of carrying all that gear.  (Small suggestion - get a cart at an office supply store - so much easier to pull than to carry)', '2003-08-05 20:04:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(377572, 19105, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, lovely shot.  I wish I would have looked at this one a little longer during the voting.  I gave this a 7, but I should have gone an 8 or maybe even a 9.  The moon is both a nice touch and a distraction, mostly due to it''s lack of clarity (and through the brush).  On the other hand, this was a photo of opportunity and for that, I usually score up a bit extra.  (No posing, shot might not stay around "all day")</td>', 'Wow, lovely shot.  I wish I would have looked at this one a little longer during the voting.  I gave this a 7, but I should have gone an 8 or maybe even a 9.  The moon is both a nice touch and a distraction, mostly due to it''s lack of clarity (and through the brush).  On the other hand, this was a photo of opportunity and for that, I usually score up a bit extra.  (No posing, shot might not stay around "all day")', '2003-08-05 20:08:39.000000', NULL, 0),
